  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Detail Specificity**\n\nI\'m verifying the request\'s specific details. I\'m focusing on ensuring no simulated grid maps or remnants of `\"182 \304\220i\341\273\207n Bi\303\252n Ph\341\273\247\"` are present in the codebase. Every point in the task has a clear direction.\n\n\n**Confirming Code Integrity**\n\nI\'ve just finished a thorough `grep` check to confirm the removal of any lingering traces of the old address. I\'ve ensured `maplibre-gl`, `CARTO Dark Matter`, geolocation, and Geoapify Places API integrations remain clean and operational. The critical update to `mapMarkers.ts` is complete: Safe Station markers are now clean circular icons.\n\n\n**Refining Icon Interactions**\n\nI\'m now refining the station icon interactions for optimal user experience. I\'ve considered accessibility and touch targets for mobile, specifically the button hit area vs. the visual circle. I\'m focusing on the best way to handle station name display on map clicks. Also, I\'m integrating logic to account for a user clicking a map marker during \"Step 2\" (pickup).\n\n\n**Optimizing Mobile Layout**\n\nI\'m now focusing on optimizing the mobile layout. I\'ve ensured the bottom sheet on the home screen occupies a maximum of 32% of the viewport height, leaving the rest for the map. I\'ve adjusted viewport padding for idle and route views and removed unnecessary elements from the home screen, keeping only three core components. My aim is to maintain a sleek, user-friendly interface.\n\n\n**Analyzing UI Flow**\n\nI\'m now carefully analyzing the UI flow for the home screen\'s bottom sheet, and quick-select interactions. I\'m focusing on the behavior of the `\"T\303\254m Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n \304\221\303\242y (24/7) \342\206\222\"` button and the \"Quay l\341\272\241i\" button in Step 2, ensuring smooth navigation back to the correct state depending on user input and prior selections. The critical path is to have the UI behave intuitively, no matter how the user progresses through the workflow.\n\n\n**Clarifying Button Behavior**\n\nI\'m now clarifying the button interactions. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the behavior of the `\"T\303\254m Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n \304\221\303\242y (24/7) \342\206\222\"` button: when clicked, it *immediately* transitions to Step 2, setting `pickupMode` to `\'safe_station\'` to render the station list and draw an OSRM walking route. If the user then clicks `\"X\303\241c nh\341\272\255n g\341\273\215i c\341\273\251u h\341\273\231\"` without selecting an issue, I\'m integrating logic to guide them seamlessly to issue selection (Step 1) or advance automatically. I\'m exploring different transitions for the workflow to make it super user-friendly.\n\n\n**Refining Rescue Flow**\n\nI\'m now refining the rescue flow. I\'m focusing on the case where a user browses stations via `\"T\303\254m Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n \304\221\303\242y (24/7) \342\206\222\"` in Step 2, and then immediately clicks `\"X\303\241c nh\341\272\255n g\341\273\215i c\341\273\251u h\341\273\231\"`. I\'m integrating logic to ensure `selectedIssue === null` is handled gracefully. I\'m considering a fallback like `\"C\341\273\251u h\341\273\231 xe m\303\241y kh\341\272\251n c\341\272\245p\"` in `issueSummary`, or perhaps an optional quick issue selector right there. I want to avoid silently assigning an issue.\n\n\n**Polishing UI Detail**\n\nI\'ve got the rescue flow down! Clicking \"Quay l\341\272\241i\" from Step 2 will return to idle if no issue is selected, or issue selection if it\'s Step 1. That\'s smooth. Now, I\'m focusing on UI polish: completely hiding browser scrollbars with the provided CSS on scrollable areas across `IdleHomeStep`, `IssueSelectionStep`, `PickupSelectionStep`, and `TrackingStep`. Also, I\'m shrinking the top overlay cluster with a compact \"MotoSOS\" logo and a super compact \"Test th\341\273\243\" button with touch ergonomics in mind.\n\n\n**Implementing UI Refinements**\n\nI\'m now implementing the latest UI refinements for a cleaner, more compact experience. I\'m focusing on the `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` button, applying `text-xs px-2.5 py-1.5` for a super-small size that never overlaps map markers, and ensuring clean contrast with a focus ring. I\'m applying these changes in `mapMarkers.ts`, `mapLayers.ts`, `TopOverlayBar.tsx`, and `BottomSheetShell.tsx`. I will keep the text super short!\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7395331110695769215"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import type { SafeStation, SafeStationCategory } from \'../../types/rescue\';\\n\\nfunction getCategorySvgMarkup(category: SafeStationCategory): string {\\n  if (category === \'convenience\') {\\n    return `<svg width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"m2 7 4.41-4.41A2 2 0 0 1 7.83 2h8.34a2 2 0 0 1 1.42.59L22 7\\\"/><path d=\\\"M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8\\\"/><path d=\\\"M15 22v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\\\"/><path d=\\\"M2 7h20\\\"/><path d=\\\"M22 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 16 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 12 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 8 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 4 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7\\\"/></svg>`;\\n  }\\n  if (category === \'gas_station\') {\\n    return `<svg width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"15\\\" y1=\\\"22\\\" y2=\\\"22\\\"/><line x1=\\\"4\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"9\\\" y2=\\\"9\\\"/><path d=\\\"M14 22V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v18\\\"/><path d=\\\"M14 13h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9.83a2 2 0 0 0-.59-1.42L18 5\\\"/></svg>`;\\n  }\\n  return `<svg width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\\\"/></svg>`;\\n}\\n\\nexport function createUserMarkerElement(isSearching: boolean): HTMLDivElement {\\n  const wrapper = document.createElement(\'div\');\\n  wrapper.className = \'relative flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\';\\n  wrapper.setAttribute(\'aria-label\', \'V\341\273\213 tr\303\255 hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n\');\\n\\n  const radarRing = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n  radarRing.className = isSearching\\n    ? \'absolute h-20 w-20 rounded-full border border-amber-400/50 bg-amber-500/15 animate-ping\'\\n    : \'absolute h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-sky-400/30 animate-ping\';\\n\\n  const halo = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n  halo.className = \'absolute h-7 w-7 rounded-full bg-sky-500/25\';\\n\\n  const dot = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n  dot.className =\\n    \'relative h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-sky-500 shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/60\';\\n\\n  wrapper.appendChild(radarRing);\\n  wrapper.appendChild(halo);\\n  wrapper.appendChild(dot);\\n  return wrapper;\\n}\\n\\nexport function createStationMarkerElement(\\n  station: SafeStation,\\n  isHighlighted: boolean,\\n  onClick: () => void,\\n): HTMLButtonElement {\\n  const button = document.createElement(\'button\');\\n  button.type = \'button\';\\n  button.setAttribute(\\n    \'aria-label\',\\n    `${station.name}, ${station.categoryLabel}, ${station.walkingDistanceMeters}m \302\267 ${station.walkingMinutes} ph\303\272t \304\221i b\341\273\231`,\\n  );\\n  button.setAttribute(\'aria-pressed\', String(isHighlighted));\\n  button.className =\\n    \'group flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full focus:outline-none cursor-pointer\';\\n  button.addEventListener(\'click\', (event) => {\\n    event.stopPropagation();\\n    onClick();\\n  });\\n\\n  const circle = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n  circle.className = isHighlighted\\n    ? \'flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/45 scale-110 transition-transform\'\\n    : \'flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-md shadow-black/50 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\';\\n  circle.innerHTML = getCategorySvgMarkup(station.category);\\n\\n  button.appendChild(circle);\\n  return button;\\n}\\n\\nexport function createMechanicMarkerElement(\\n  mechanicName: string,\\n  etaMinutes: number,\\n  isCompleted: boolean,\\n): HTMLDivElement {\\n  const wrapper = document.createElement(\'div\');\\n  wrapper.className = \'flex flex-col items-center pointer-events-none\';\\n\\n  const iconBox = document.createElement(\'div\');\\n  iconBox.className =\\n    \'flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-slate-950 bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/40\';\\n  iconBox.innerHTML = `<svg width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\\\"/></svg>`;\\n\\n  const label = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n  label.className =\\n    \'mt-1 rounded-md bg-amber-500 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-950 whitespace-nowrap shadow\';\\n  const shortName = mechanicName.split(\' \').pop() || mechanicName;\\n  label.textContent = isCompleted\\n    ? \'Th\341\273\243 \304\221\303\243 \304\221\341\272\277n\'\\n    : `Th\341\273\243 ${shortName} \302\267 ${etaMinutes}p`;\\n\\n  wrapper.appendChild(iconBox);\\n  wrapper.appendChild(label);\\n  return wrapper;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Render Safe Stations strictly as clean w-8 h-8 circular emerald icon buttons without text boxes underneath\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/map/mapMarkers.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Simplifying Safe Station map markers\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update mapMarkers.ts\"}"
