  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Component Structure**\n\nI\'m now focusing on surgically editing the `/src/components/steps/IdleHomeStep.tsx` file. The goal is to strip the title, subtitle, and four-station list entirely. I\'ll retain only the three requested elements, housing them within a compact container that hides scrollbars. This streamlined structure is the current priority.\n\n\n**Implementing Scrollbar Adjustments**\n\nI\'m now implementing the scrollbar adjustments across the specified files. Specifically, I\'m adding `[&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden [-ms-overflow-style:none] [scrollbar-width:none]` to the `overflow-y-auto` divs in `IssueSelectionStep.tsx`, `PickupSelectionStep.tsx`, and all three in `TrackingStep.tsx`. Also, I\'m adjusting the station marker anchor in `RescueMap.tsx` from \'top\' to \'center\' for cleaner icon centering. I\'m focusing on ensuring these changes integrate smoothly with the existing structure.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_10016008036335398458"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { AlertTriangle, MapPin, ShieldCheck } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type { UserLocation } from \'../../types/rescue\';\\n\\ninterface IdleHomeStepProps {\\n  userLocation: UserLocation;\\n  onStartOrder: () => void;\\n  onOpenSafeStations: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport function IdleHomeStep({\\n  userLocation,\\n  onStartOrder,\\n  onOpenSafeStations,\\n}: IdleHomeStepProps) {\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-5 pt-1 pb-4 lg:px-6 lg:pt-6 [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden [-ms-overflow-style:none] [scrollbar-width:none]\\\">\\n        {/* 1. Compact current address */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n          <MapPin className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-sky-400\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">{userLocation.address}</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* 2. Prominent Amber Primary CTA */}\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={onStartOrder}\\n          className=\\\"mt-3 flex min-h-[52px] w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500 px-5 py-3 text-base font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-950 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-150 hover:bg-amber-400 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-amber-300 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-900 active:scale-[0.98]\\\"\\n        >\\n          <AlertTriangle className=\\\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n          <span>G\341\273\214I S\341\273\254A XE KH\341\272\250N C\341\272\244P</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* 3. Quick-select Safe Stations pill */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-3 flex justify-center\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onOpenSafeStations}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex min-h-[40px] w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/35 bg-slate-950/80 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-300 transition-colors hover:border-emerald-400/60 hover:bg-emerald-950/40 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-400 active:scale-[0.99]\\\"\\n          >\\n            <ShieldCheck className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-400\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n            <span>T\303\254m Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n \304\221\303\242y (24/7) \342\206\222</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Simplify IdleHomeStep to 3 minimalist elements and hide scrollbars\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/steps/IdleHomeStep.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating IdleHomeStep.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update IdleHomeStep.tsx\"}"
