  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Creating Light Mode Components**\n\nI\'ve just focused on crafting the new light mode components. Specifically, I updated the Bottom Navigation Bar in `/src/components/BottomNavBar.tsx`, addressing its styling with `h-16 bg-white border-t border-slate`. The light mode implementation is coming along nicely!\n\n\n**Designing Home Tab Content**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the `\"Trang ch\341\273\247\"` screen for light mode, specifically `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx`. I\'ve crafted the header, including the \"Xin ch\303\240o, T\303\240i x\341\272\277\" and \"An to\303\240n 24/7\" pill with a \"Test th\341\273\243\" button. I\'m also styling the Hero Action Bar and structuring the 8-icon grid for quick actions and the safety banner at the bottom. The component breakdown includes the elements of header, 8-icon grid, action bar, and banners.\n\n\n**Implementing Tab Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing the horizontal scroll for Geoapify station cards, using `flex overflow-x-auto gap-3` styling. Clicking opens the `\"B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\"` tab with the OSRM walking route to that station. I\'m focusing on the `\"Ho\341\272\241t \304\221\341\273\231ng\"` tab in `/src/components/tabs/ActivityTab.tsx`, showing active rescue cards and history. I\'m also developing the `\"An to\303\240n\"` tab in `/src/components/tabs/SafetyTab.tsx`, incorporating safety tips, emergency call buttons, and nearby safe stations. Plus, I\'m working on light-map markers and updating padding logic for mobile routes.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_16629239952173132596"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Clock, Home, Map, ShieldCheck } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type { AppTab } from \'../types/rescue\';\\n\\ninterface BottomNavBarProps {\\n  activeTab: AppTab;\\n  hasActiveOrder: boolean;\\n  onSelectTab: (tab: AppTab) => void;\\n}\\n\\nconst NAV_ITEMS: Array<{\\n  id: AppTab;\\n  label: string;\\n  icon: typeof Home;\\n}> = [\\n  { id: \'home\', label: \'Trang ch\341\273\247\', icon: Home },\\n  { id: \'map\', label: \'B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\', icon: Map },\\n  { id: \'activity\', label: \'Ho\341\272\241t \304\221\341\273\231ng\', icon: Clock },\\n  { id: \'safety\', label: \'An to\303\240n\', icon: ShieldCheck },\\n];\\n\\nexport function BottomNavBar({\\n  activeTab,\\n  hasActiveOrder,\\n  onSelectTab,\\n}: BottomNavBarProps) {\\n  return (\\n    <nav\\n      aria-label=\\\"\304\220i\341\273\201u h\306\260\341\273\233ng ch\303\255nh\\\"\\n      className=\\\"relative z-30 grid h-16 shrink-0 grid-cols-4 items-center border-t border-slate-100 bg-white px-2\\\"\\n    >\\n      {NAV_ITEMS.map((item) => {\\n        const Icon = item.icon;\\n        const active = activeTab === item.id;\\n        return (\\n          <button\\n            key={item.id}\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onSelectTab(item.id)}\\n            aria-current={active ? \'page\' : undefined}\\n            className={`relative flex min-h-[48px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-xl transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 ${\\n              active\\n                ? \'text-emerald-600\'\\n                : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            <span className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <Icon\\n                className=\\\"h-[22px] w-[22px]\\\"\\n                strokeWidth={active ? 2.3 : 1.9}\\n                aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n              />\\n              {item.id === \'activity\' && hasActiveOrder && (\\n                <span\\n                  aria-label=\\\"\304\220ang c\303\263 \304\221\306\241n c\341\273\251u h\341\273\231\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"absolute -top-0.5 -right-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 ring-2 ring-white\\\"\\n                />\\n              )}\\n            </span>\\n            <span\\n              className={`text-[11px] tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                active ? \'font-bold text-emerald-600\' : \'font-medium text-slate-500\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {item.label}\\n            </span>\\n          </button>\\n        );\\n      })}\\n    </nav>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create fixed Clean Light Mode 4-tab BottomNavBar\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/BottomNavBar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating BottomNavBar.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create BottomNavBar.tsx\"}"
