le:ring-emerald-500 active:scale-[0.99]\"\n          >\n            <ShieldCheck className=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n            <span>T\303\254m Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n \304\221\303\242y (24/7) \342\206\222</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n"
