    thinking: "**Identifying Code Refactor**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed a couple of files exceeding the stated line limit. Specifically, `src/App.tsx` is bloated. My immediate thought is to extract the `<MapTabView />` component into a dedicated file, say `/src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx`, or alternatively, a new hook, `useRescueAppState.ts`. This decomposition will bring us closer to the design principles we want.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2341034208937382764"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Loader2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type { SafeStation, SafeStationCategory } from \'../../types/rescue\';\\nimport { formatWalkingDistance } from \'../../utils/rescueLogic\';\\nimport { Fuel, Shield, Store } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface NearbyStationsCarouselProps {\\n  stations: SafeStation[];\\n  isLoadingStations: boolean;\\n  onSelectStationCard: (stationId: string) => void;\\n  onViewMap: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nfunction StationPillIcon({ category }: { category: SafeStationCategory }) {\\n  if (category === \'convenience\') {\\n    return <Store className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-emerald-600\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />;\\n  }\\n  if (category === \'gas_station\') {\\n    return <Fuel className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-amber-600\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />;\\n  }\\n  return <Shield className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-sky-600\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />;\\n}\\n\\nexport function NearbyStationsCarousel({\\n  stations,\\n  isLoadingStations,\\n  onSelectStationCard,\\n  onViewMap,\\n}: NearbyStationsCarouselProps) {\\n  return (\\n    <section aria-label=\\\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\" className=\\\"mt-5\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        <h2 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n          Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\n        </h2>\\n        {isLoadingStations ? (\\n          <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-emerald-600\\\">\\n            <Loader2 className=\\\"h-3 w-3 animate-spin\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n            <span>\304\220ang qu\303\251t</span>\\n          </span>\\n        ) : (\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onViewMap}\\n            className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\\\"\\n          >\\n            Xem b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223 \342\206\222\\n          </button>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"mt-3 flex gap-3 overflow-x-auto pb-1 [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden [-ms-overflow-style:none] [scrollbar-width:none]\\\">\\n        {stations.map((station) => (\\n          <button\\n            key={station.id}\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onSelectStationCard(station.id)}\\n            className=\\\"flex w-[220px] shrink-0 flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 p-3.5 text-left transition-all hover:border-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-50/40 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 active:scale-[0.98]\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-xs\\\">\\n                  <StationPillIcon category={station.category} />\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-emerald-600\\\">\\n                  {formatWalkingDistance(\\n                    station.walkingDistanceMeters,\\n                    station.walkingMinutes,\\n                  )}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"mt-2.5 truncate text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                {station.name}\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"mt-0.5 truncate text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                {station.categoryLabel}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-2 truncate text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n              {station.address}\\n            </p>\\n          </button>\\n        ))}\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Extract NearbyStationsCarousel so HomeTab stays under 250 lines\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/tabs/NearbyStationsCarousel.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating NearbyStationsCarousel.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create NearbyStationsCarousel.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\340\a\n\335\a\001i\024}\023(\362r\222\022w\3671Q\312\266\243\337\300H\304\241EIN\n\244FG\2661\367\300\304^\177I\234\215\367\302\360\036\362V~is\210Wi\277\376J\177\276\300\301Tm\357~j\345c\314%\201C\0022\263\346\371Sx\254H,/\264\200\002\343\235r\3034@\325\335,9a\263\333\355\277\211(\025\225\220]R\001\002\326fm\344zG5\321\226\312\256\322f\203\005\004uC>h\200d\3227\177\311\202\311\237l\"\027\004\352\216\264D\253,\177\246n\322\375\234\276C\345\235st]\251\350\244{G\322_\\\240\032\335\362\227ZSL\025\300\227N\327u!\f\354\332\302\361;\237o3O\322\374K\227\a\223#f\333W\005n\250+\276\021\331pL\005\323+\020\353\032V\371\252c\375\177\331\270\240\"W\3711\351y\373IT\244\307\201LJq\322\226\022\204\250g\352\267\344\234\364\322@\335{\360\020\274\345l\345\314\021a8\336\344\03468\213\027\224 ^Z\336\362QaS\217l\0233\370\n\353\256\214\200\210\202\315\226\372\313\227\005\355\3048\nV\257\371^\352y\f\361\371\275\250i\313\004\352qd\346\b\241u\355\232\243\004#\331\034\222\305\302A\004\"\220\242\306\253\360\215\000\024G\035\345\245c\224yI\204\t\307\246\300\225wu\221\373\337\237\032\271\037\321\027\306\262\341\361\337\316\r\017E\340\236\253<\254P\273\224P\307\003\234\252\005\343U\0378n\323\253B\314G?\337\350|\252\206\250\346{SM\020*\342.\201\2036[\a\330\266\215\037>\257\017\254\324\231+\272\242 \017\226M\r|\a\3032Y\336\032\023R\023\207\017\257H3\030\335\343\v\224$\374\314\216<\311$\254\021\0169\357|\370\242\232\266cb 0\214\261F]n#\004\312\314\t\210E\005X\262\336}\201R\332\t\251\315\373\373 \2039\372\315\037\370C\017E\f\350rs\346\001\217\215\317\'\r\033\356f\251|\357\\\310\250O\320\256\020\252\310!\231\226k\332\374\263\213\020\023p\200\302\244A\230(E$\302Q\3165?\006?K\021k\020\365\340%\213\352xhb\370_\315\b\330\v{\313\277\250m}\277K\035/\212\b)\253*o4Zd\231U\023G\221\237\304*\005v\242J\257b\3311\326\246\257\001\253\317\303\322\326\316Q\2549\335\307\a\'\376\216c\237?\320\266\'\200g)\263\322\343\264\231\016d\307\376\273%4\354\262\371\031?\3131\325\254\221!|\242\2031kXd\377\372\\\267*G\026\256\'4y\037O\377\001.\367\001U\310\037\3039\303\326\316A\360\235~/\017\344\031r\317\221\000t,\317\253\302\234\311\205\230\3644\234r\371$\224\362)Er\235m\250\306\000Vm\377uj\204\247*\030\230\222Q<\245]\300\233\310R-M\345\224\325&u\277\214b\\\246\354\270g\3113\235{U\251UL\210\b\001\315\2521\204\371\025\036\223\'\300\310\257\375\274K\233pG\344\356\211\300\224\003.\353\275)\310\2730s\000\004\325\370\230\371\n\ft\245\217:\332&\256\037#\257\377M0\241\272Q\333m\340$\366r\353\f\372\346k\250\026f\265\347\377\376\017\023\355:\034\310jr\324\"\am\335m(\233\206`\366\025p\006\271\277\332\025\3428?E\036zvf+\301R1\342\314\301h\221JG\311\267\213\006\271\027\344;\342\263O\356KA\213*\215\347\353\034\\%\frz\032Y1\002\2467\274\363-\242\322\236rQ\362)U\261\361P\024H\361\236*K<]\274\313o\003\244L\217b\'5\357\211\221\235,\327X\a)\240|2X\370\314\226\220\344"
