  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refactoring Home Tab**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refactoring `src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx`. The goal is to extract the squircle icon grid into a new component, `/src/components/tabs/HomeActionGrid.tsx`, to keep all files under the 250-line limit. This should make the codebase easier to maintain.\n\n\n"
