  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Browser Verification**\n\nI\'m now running the initial round of browser verification. I\'ve set up Playwright CLI to check both mobile (390x844) and desktop (1440x900) resolutions. The verification includes testing the VIP Night Shield auto-carousel transition, checking the `layoutId` navigation indicator across tabs, and validating the MapLibre Positron OSRM route clearance.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8004494212339508088"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"bash -c \'\\nset -e\\ntrap \\\"playwright-cli close >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\\\" EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli\\n\\n# 1. Desktop 1440x900 Ambient Luxury shell\\nplaywright-cli open http://localhost:3000 --browser=chromium >/dev/null\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900 >/dev/null\\nsleep 3\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r11-desktop-luxury.png >/dev/null\\n\\n# 2. Mobile 390x844 Home Tab + verify VIP auto-carousel + pb-28 clearance\\nplaywright-cli resize 390 844 >/dev/null\\nsleep 1\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n  const nav = document.querySelector(\\\\\\\"nav\\\\\\\");\\n  const navTop = nav ? nav.getBoundingClientRect().top : 0;\\n  const lastCard = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\"section[aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"] button\\\\\\\")).pop();\\n  const cardBottom = lastCard ? lastCard.getBoundingClientRect().bottom : 0;\\n  const bannerTitle1 = document.querySelector(\\\\\\\"section[aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"VIP Night Shield \342\200\224 M\341\272\271o an to\303\240n ban \304\221\303\252m\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"] h2\\\\\\\")?.textContent;\\n  return {\\n    navTop: Math.round(navTop),\\n    cardBottom: Math.round(cardBottom),\\n    cardsClearNavOnInitialScroll: cardBottom < navTop,\\n    bannerTitle1\\n  };\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r11-mobile-luxury-home.png >/dev/null\\n\\n# Wait 5s to confirm VIP Night Shield auto-carousel advances automatically\\nsleep 5\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"() => ({\\n  bannerTitleAfterAutoCarousel: document.querySelector(\\\\\\\"section[aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"VIP Night Shield \342\200\224 M\341\272\271o an to\303\240n ban \304\221\303\252m\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"] h2\\\\\\\")?.textContent\\n})\\\"\\n\\n# 3. Switch to Map Tab via Station card -> verify OSRM route + pb-16 above frosted nav\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n  const btns = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\"section[aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"] button\\\\\\\"));\\n  const card = btns.find(b => b.className.includes(\\\\\\\"w-[232px]\\\\\\\"));\\n  if (card) card.click();\\n  return Boolean(card);\\n}\\\"\\nsleep 3\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r11-mobile-luxury-map.png >/dev/null\\n\\n# 4. Switch to Ho\341\272\241t \304\221\341\273\231ng tab to verify layoutId navIndicator + frosted nav\\nplaywright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n  const actTab = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\\\\\"nav button\\\\\\\")).find(b => b.textContent.includes(\\\\\\\"Ho\341\272\241t \304\221\341\273\231ng\\\\\\\"));\\n  if (actTab) actTab.click();\\n  return Boolean(actTab);\\n}\\\"\\nsleep 1\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r11-mobile-luxury-activity.png >/dev/null\\n\\nplaywright-cli console\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Running Luxury UI browser verification\", \"toolSummary\":\"Run Luxury UI verification\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\266\003\n\263\003\001i\024}\023\374r\233,\222\305\245\006C\250\004&]\360\315\375|EIT\340\250\222\030%<\230\371\314\375^\370\001XV\337\246a\313\371h\271\334\312\220/\314\340#t: \036\205\353\210e\305\235\265\177T\314Z\024-y\"sl\253\031\315\023\323\206\360\322\326\036b\326\246gy\2455f!}d\243\254\037(P@\333\203\017o\006\267\333\006\362.P5z0\340\255,\355\2774\255\324\344B\204\371\037\265\320+;\346Qbo\200E( W\036!kp\034\315`\251\337\v\361Y\221\024\274\2703\214\311\214g\245g\217o\262\003\223\361\327\203I\343?V\316\bJ\005\022\\\a\004\375\346>o\257.k5\231\2061\342\311\214\031\317\316\270\003\001\361\240\333F4\205{\256W\245\2239\361\016\275\317\201\276\344\201\301\312\226\024\247\366\224\002\376H\310\"\324\307\327\373b\356\262\266\202\301\230:\315x?\252\333\251\263:Pm\263>\260W2\226\032\"\275{\312/\352\036\t\332\"\245%\246t\333\325B\016X@\370\244\216=t0\2720eU\226\\\204?VFU\022\341\242h\305\022\356/i\223D\362(\0306\'\312A\027i>$\257\230\032\243\330\024\304<\270\001\341\301\3055\222\300\254\210P\255U\354\367\006\260\244\335F\312\240*$\313\305\360\363\264\223A\017\377u\254;h[\233\265\375\257G\017o\312\242\263\347\0228\315\020\230\313\307\333\234\251o\264\211|\263\033\024\305L6\307\314,\301\207\315\377\003\027&\273o#P*\317:\233\237\025\211\361\356\270\310\320O\2268z<L\360"
