  planner_response {
    response: "\304\220\303\243 n\303\242ng c\341\272\245p to\303\240n b\341\273\231 giao di\341\273\207n l\303\252n chu\341\272\251n **Luxury Mobile App (Xanh SM / Fintech)** v\341\273\233i h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng chuy\341\273\203n \304\221\341\273\231ng m\306\260\341\273\243t m\303\240 t\341\273\253 `motion/react` (Framer Motion) k\341\272\277t h\341\273\243p CSS keyframes, \304\221\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i gi\341\273\257 nguy\303\252n to\303\240n b\341\273\231 logic b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223 MapLibre, CARTO Positron, Geoapify Places API v\303\240 OSRM routing:\n\n### C\303\241c \304\221i\341\273\203m n\303\242ng c\341\272\245p \304\221\303\243 ho\303\240n thi\341\273\207n\n1. **Kh\303\264ng gian & \303\201nh s\303\241ng n\341\273\201n (Ambient Luxury)**:\n   - Chuy\341\273\203n n\341\273\201n khung \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i (`max-w-[430px]`) sang tr\341\272\257ng ng\303\240 **`bg-[#F8FAFC]`** k\341\272\277t h\341\273\243p \303\241nh s\303\241ng xanh ng\341\273\215c t\341\273\217a nh\341\272\271 \341\273\237 \304\221\341\272\247u trang (`bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-emerald-500/15 via-slate-50/50 to-transparent`).\n   - N\341\273\233i r\341\273\231ng kho\341\272\243ng \304\221\341\273\207m d\306\260\341\273\233i **`pb-28`** \341\273\237 c\303\241c tab cu\341\273\231n \304\221\341\273\203 d\303\243y th\341\272\273 **\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"** hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 tr\341\273\215n v\341\272\271n 100% ph\303\255a tr\303\252n thanh Bottom Navigation.\n\n2. **Chuy\341\273\203n \304\221\341\273\231ng & Vi t\306\260\306\241ng t\303\241c (Motion & Micro-interactions)**:\n   - **Staggered Entrance**: C\303\241c kh\341\273\221i tr\303\252n Trang ch\341\273\247 xu\341\272\245t hi\341\273\207n l\341\272\247n l\306\260\341\273\243t t\341\273\253 d\306\260\341\273\233i l\303\252n (`opacity: 0 \342\206\222 1`, `y: 14 \342\206\222 0`) khi m\341\273\237 app.\n   - **Hero Action Bar**: Th\341\272\273 n\341\273\225i b\303\263ng \304\221\341\273\225 \303\241nh xanh (`shadow-[0_12px_32px_-8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.28)]`), k\303\250m ch\341\272\245m xanh radar nh\341\272\245p nh\303\241y (`animate-ping`) b\303\252n tr\303\241i v\303\240 hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng \303\241nh s\303\241ng qu\303\251t ngang (`shimmer`) \304\221\341\273\213nh k\341\273\263 tr\303\252n n\303\272t **\"G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay\"**.\n   - **8 Icon squircle (`rounded-2xl`)**: N\341\273\201n gradient pastel nh\341\272\271, vi\341\273\201n s\303\241ng tinh t\341\272\277 (`ring-1 ring-inset ring-black/5`), b\303\263ng \304\221\341\273\225 m\341\273\201m v\303\240 ph\341\272\243n h\341\273\223i nh\341\272\245n n\341\272\243y v\341\272\255t l\303\275 (`whileTap={{ scale: 0.92 }}`).\n\n3. **Banner \"VIP Night Shield\" t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng tr\306\260\341\273\243t**:\n   - Thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 gradient s\303\242u (`from-emerald-600 via-teal-700 to-slate-900`) v\341\273\233i h\341\273\215a ti\341\272\277t khi\303\252n ph\303\241t s\303\241ng m\341\273\235 \341\273\237 g\303\263c ph\341\272\243i v\303\240 lu\341\273\223ng s\303\241ng l\306\260\341\273\233t nh\341\272\271 \304\221\341\273\213nh k\341\273\263.\n   - T\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng chuy\341\273\203n m\306\260\341\273\243t m\303\240 gi\341\273\257a 3 m\341\272\271o an to\303\240n ban \304\221\303\252m (4.5 gi\303\242y/l\306\260\341\273\243t) k\303\250m thanh ti\341\272\277n tr\303\254nh thu g\341\273\215n b\303\252n d\306\260\341\273\233i.\n\n4. **Th\341\272\273 Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n & Bottom Navigation k\303\255nh m\341\273\235**:\n   - Th\341\272\273 **\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"** n\341\273\201n tr\341\272\257ng tinh, vi\341\273\201n m\341\272\243nh `border-slate-200/80`, hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 t\303\252n tr\341\272\241m, lo\341\272\241i h\303\254nh 24/7, kho\341\272\243ng c\303\241ch \304\221i b\341\273\231 v\303\240 n\303\272t m\305\251i t\303\252n tr\303\262n xanh ng\341\273\215c.\n   - Thanh Bottom Navigation d\303\271ng hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng k\303\255nh m\341\273\235 (`bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-xl border-t border-slate-200/60`) v\341\273\233i thanh ch\341\273\211 b\303\241o xanh ng\341\273\215c tr\306\260\341\273\243t m\306\260\341\273\243t m\303\240 (`layoutId=\"navIndicator\"`) khi chuy\341\273\203n tab.\n\n### Ki\341\273\203m tra sau ch\341\273\211nh s\341\273\255a\n- **Unit tests**: `11/11` test logic & Geoapify/OSRM \304\221\341\272\241t.\n- **Build & Typecheck**: Bi\303\252n d\341\273\213ch v\303\240 `tsc --noEmit` th\303\240nh c\303\264ng; to\303\240n b\341\273\231 c\303\241c file ngu\341\273\223n \304\221\341\273\201u d\306\260\341\273\233i 250 d\303\262ng.\n- **Ki\341\273\203m tra tr\303\254nh duy\341\273\207t th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 (`1440\303\227900` v\303\240 `390\303\227844`)**: \304\220\303\243 x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n giao di\341\273\207n n\341\273\201n `#F8FAFC` + \303\241nh s\303\241ng xanh ng\341\273\215c \304\221\341\273\211nh trang, th\341\272\273 Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 tr\341\273\215n v\341\272\271n ph\303\255a tr\303\252n thanh \304\221i\341\273\201u h\306\260\341\273\233ng (`pb-28`), auto-carousel VIP Night Shield t\341\273\261 chuy\341\273\203n slide, thanh `navIndicator` tr\306\260\341\273\243t gi\341\273\257a c\303\241c tab v\303\240 tuy\341\272\277n \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng OSRM tr\303\252n b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223 CARTO Positron n\341\272\261m g\341\273\215n ph\303\255a tr\303\252n Bottom Sheet v\341\273\233i `0` l\341\273\227i v\303\240 `0` c\341\272\243nh b\303\241o console."
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals\' Design**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the screenshots, particularly the ambient ivory canvas with the subtle emerald glow. The `#F8FAFC` color provides a luxurious feel and the radial glow, derived from emerald-500/15, adds a depth and visual interest. I\'m exploring how these elements contribute to the overall impression.\n\n\n**Assessing UI Component Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into UI components. The floating hero bar and shimmering call-to-action really pop. I particularly like the pastel gradients on the squircle icons, offering a clean, modern aesthetic. The VIP Night Shield card\'s glowing shield and animated progress bar are also quite effective. I\342\200\231m impressed by how cleanly the Geoapify cards and emerald navigation bar integrate with the layout, especially above the frosted glass bar. I am fascinated by how cleanly the CARTO Positron map rendering and OSRM route fits.\n\n\n"
