    thinking: "**Refining Requirement Details**\n\nI\'m meticulously reviewing the requirements for \"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n,\" and I\'m focused on data formatting and text output for station safety badges. I\'ve been working in the `src/utils/rescueLogic.ts` file, and I\'ve ensured pure helper functions are used, all unit-tested in `rescueLogic.test.ts`. I also focused on removing any duplication of \"24/7\" in badge text.\n\n\n**Adapting Address Formatting**\n\nI\'m now adapting the address formatting. I\'m focusing on the `formatCompactStationAddress` function. I\'m starting by stripping unnecessary location details, like country and city names, to create concise addresses. I\'m also planning to normalize common street and district tokens from both English and Vietnamese. For HCMC, I am paying close attention to the Geoapify results to create efficient text output.\n\n\n**Refining Address Parsing**\n\nI\'m now streamlining address parsing for Vietnamese locations. Specifically, I am focusing on addresses for Ho Chi Minh City. I\'m implementing a process to strip trailing segments matching city and country names, and postal codes. I\'m also planning a conditional removal of \"Saigon\" or \"S\303\240i G\303\262n\". The goal is to generate compact and consistent address labels. I\'m working with the `\"Ly Tu Trong Street, Saigon, Ho Chi Minh City, 71016, Vietnam\"` example to test various string manipulation conditions, which should be very helpful in building the algorithm.\n\n\n**Mapping Address Elements**\n\nI\'m now mapping Saigon\'s address components for concise formatting. I\'m focusing on \"\304\220. Ly Tu Trong, Saigon\" to \"\304\220. Ly Tu Trong, Q.1,\" and streamlining \"84 L\303\252 Th\303\241nh T\303\264n, P. B\341\272\277n Ngh\303\251, Qu\341\272\255n 1\" to \"84 L\303\252 Th\303\241nh T\303\264n, Q.1,\" or `\"84 L\303\252 Th\303\241nh T\303\264n, Q.1\"`. I\'ll generalize the district mapping (`\"District N\"` or `\"Qu\341\272\255n N\"` to `\"Q.N\"`) for Vietnamese locations, and will update tests and the function in `rescueLogic.ts`.\n\n\n**Designing Carousel Cards**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the visual design for the nearby stations carousel in `NearbyStationsCarousel.tsx`. I\'m working to enhance the card design with a clean aesthetic and the use of an emerald badge for the nearest station. I\'m focusing on positioning the \"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\" badge and distance pill neatly within the top row and using the given CSS details.\n\n\n**Crafting Carousel Card Details**\n\nI\'m now implementing the carousel card details, incorporating visual elements. I\'m focusing on layout, especially positioning the \"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\" badge and distance pill. I\'m working with the CSS details provided to ensure a clean, effective design. I am also focusing on the middle section, creating station name, safety label right underneath it. I\'m focusing on the bottom row, with the address and action pill. I am taking into account the interaction and animation.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_15970760433408509658"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add getStationSafetyBadgeText and formatCompactStationAddress pure helpers to rescueLogic.ts\", \"EndLine\":135, \"Instruction\":\"Append getStationSafetyBadgeText and formatCompactStationAddress to rescueLogic.ts\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"export function buildMechanicApproachCoord(pickupCoord: GeoCoord): GeoCoord {\\n  return {\\n    lat: pickupCoord.lat - 0.0065,\\n    lng: pickupCoord.lng + 0.0058,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function getStationSafetyBadgeText(\\n  category: SafeStation[\'category\'],\\n): string {\\n  if (category === \'convenience\') return \'M\341\273\237 24/7 \342\200\242 \304\220\303\250n s\303\241ng & Camera\';\\n  if (category === \'gas_station\') return \'Tr\341\273\261c 24/7 \342\200\242 C\303\263 nh\303\242n vi\303\252n\';\\n  return \'Tr\341\273\261c ban 24/7 \342\200\242 An ninh cao\';\\n}\\n\\nexport function formatCompactStationAddress(rawAddress: string): string {\\n  const cleaned = rawAddress.trim();\\n  if (!cleaned) return \'G\341\272\247n v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i\';\\n\\n  const redundantTail =\\n    /^(vietnam|vi\341\273\207t nam|ho chi minh city|th\303\240nh ph\341\273\221 h\341\273\223 ch\303\255 minh|tp\\\\.?\\\\s*h\341\273\223 ch\303\255 minh|tp\\\\.?\\\\s*hcm|\\\\d{5,6})$/i;\\n\\n  const parts = cleaned\\n    .split(\',\')\\n    .map((part) => part.trim())\\n    .filter((part) => part.length > 0 && !redundantTail.test(part));\\n\\n  if (parts.length === 0) return \'Trung t\303\242m TP.HCM\';\\n\\n  const normalizeStreet = (street: string): string => {\\n    if (/\\\\s+street$/i.test(street) && !/^(\304\221\\\\.|\304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng)/i.test(street)) {\\n      return `\304\220. ${street.replace(/\\\\s+street$/i, \'\').trim()}`;\\n    }\\n    return street.replace(/^\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng\\\\s+/i, \'\304\220. \');\\n  };\\n\\n  const normalizeDistrict = (segment: string): string => {\\n    if (/^(saigon|s\303\240i g\303\262n|b\341\272\277n ngh\303\251|b\341\272\277n th\303\240nh|p\\\\.\\\\s*b\341\272\277n ngh\303\251|p\\\\.\\\\s*b\341\272\277n th\303\240nh)$/i.test(segment)) {\\n      return \'Q.1\';\\n    }\\n    return segment\\n      .replace(/^District\\\\s+(\\\\d+)/i, \'Q.$1\')\\n      .replace(/^Qu\341\272\255n\\\\s+(\\\\d+)/i, \'Q.$1\')\\n      .replace(/^Ph\306\260\341\273\235ng\\\\s+/i, \'P. \');\\n  };\\n\\n  const first = normalizeStreet(parts[0]);\\n  if (parts.length === 1) return first;\\n\\n  const last = normalizeDistrict(parts[parts.length - 1]);\\n  if (last.toLowerCase() === first.toLowerCase()) return first;\\n  return `${first}, ${last}`;\\n}\\n\", \"StartLine\":125, \"TargetContent\":\"export function buildMechanicApproachCoord(pickupCoord: GeoCoord): GeoCoord {\\n  return {\\n    lat: pickupCoord.lat - 0.0065,\\n    lng: pickupCoord.lng + 0.0058,\\n  };\\n}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/utils/rescueLogic.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding address & safety label formatters\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add formatting helpers to rescueLogic.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\3647\n\3617\001i\024}\023@\262\'KU\250\242\315\276\231\237\271-\037\343P\232<\237\321\a6\335\201\023>\224\245\\\'\306`\246\325bR~\350\241}\254\223E\350\r\230}^\372\326\266\002\b\"\201\201o5ZU\006\220\366\t~\234\3501\212uX\314\310\274\334\255\275\374c\205\032\362/H\203\247o\335\305\310_kO$Z\331$W\300^\211\216\364\024\214\225\005\224\237\206\026T\217\031&\304\263\210.d&\233\245\377w$\033(^\352 \245\314E\242\004\r\343\221\360\224\264\344)e\372\002>\370R\300\334\245\274\021\235\267\365x\177\332\264\243Ph\037u\"j\250\322\3568V9\317\257;/?d\031\345\244%OW\301\2540^\375\223\200\276\217\302c\202\325H\200\364&)\271\304\344\026K\r\001\005\330\2701\267`|k\213\320\246\260p+\357\244(\307\346M\257J\030\017\f<Ob\260Oj#\351\036\265\200\234<\271\r\300\0258\221\277@\307\205\255\353\263\253>\024\326\270\0262\263\306\257C\003\025\257\237mMa\tO`\322\3038\344^\375\376\326\177\024\227\236F\231|\'\326\037\034O\340\a\246Kb\244\024?K\347-\037e\026\373\0208\367W\003\240\342w\256\354B\244a\265\230^\324*\tc\223\300\210\226\270\314q\306\027\256\204u\346\357.\006\340t\020\363\302\213\245\027\216a\253%\005\314\261\247I\326y\225\b\277:\005\017X\276\314\377\034\313B\372\316\220\204$.\241y\375u=\304\n\034y*:\355g\210&S7U]\241\024Z\033\361m\251^i\306_\367\256kcU!\222\215\326\2553\2375Q\301\226\252Y\303\204/\242nqg\371C8 \365\207\210\337\027\002\365\024@7\374j\024_P\t\315X\f\"6\312K\017(M\251cy\254\021\030\036\321\304,+\a\273\344I\024k\313\376\212};\201BP\367\n\227\250~B\v\003\251v&{\241\204-[\355L\331M\206X\340\240\256$a\254\2722]Ug\206\271\271\234oH\"\025\311\240\371\344\244\0233%\256\212\204\304\n\225\355z\034\017\225#u\352\314r\'$U0[!\327\337\241\355Z\226H\217\317\240F\310\353\346\231\311\2502\377\313\006\366\257\213\353\r\242\177\240\351\320\301\333v/\203\300BO<7\203\377\204\270V\006\376z\033\270\333\330)\\\265\326\267B\225\302~v\026\000\361\231j\227\274\003q~\270\247\376UC\302\342\221\353\210\305\272\367X@X\233\017\206 \305jZG1\2149]\340\303@6\213\272\356{\306\272\