  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **MotoSOS** \342\200\224 A mobile-first emergency motorbike rescue & 24/7 Safe Station web app built with React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind CSS v4 + TypeScript + MapLibre GL + Geoapify Places API + OSRM walking route + `motion/react`.\n- **Completed Prior Work in Session**:\n  - Upgraded from dark mode to Clean Light Mode (`CARTO Positron`) inside a centered `430px` mobile shell (`max-w-[430px] h-[100dvh] mx-auto`) on `bg-slate-900`, with 4 bottom tabs (`Trang ch\341\273\247`, `B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223`, `Ho\341\272\241t \304\221\341\273\231ng`, `An to\303\240n`).\n  - Upgraded UI to **Ambient Luxury** (`bg-[#F8FAFC]`, top radial emerald glow, staggered `motion.div` entrance, floating radar Hero Action Bar with shimmer `\"G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay\"`, 8 squircle gradient icons, VIP Night Shield auto-carousel banner, frosted-glass `BottomNavBar` with `layoutId=\"navIndicator\"`, and `pb-28` clearance).\n  - Redesigned `\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"` cards (`w-[260px]`, elevated white cards, zero `<hr>`, `font-sans tabular-nums` without `font-mono`, `\"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\"` emerald badge on #1, `\"M\341\273\237 24/7 \342\200\242 \304\220\303\250n s\303\241ng & Camera\"` / `\"Tr\341\273\261c 24/7 \342\200\242 C\303\263 nh\303\242n vi\303\252n\"` concise safety cue, compact Geoapify street+district address via `formatCompactStationAddress`, and `\"\304\220i t\341\273\233i \342\206\222\"` pill).\n- **Current User Request (Latest Turn \342\200\224 Code Edited, Verification Pending)**:\n  Keep the interior design of each `\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"` card unchanged, and upgrade ONLY the horizontal carousel mechanism to native iOS + Desktop drag-to-scroll UX:\n  1. **Full-Bleed & CSS Scroll Snap**:\n     - Negative margin + compensating padding (`-mx-5 px-5 scroll-pl-5`) so cards slide edge-to-edge cleanly.\n     - Scroll snap (`flex gap-3.5 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-smooth pb-3`) with `snap-start` on each card, and hidden scrollbars (`[&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden [-ms-overflow-style:none] [scrollbar-width:none]`).\n  2. **Desktop Drag-to-Scroll**:\n     - Mouse handlers (`onMouseDown`, `onMouseMove`, `onMouseUp`, `onMouseLeave`) so PC testers can click-and-drag horizontally.\n     - Must strictly distinguish drag (`> 5px`) from click so dragging never accidentally triggers `onSelectStationCard` to jump to the Map tab.\n  3. **Dynamic Pagination Dots**:\n     - Centered row of small dots (`h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300`) directly below the carousel: active dot elongates (`w-4 bg-emerald-500`), inactive dots shrink (`w-1.5 bg-slate-300`).\n- **Constraints**:\n  - Every `.ts`/`.tsx` file under `src/` must remain strictly under **250 lines**.\n  - `ultra-mode` verification gate applies strictly after the final edit.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed & Verified Earlier (Prior Turns)\n- Real MapLibre GL (`positron-gl-style`) + `maplibre-gl-worker.mjs?url` + Geoapify Places API + OSRM walking route + `dedupe: [\'react\', \'react-dom\']` in `/vite.config.ts`.\n- All 4 tabs (`HomeTab`, `MapTabView`, `ActivityTab`, `SafetyTab`), `VipNightShieldBanner`, `HomeActionGrid`, `BottomNavBar`, `RescueMap`, `BottomSheetShell`, and 3-step rescue flow verified in prior rounds with `13/13` tests passing and `0` console errors.\n\n### Completed Code Edits in Latest Turn (NOT YET Tested/Compiled/Browser-Verified!)\n1. `/src/utils/rescueLogic.ts`: Added pure helper `computeActiveCarouselIndex(scrollLeft, maxScrollLeft, itemCount, cardStepPx = 274)` (handles end-of-scroll clamping via `scrollLeft >= maxScrollLeft - 4` and normal `Math.round(scrollLeft / cardStepPx)` indexing).\n2. `/src/utils/rescueLogic.test.ts`: Added unit test verifying `computeActiveCarouselIndex` across index 0, middle cards, end-of-scroll, and single-item edge case.\n3. `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx`: Updated horizontal padding on the main content wrapper from `px-4` to `px-5` so the carousel\'s `-mx-5 px-5 scroll-pl-5` sits exactly flush with the `430px` phone shell edges.\n4. `/src/components/tabs/NearbyStationsCarousel.tsx`: Rewritten cleanly (~190 lines) with:\n   - Full-bleed `-mx-5 px-5 scroll-pl-5` + `snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-smooth` (switching to `scroll-auto snap-none cursor-grabbing` only during active mouse drag so `scrollLeft` tracks 1:1 without CSS smooth-scroll lag, then snapping smoothly on release).\n   - `snap-start` and `draggable={false}` on each `w-[260px]` `motion.button` card (preserving exact card interior design).\n   - Mouse drag refs (`isPointerDownRef`, `startXRef`, `startScrollLeftRef`, `didDragRef`) + `onClickCapture` intercepting `click` when `didDragRef.current` is `true` (`|dx| > 5px`), plus `setTimeout(..., 0)` cleanup on mouseup/mouseleave so subsequent normal clicks work immediately.\n   - Centered dynamic pagination dots below the carousel (`h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300`, active `w-4 bg-emerald-500`, inactive `w-1.5 bg-slate-300`) wired both to `onScroll` and click-to-scroll (`scrollToCard(index)`).\n\n### Remaining Work\n- Run unit tests, line-count check, `compile_applet`, and `lint_applet`.\n- Call `restart_dev_server`.\n- Run 1 targeted `playwright-cli` browser verification round inspecting the carousel visually and testing real mouse drag (> 5px), pagination dot updates, and normal click navigation.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Vite 8 + `motion/react`**: `motion` (`^12.23.24` in `package.json`, powered by `framer-motion` v12) caused a null `useContext` crash early in the session until `resolve: { dedupe: [\'react\', \'react-dom\'] }` was added to `/vite.config.ts`. With `dedupe` in place, `motion.div`, `motion.button`, `AnimatePresence`, and `layoutId` all run with `0` console errors/warnings.\n- **Drag vs Smooth-Scroll Conflict**: Assigning `el.scrollLeft` programmatically while `scroll-smooth` and `snap-mandatory` are active causes sluggish/fighting drag motion in Chromium. Switching to `scroll-auto snap-none` while `isDragging === true` and restoring `scroll-smooth snap-x snap-mandatory` on release solves this cleanly.\n- **Card Step Width**: Cards are `w-[260px]` with `gap-3.5` (`14px`), giving `CARD_STEP_PX = 274`.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Resolved across earlier turns:\n  1. `motion/react` `useContext` null in Vite 8 -> Fixed via `dedupe: [\'react\', \'react-dom\']` in `/vite.config.ts`.\n  2. `maplibre-gl` worker error in Vite dev -> Fixed via `setWorkerUrl(maplibreWorkerUrl)` in `/src/components/RescueMap.tsx`.\n  3. MapLibre `fitBounds` padding conflict -> Fixed via `map.setPadding({ top: 0, bottom: 0, left: 0, right: 0 })` + `fitMapBoundsSafely` in `/src/components/map/mapLayers.ts`.\n  4. OSRM demo server returning car-speed duration for `/foot/` -> Fixed by computing walking minutes with `estimateWalkingMinutes(dist)` in `/src/utils/mapApi.ts`.\n  5. File > 250 lines -> Extracted `HomeActionGrid.tsx`, `NearbyStationsCarousel.tsx`, `VipNightShieldBanner.tsx`, `MapTabView.tsx`, and `useRescueOrderState.ts`; all files in `src/` were `< 250` lines prior to latest edit (re-verify via `wc -l` in Step 1 below).\n- No errors encountered on the latest edits yet (pending compilation/test run).\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Skills already read and in-scope prior to latest compaction (`ultra-mode`, `frontend-design` + `references/10_mobile_touch_apps.md`, `computer-use`), though note a new context window may reload skill docs if needed (`view_file` `ultra_mode/SKILL.md` / `computer_use/SKILL.md` only if unsure of any rule).\n- Dev server is currently running code from the *previous* turn until `restart_dev_server` is called after compile/lint.\n- No open Chromium sessions left behind.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Run Unit Tests, Line-Count Audit, Compile & Lint (in parallel)**:\n   - Shell command: `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/rescueLogic.test.ts src/utils/mapApi.test.ts && find src -type f \\( -name \'*.ts\' -o -name \'*.tsx\' \\) -exec wc -l {} +` (confirm `14/14` tests pass and EVERY `.ts`/`.tsx` file is strictly `< 250` lines).\n   - Call `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in the same turn.\n   - Fix if any issue appears (e.g., if `NearbyStationsCarousel.tsx` exceeded 250 lines or TS complained).\n2. **Restart Dev Server**:\n   - Call `restart_dev_server` so port 3000 serves the new carousel code.\n3. **Run 1 Targeted Browser Verification Round (`playwright-cli`)**:\n   - Use `--browser=chromium`, `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`, and unique `.playwright-cli/r13-*.png` filenames (e.g., `.playwright-cli/r13-carousel-initial.png`, `.playwright-cli/r13-carousel-dragged.png`).\n   - Open `http://localhost:3000`, resize to `390 844` (or `1440 900` to test desktop drag inside the `430px` phone frame), wait ~4s for Geoapify stations.\n   - Verify full-bleed alignment (`scroller.getBoundingClientRect().left === phoneShell.getBoundingClientRect().left`, taking border into account), `snap-x snap-mandatory`, and initial pagination dot (`index 0` has `w-4 bg-emerald-500`, others `w-1.5 bg-slate-300`).\n   - Capture `.playwright-cli/r13-carousel-initial.png`.\n   - Perform real desktop mouse drag on the carousel (`mousemove` onto first card -> `mousedown` -> `mousemove` `-240px` in steps -> `mouseup`) via `playwright-cli` (`mousemove` / `mousedown` / `mouseup` or `run-code` `page.mouse`) and verify:\n     1. `scroller.scrollLeft > 100` (drag scrolled horizontally).\n     2. User did NOT get navigated to Tab `\"B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\"` (`section[aria-label=\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"]` is still visible!).\n     3. Wait ~600ms for scroll snap to settle -> verify pagination dot at `index 1` (or active index matching `scrollLeft`) has `w-4 bg-emerald-500`!\n   - Capture `.playwright-cli/r13-carousel-dragged.png`.\n   - Also test clicking a pagination dot (e.g., dot 3) or clicking a card `\"\304\220i t\341\273\233i\"` normally (drag < 5px) to confirm click navigation to Tab `\"B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\"` still works cleanly!\n   - Check `playwright-cli console` (confirm `0` errors / `0` warnings).\n   - Call `view_file` on both `.playwright-cli/r13-carousel-initial.png` and `.playwright-cli/r13-carousel-dragged.png` to visually inspect before finishing.\n4. **Respond to User**:\n   - Summarize changes and verification results concisely in Vietnamese without exposing internal file paths or internal system details.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Language**: Vietnamese for the final response.\n- **Ultra-Mode Gate**: Never declare completion without passing unit tests, `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and live Playwright screenshot inspection after the last code edit.\n- **Line Limit**: Every `.ts`/`.tsx` file must stay strictly `< 250` lines.\n- **Playwright CLI Rules**: Always invoke global `playwright-cli` with `--browser=chromium`, unique `.playwright-cli/*.png` filenames, and `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`.\n</summary>"
