  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Test Run**\n\nI\'m setting up a browser verification round with `playwright-cli`, specifically targeting Chromium. I\'ll be using unique filenames for screenshots and implementing an exit trap to ensure the browser closes. The initial test will involve opening `http://localhost:3000` at a desktop viewport.\n\n\n**Verifying Alignment & Drag**\n\nI\'m now focusing on verifying the carousel\'s desktop interactions. This involves checking the full-bleed alignment, scroll-snap behavior, and hidden scrollbars. I\'ll confirm the initial dot state and then test the desktop drag interaction itself. I\'ll be using mouse movements to simulate a drag, check `scrollLeft` position, and ensure the user stays on the Home tab after the drag action. I\'m also ensuring the pagination dots update correctly during the test.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_13056320546772623092"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\n  sleep 4 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const section = document.querySelector(\'section[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    const scroller = section?.querySelector(\'div.overflow-x-auto\');\\n    const shell = document.querySelector(\'main\')?.parentElement;\\n    const dots = Array.from(section?.querySelectorAll(\'div[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Ch\341\273\211 b\303\241o v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 th\341\272\273 tr\341\272\241m\\\\\\\"] button\') || []);\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      stationCount: scroller?.querySelectorAll(\'button\').length || 0,\\n      scrollerLeft: scroller?.getBoundingClientRect().left,\\n      scrollerRight: scroller?.getBoundingClientRect().right,\\n      shellLeft: shell?.getBoundingClientRect().left,\\n      shellRight: shell?.getBoundingClientRect().right,\\n      snapType: scroller ? getComputedStyle(scroller).scrollSnapType : null,\\n      dotWidths: dots.map(d => ({ w: Math.round(d.getBoundingClientRect().width), pressed: d.getAttribute(\'aria-pressed\') })),\\n      scrollLeftInitial: scroller?.scrollLeft\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r13-carousel-initial.png && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    const scroller = page.locator(\'section[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\"] div.overflow-x-auto\');\\n    const box = await scroller.boundingBox();\\n    if (!box) throw new Error(\'No carousel scroller found\');\\n    const startX = box.x + box.width * 0.72;\\n    const startY = box.y + box.height * 0.5;\\n    await page.mouse.move(startX, startY);\\n    await page.mouse.down();\\n    await page.mouse.move(startX - 240, startY, { steps: 12 });\\n    await page.mouse.up();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(700);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const section = document.querySelector(\'section[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    const scroller = section?.querySelector(\'div.overflow-x-auto\');\\n    const dots = Array.from(section?.querySelectorAll(\'div[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Ch\341\273\211 b\303\241o v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 th\341\272\273 tr\341\272\241m\\\\\\\"] button\') || []);\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      stillOnHomeTab: Boolean(section),\\n      scrollLeftAfterDrag: scroller?.scrollLeft,\\n      dotWidthsAfterDrag: dots.map(d => ({ w: Math.round(d.getBoundingClientRect().width), pressed: d.getAttribute(\'aria-pressed\') }))\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r13-carousel-dragged.png && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    const dots = page.locator(\'div[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Ch\341\273\211 b\303\241o v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 th\341\272\273 tr\341\272\241m\\\\\\\"] button\');\\n    if (await dots.count() >= 3) {\\n      await dots.nth(2).click();\\n      await page.waitForTimeout(600);\\n    }\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const section = document.querySelector(\'section[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    const scroller = section?.querySelector(\'div.overflow-x-auto\');\\n    const dots = Array.from(section?.querySelectorAll(\'div[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Ch\341\273\211 b\303\241o v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 th\341\272\273 tr\341\272\241m\\\\\\\"] button\') || []);\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      scrollLeftAfterDotClick: scroller?.scrollLeft,\\n      dotWidthsAfterDotClick: dots.map(d => ({ w: Math.round(d.getBoundingClientRect().width), pressed: d.getAttribute(\'aria-pressed\') }))\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\