  planner_response {
    response: "\304\220\303\243 n\303\242ng c\341\272\245p c\306\241 ch\341\272\277 vu\341\273\221t ngang (Horizontal Carousel) cho c\341\273\245m th\341\272\273 **Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n** m\303\240 v\341\272\253n gi\341\273\257 nguy\303\252n thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 b\303\252n trong c\341\273\247a t\341\273\253ng th\341\272\273:\n\n### Nh\341\273\257ng \304\221i\341\273\203m \304\221\303\243 ho\303\240n thi\341\273\207n\n1. **Cu\341\273\231n tr\303\240n vi\341\273\201n & Scroll Snap chu\341\272\251n iOS**:\n   - V\303\271ng cu\341\273\231n ngang \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c m\341\273\237 r\341\273\231ng tr\303\240n s\303\241t 2 m\303\251p khung \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i nh\306\260ng v\341\272\253n gi\341\273\257 kho\341\272\243ng th\341\273\237 l\341\273\201 tr\303\241i \304\221\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 khi d\341\273\253ng (`-mx-5 px-5 scroll-pl-5`), gi\303\272p th\341\272\273 tr\341\272\241m tr\306\260\341\273\243t m\306\260\341\273\243t qua m\303\251p m\303\240n h\303\254nh m\303\240 kh\303\264ng b\341\273\213 c\341\272\257t h\341\273\245t.\n   - B\341\272\255t CSS Scroll Snap (`snap-x snap-mandatory`, `snap-start` tr\303\252n t\341\273\253ng th\341\272\273) \304\221\341\273\203 th\341\272\273 t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng h\303\255t v\303\240o \304\221\303\272ng v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 khi vu\341\273\221t nh\341\272\271, \304\221\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i \341\272\251n ho\303\240n to\303\240n thanh cu\341\273\231n tr\303\254nh duy\341\273\207t.\n\n2. **H\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 k\303\251o chu\341\273\231t tr\303\252n m\303\241y t\303\255nh (Desktop Drag-to-Scroll)**:\n   - X\341\273\255 l\303\275 \304\221\341\272\247y \304\221\341\273\247 `onMouseDown`, `onMouseMove`, `onMouseUp` v\303\240 `onMouseLeave` (k\303\250m con tr\341\273\217 `cursor-grab` / `cursor-grabbing` v\303\240 t\341\272\241m t\341\272\257t snap/smooth-scroll trong l\303\272c \304\221ang k\303\251o \304\221\341\273\203 ph\341\272\243n h\341\273\223i t\341\273\251c th\303\254 1:1).\n   - Ph\303\242n bi\341\273\207t r\303\265 thao t\303\241c k\303\251o (`> 5px`) v\303\240 thao t\303\241c b\341\272\245m (`click`), \304\221\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o k\303\251o chu\341\273\231t qua l\341\272\241i tr\303\252n PC kh\303\264ng b\341\273\213 k\303\255ch ho\341\272\241t nh\341\272\247m chuy\341\273\203n sang tab B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223, trong khi b\341\272\245m b\303\254nh th\306\260\341\273\235ng v\303\240o th\341\272\273 v\341\272\253n m\341\273\237 \304\221\303\272ng Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n tr\303\252n b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223.\n\n3. **Ch\341\272\245m ch\341\273\211 b\303\241o \304\221\341\273\231ng (Dynamic Pagination Dots)**:\n   - Hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 h\303\240ng ch\341\272\245m tr\303\262n c\304\203n gi\341\273\257a ngay b\303\252n d\306\260\341\273\233i carousel; ch\341\272\245m \304\221ang active t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng k\303\251o d\303\240i (`w-4 bg-emerald-500`) v\303\240 c\303\241c ch\341\272\245m c\303\262n l\341\272\241i thu g\341\273\215n (`w-1.5 bg-slate-300`), \304\221\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 theo v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 cu\341\273\231n v\303\240 h\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 b\341\272\245m tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p v\303\240o t\341\273\253ng ch\341\272\245m \304\221\341\273\203 tr\306\260\341\273\243t t\341\273\233i th\341\272\273 t\306\260\306\241ng \341\273\251ng.\n\n### K\341\272\277t qu\341\272\243 ki\341\273\203m tra\n- **Unit tests**: 14/14 test logic nghi\341\273\207p v\341\273\245 (bao g\341\273\223m t\303\255nh to\303\241n ch\341\273\211 s\341\273\221 th\341\272\273 active cho carousel) \304\221\341\273\201u \304\221\341\272\241t.\n- **Bi\303\252n d\341\273\213ch & ki\341\273\203m tra ki\341\273\203u**: Build v\303\240 TypeScript check s\341\272\241ch l\341\273\227i.\n- **Ki\341\273\203m tra th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 tr\303\252n tr\303\254nh duy\341\273\207t (Chromium)**: \304\220\303\243 x\303\241c minh c\304\203n l\341\273\201 tr\303\240n vi\341\273\201n trong khung mobile, k\303\251o chu\341\273\231t tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p tr\303\252n PC cu\341\273\231n m\306\260\341\273\243t t\341\273\253 th\341\272\273 1 sang th\341\272\273 2 (`scrollLeft` h\303\255t chu\341\272\251n v\303\240o v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 th\341\272\273), ch\341\272\245m ch\341\273\211 b\303\241o c\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t \304\221\303\272ng tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i active, b\341\272\245m v\303\240o ch\341\272\245m cu\341\273\231n t\341\273\233i th\341\272\273 t\306\260\306\241ng \341\273\251ng, b\341\272\245m b\303\254nh th\306\260\341\273\235ng v\303\240o th\341\272\273 v\341\272\253n m\341\273\237 tab B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223, v\303\240 console c\303\263 0 l\341\273\227i / 0 c\341\272\243nh b\303\241o."
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals and Data**\n\nI\'m scrutinizing the screenshots and DOM data, rigorously cross-referencing them with the project\'s requirements. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the full-bleed alignment and scroll-snap implementation, meticulously assessing each element to ensure complete adherence to specifications.\n\n\n**Confirming Pixel-Perfect Alignment**\n\nI\'ve nailed down the carousel\'s edge-to-edge fit within the phone shell; the `1px` border difference is the key! The `r13-carousel-initial.png` confirms the `20px` breathing room for the first card. Scroll-snap (`\"x mandatory\"`) is locked in, and the scrollbar\'s completely gone. Desktop drag-to-scroll is smooth and clean, as evidenced by the `r13-carousel-dragged.png`. And, critically, the dragging is *not* triggering click events.\n\n\n"
