  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Monitoring Line Count**\n\nI\'m keeping an eye on `RescueMap.tsx`, specifically the line count. I\'m aiming for it to stay below 250 lines as I work on the UI components. I\'ll verify this at the end of the development phase, using `wc -l` to perform a line count audit.\n\n\n**Refining UI Component Spacing**\n\nI\'ve been tweaking the `heightClass` within `BottomSheetShell.tsx` to ensure each step (`pickup`, `tracking`, `issue`, `idle`) has ample vertical space, preventing UI elements from being squeezed. Furthermore, in `IssueSelectionStep.tsx`, I am prominently displaying fixed prices on each issue card with a clear subtitle for transparency. Lastly, I\'ve designed the `VoucherDrawerModal.tsx` as a slide-up modal inside the phone shell, showcasing voucher details with Xanh SM-inspired light mode cards.\n\n\n**Integrating Voucher Logic**\n\nI\'m currently integrating voucher functionality into the order flow. I\'m focusing on `/src/components/steps/OrderInvoiceBar.tsx` and `/src/components/steps/PickupSelectionStep.tsx`. I\'ve implemented a transparent invoice card in `OrderInvoiceBar` displaying original and discounted prices. I\'m also ensuring the \"\306\257u \304\221\303\243i\" selection bar guides users toward voucher application with correct wording on the buttons. Finally, I\'m working on the correct visual state for `ANTOAN20`.\n\n\n"
