  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Code Line Counts**\n\nI\'ve just been reviewing the line counts of some critical files. I was surprised to see that three files, specifically `PickupSelectionStep.tsx`, `RescueMap.tsx`, and `useRescue`, are exceeding the 250-line limit. The first two are at 271 and 278 lines, respectively. It seems a refactor is in order!\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3366754711939396650"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Check, Loader2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type { SafeStation } from \'../../types/rescue\';\\nimport { formatWalkingDistance } from \'../../utils/rescueLogic\';\\n\\ninterface SafeStationListPickerProps {\\n  stations: SafeStation[];\\n  selectedStationId: string | null;\\n  isLoadingRoute: boolean;\\n  onSelectStation: (stationId: string) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport function SafeStationListPicker({\\n  stations,\\n  selectedStationId,\\n  isLoadingRoute,\\n  onSelectStation,\\n}: SafeStationListPickerProps) {\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"mt-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 p-2\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-2 py-0.5\\\">\\n        <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700\\\">\\n          Ch\341\273\215n Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n \304\221\341\273\203 v\341\272\275 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i b\341\273\231:\\n        </p>\\n        {isLoadingRoute && (\\n          <Loader2\\n            className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-spin text-emerald-600\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"\304\220ang t\303\254m tuy\341\272\277n \304\221i b\341\273\231\\\"\\n          />\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n      <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n        {stations.map((station) => {\\n          const selected = selectedStationId === station.id;\\n          return (\\n            <button\\n              key={station.id}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => onSelectStation(station.id)}\\n              aria-pressed={selected}\\n              className={`flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-between gap-2.5 rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 ${\\n                selected\\n                  ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 ring-1 ring-emerald-500 shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-700 hover:bg-white/80\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"min-w-0 flex-1\\\">\\n                <p className=\\\"truncate text-sm font-semibold\\\">{station.name}</p>\\n                <p className=\\\"truncate text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                  {station.categoryLabel}\\n                  <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"> \302\267 </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-sans tabular-nums text-emerald-600\\\">\\n                    {formatWalkingDistance(\\n                      station.walkingDistanceMeters,\\n                      station.walkingMinutes,\\n                    )}\\n                  </span>\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n              {selected && (\\n                <Check\\n                  className=\\\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-emerald-600\\\"\\n                  aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                />\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Extract SafeStationListPicker from PickupSelectionStep so all components stay under 250 lines\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/steps/SafeStationListPicker.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Extracting SafeStationListPicker component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create SafeStationListPicker.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\207\f\n\204\f\001i\024}\023\2678\344\362c\020\357\375\221I8K\020\023\326\266am\356\324\343\362\255.\236\212\247)\326\214<G\243\273\277\315\026\264\252\376\270\2511\357hf\226\225\354\220k\250\261\325V\331\031\'oN+\263\366\262\az\03028\017\340%\004|\\*\024\312\036\036\2626:U{\210A\f\230\343\361\212*/dT\037\004Q1\2549G\f\353\2726\253\377H(\366J\310\"\022,\"\t\302\307r\241\0235_\016\021\017\324N:\225\025B\3649\301\037vXK\005\362C\230k\030Q\210\v<\235+0Ezz\365\035\n\341\363Qe\367\204\371\212LW\274\005hT\203{m\375D3\323\020$v\226Yv\227\002<|M\"\256\036\265@\022\222:\223`\377r\266\346\251\326y\224\224(\f|\250\354\357V\363\354\323\213\230Uw\340T+\261\036\227\031\363!\2620&y\326C\376\321G\324\245>\027\273\227\337\r\3378|+\001d\300j\303\324\273\235K\213U&\230\222\314\326exy\273\264\266:e\037\370Nw\310 )\223\004\201\252\023p\022n\337\276\221\r!\"\227i\237UV\224\266Fb\341$\023R\022\274^umj2\2015\211\305\320Jg>\234\233\"3~\202B4\222\336i\370\235\271\036*\035_\246~\034OIPG\220\341%\275\263\330\326$\034\272,\307O<\306-A\001i\333O,\371\345\362\303#\0340\253g\373H\306}[\324\212\342Sx&r~ ||\251\217\214\277\363\"\235\333\030\273\254,\342s=\227bI\024\230\367\350~\241\t\320i\320\270\017`s\240\373\236\317\367\004\301_&U51\331y\273M\344YGd\\\377N\244\213\265\004\2405\223\201\267\005\n\374\240\345\343O\361\346\366JA\212^\250\216\3108`\275k@{\307\251v(\275\217wW\276\353zd\352E\023\251E\270\207s2\vZ\357\325\377(\303\246\227\342Lw\225L\233\034\315\362\320 \233\031\376\315\000\240\353\254\333\031\002\312\025\270\232\200cR\366\353+/\365\247\315(\004\242\v\267\016H\253l8\021>\001\034i\247\221\373I\367\370*\n\"\230?E\273k \223h\210\305h\023\225\274\356\272}\315wGR)\021\023\375\2002\315\360\213\000\356t\215\306\360F\363\313L\243\256<\002v\236L\250\327\223l\250\232|\224\001\215\\\214h\210\212\367\032\264\000w\000\337\003w1\223\225\301\345t\217\270\360V\342\306\333\271^\336\325\354\303\214\303\030\267Z\033\326\203#\001\352\305\202\322\212\302s\262\002\"\227L\0045\2242