  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Feature Verification**\n\nI\'m now running comprehensive browser verification round `r14` using `playwright-cli` with Chromium, ensuring cleanup on exit. The goal is to verify all three new features end-to-end, capturing up to four unique screenshots for review. I\'m focusing on end-to-end functionality within the specified environment.\n\n\n**Verifying Chromium Flow**\n\nI\'m now deep in Chromium testing, specifically focusing on the new features. I\'ve initiated tests on `http://localhost:3000`, resizing to `1440 900`, and I\'m clicking `\"G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay\"` to progress. My focus is on the package prices displayed in B\306\260\341\273\233c 1, ensuring the exact values render as expected, and that any estimated ranges are correctly displayed as zero. I will also be grabbing screenshots for later review.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1712581146184189039"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\n  sleep 2 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n    await page.getByRole(\'radio\', { name: /L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const text = document.body.innerText;\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      hasFixedPrices: [\'85.000\304\221\', \'120.000\304\221\', \'80.000\304\221\', \'90.000\304\221\', \'50.000\304\221\'].every(p => text.includes(p)),\\n      hasOldRangeDash: text.includes(\'80.000\304\221 \342\200\223 150.000\304\221\')\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r14-step1-prices.png && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /Ch\341\273\215n \304\221i\341\273\203m ch\341\273\235 th\341\273\243/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'voucher-picker-trigger\').click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(400);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const dialogText = document.querySelector(\'[role=\\\\\\\"dialog\\\\\\\"]\')?.textContent || \'\';\\n    const antoanDisabled = document.querySelectorAll(\'[role=\\\\\\\"dialog\\\\\\\"] button:disabled\').length;\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      hasAll3Vouchers: [\'ANTOAN20\', \'DEMKHUYA15\', \'BANMOI25\'].every(c => dialogText.includes(c)),\\n      hasSafeStationHint: dialogText.includes(\'Ch\341\273\215n Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n \304\221\341\273\203 d\303\271ng m\303\243 n\303\240y\'),\\n      disabledApplyButtonsWhenCurrentLoc: antoanDisabled\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r14-step2-voucher-drawer.png && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /\304\220\303\263ng danh s\303\241ch \306\260u \304\221\303\243i/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n    await page.getByRole(\'radio\', { name: /Di chuy\341\273\203n t\341\273\233i Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(400);\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'voucher-picker-trigger\').click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n    const applyBtns = page.locator(\'[role=\\\\\\\"dialog\\\\\\\"] button\', { hasText: \'\303\201p d\341\273\245ng\' });\\n    await applyBtns.first().click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const finalPrice = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"invoice-final-price\\\\\\\"]\')?.textContent;\\n    const confirmText = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"confirm-order-btn\\\\\\\"]\')?.textContent;\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      finalPriceAfterAntoan20: finalPrice,\\n      confirmButtonText: confirmText\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'confirm-order-btn\').click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(600);\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /Gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p th\341\273\243 nh\341\272\255n \304\221\306\241n/i }).first().click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(2200);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const marker1 = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"mechanic-map-marker\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    const style1 = marker1 ? marker1.style.transform : null;\\n    const callHref = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"call-mechanic-btn\\\\\\\"]\')?.getAttribute(\'href\');\\n    const acceptedText = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"tracking-accepted\\\\\\\"]\')?.textContent || \'\';\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      markerTransformAt2s: style1,\\n      callHref,\\n      showsLockedPrice65k: acceptedText.includes(\'65.000\304\221\'),\\n      showsRating49: acceptedText.includes(\'4.9\'),\\n      showsPlate: acceptedText.includes(\'59-P2 842.19\')\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1800);\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'call-mechanic-btn\').evaluate((el) => { el.addEventListener(\'click\', (e) => e.preventDefault(), { once: true }); });\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'call-mechanic-btn\').click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const marker2 = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"mechanic-map-marker\\\\\\\"]\');\\n    const callStatus = document.querySelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"call-connecting-status\\\\\\\"]\')?.textContent;\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      markerTransformAt4s: marker2 ? marker2.style.transform : null,\\n      callConnectingStatus: callStatus\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r14-step3-osrm-route.png && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'chat-mechanic-btn\').click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(400);\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: \'M\303\254nh \304\221ang \304\221\341\273\251ng \341\273\237 Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n s\303\241ng \304\221\303\250n\' }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1900);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const dialogText = document.querySelector(\'[role=\\\\\\\"dialog\\\\\\\"]\')?.textContent || \'\';\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      chatHasUserQuickReply: dialogText.includes(\'M\303\254nh \304\221ang \304\221\341\273\251ng \341\273\237 Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n s\303\241ng \304\221\303\250n\'),\\n      chatHasMechani