  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Chromium Capture**\n\nI\'m now running the final Chromium verification capture, specifically `r15`. I\'m confirming the Urban District 1/3 OSRM driving route, a 1.3km stretch. I\'m also ensuring the live marker movement along this route functions correctly, as captured in `r15-osrm-route.png`. Finally, I\'m checking that the chat drawer is working and includes all elements as expected.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_604395580880434890"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\n  sleep 2 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n    await page.getByRole(\'radio\', { name: /L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p/i }).click();\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /Ch\341\273\215n \304\221i\341\273\203m ch\341\273\235 th\341\273\243/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n    await page.getByRole(\'radio\', { name: /Di chuy\341\273\203n t\341\273\233i Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'voucher-picker-trigger\').click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n    await page.locator(\'[role=\\\\\\\"dialog\\\\\\\"] button\', { hasText: \'\303\201p d\341\273\245ng\' }).first().click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'confirm-order-btn\').click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(550);\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /Gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p th\341\273\243 nh\341\272\255n \304\221\306\241n/i }).first().click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(2300);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r15-osrm-route.png && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n    await page.getByTestId(\'chat-mechanic-btn\').click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(400);\\n    await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: \'M\303\254nh \304\221ang \304\221\341\273\251ng \341\273\237 Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n s\303\241ng \304\221\303\250n\' }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1900);\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli eval \\\"() => {\\n    const dialogText = document.querySelector(\'[role=\\\\\\\"dialog\\\\\\\"]\')?.textContent || \'\';\\n    return JSON.stringify({\\n      noDuplicateKhoang: !dialogText.includes(\'kho\341\272\243ng kho\341\272\243ng\'),\\n      all3ChipsVisible: [\\n        \'M\303\254nh \304\221ang \304\221\341\273\251ng \341\273\237 Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n s\303\241ng \304\221\303\250n\',\\n        \'Xe m\303\254nh d\341\273\261ng ngay tr\306\260\341\273\233c c\341\273\255a\',\\n        \'B\341\272\241n ch\341\272\241y t\341\273\233i g\341\272\247n ch\306\260a?\'\\n      ].every(t => dialogText.includes(t))\\n    });\\n  }\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r15-chat-drawer.png && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Re-verifying urban OSRM route and chat drawer polish in Chromium\", \"toolSummary\":\"Verify final polish in Chromium\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\211\004\n\206\004\001i\024}\023\025J\302|\272\202\266\323\221\336>\246\355~\330\325P/pJ\236\304z\234\377\r\350!i\336\230\332\017\235\036`\350\006\334w\213\217\236\236M&-\b\362\356\245\343\317I\247\231\am.\233}:-\001\272*\234\210\024\214\355\017+\032\353\221p:\370Y\327\306\224e\246\312/\250\311C\016\327\214\201\241\335\023\315\350\216\226V\246\232\355\021\016q\221\b\247C\244\005[=i\340%\345\237\327-\355\304z\246\r&\347Q\260\270\253\217!\031#\251\213\234G\016c\267\006\345\022\243$X\262\370\274\373Ze\002xu\236P5\213x\0230\3158;\343\034\271\a=\350\034>\341\355\335\354\027\006\310Z\373s\327\366\277\361\323\306\032\236G\373\177&>\361\264\267\025\363\241T\203\342&|2C\365\351\2140\240\200MT\227O\365\250\004XI\226m1\311\"\353>#\2520\344d\222\306\365\255wl\217\252\000\366\356Q\242W\227;,\220i\305%\221\347\326\2519\366J\274\204\250\302p\335\346\233\257{\247\334r\240\331o\275l\221`8\210o\002(\331\037WD\300M\263\323\212\323=\004\366\341Bb\306m\257Z\352L\353\026\205KW\\\355\'5\215\201ns\321p\252S\363\323\2350\030\315\301\324e\036\345\3053\003\030\272l`E^\036G~9\275\273\2718W\375.*3Ed\333Z\303L\317\265\330\006\226\"\002\210\v8R\2015\376!\t\3349\247K\177_s\254\346\306\212\025v\347\215\373\333/\330\356\361\260DX\027+\311p\210\223\361\225\306\343\037\\v\b\"q\355\323\303#\274,AB\031\334\267Sn\367\v8\351\324\aw\263\347%{\036\343/\016\032\253Z\374;8\267\f\253\347\364\332\032\"\232\214$R\350\257\261\372\031\374\257\260gD0p\275\313\226\243\303\0236\242C*\274\342\302\017`R\233\016\350\2075\305\324\344\030\237m"
