  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **MotoSOS** \342\200\224 Clean Light Mode mobile-first motorbike rescue & 24/7 Safe Station web app (React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind CSS v4 + TypeScript + MapLibre GL + Geoapify Places API + OSRM + `motion/react`), rendered in a centered `430px` phone shell (`max-w-[430px] h-[100dvh]`) on `bg-slate-900`.\n- **Current User Request (Active \342\200\224 Foundation Created, UI/Map/Hook Wiring Pending)**:\n  Preserve all existing features (Clean Light Mode, fixed pricing + invoice, 3-voucher drawer, and 60fps OSRM mechanic route animation with dynamic yellow route trimming) and add **\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe g\341\272\247n \304\221\303\242y \304\221ang m\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a\"** in Google Maps style:\n  1. **Map Tab Floating Filter Chips (`MapFilterChips`)**:\n     - Directly below the floating header on Map tab (`bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm`), horizontal pill filter bar:\n       - `\"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"` (`\'all\'`)\n       - `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe (\304\220ang m\341\273\237)\"` (`\'repair_shops\'`, with small green online dot)\n       - `\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n 24/7\"` (`\'safe_stations\'`)\n     - Clicking any chip immediately filters visible markers on MapLibre.\n  2. **Geoapify `service.vehicle.repair` Fetch & `opening_hours` Evaluation**:\n     - Query `https://api.geoapify.com/v2/places?categories=service.vehicle.repair&filter=circle:${lng},${lat},2500&bias=proximity:${lng},${lat}&limit=8&apiKey=...` (2.5km radius, with local fallback catalog).\n     - Compare `opening_hours` against `new Date()`:\n       - Open or `24/7` -> `isOpen = true`, `\"\304\220ang m\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a\"`.\n       - Past closing time -> `isOpen = false` and hidden from `\"\304\220ang m\341\273\237\"` list.\n       - Missing `opening_hours` -> `isOpen = true`, `\"M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a \342\200\242 G\341\273\215i x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"`.\n  3. **Blue Wrench Marker & Google Maps-Style Detail Sheet**:\n     - Repair shop marker: `bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full p-2 shadow-md border-2 border-white` with wrench SVG + top-right green online dot (`w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full ring-2 ring-white`).\n     - Tapping a repair shop marker opens a clean detail sheet in the Bottom Sheet showing:\n       - Shop name + green `\"\304\220ang m\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a\"` (or `\"M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a \342\200\242 G\341\273\215i x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"`) badge + distance (`km/m \302\267 ph\303\272t ch\341\272\241y xe`).\n       - Compact clean address.\n       - Row of 3 action buttons:\n         1. `\"D\341\272\253n \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"` (draws blue `#2563eb` OSRM route to the shop directly on the app\'s MapLibre map).\n         2. `\"G\341\273\215i ti\341\273\207m\"` (`tel:...` link + live call status notice).\n         3. `\"Google Maps\"` (`<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=...\">` \342\200\224 avoid `window.open`).\n  4. **Home Tab Integration**:\n     - Add a quick-access section `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"` on the Home tab so users can view/jump straight to an open repair shop on the map.\n- **Strict Constraint**: Every `.ts`/`.tsx` file under `src/` MUST remain strictly `< 250` lines.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed & Verified Prior Work in Session\n1. **Horizontal Safe Station Carousel**: Full-bleed (`-mx-5 px-5 scroll-pl-5`), iOS scroll-snap, desktop drag-to-scroll with >5px click guard, dynamic pagination dots. Verified in Chromium.\n2. **Fixed Package Pricing & Transparent Invoice**:\n   - Step 1 fixed prices: L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p `85.000\304\221`, Ch\341\272\277t m\303\241y `120.000\304\221`, H\341\272\277t x\304\203ng `80.000\304\221`, K\303\255ch b\303\254nh `90.000\304\221`, S\341\273\261 c\341\273\221 kh\303\241c `50.000\304\221`.\n   - Step 2 invoice (`OrderInvoiceBar.tsx`) + `VoucherDrawerModal.tsx` (`ANTOAN20` Safe-Station-only, `DEMKHUYA15`, `BANMOI25`) + confirm button strikethrough pricing.\n3. **60fps Mechanic Animation & Dynamic Route Trimming**:\n   - Mechanic spawns ~800m NW (`700m\342\200\223900m`) on District 1/3 streets (`buildMechanicApproachCoord`), locks initially to OSRM `coordinates[0]`, glides via `requestAnimationFrame` (~50s), trims passed segments (`[currentPos, ...coordinates.slice(i + 1)]`) so yellow `#f59e0b` path vanishes behind the centered motorbike marker (`anchor: \'center\'`), syncs ETA countdown, and transitions to `trackingStatus = \'arrived\'` (`\"Th\341\273\243 \304\221\303\243 t\341\273\233i n\306\241i\"`).\n   - Verified with 23/23 passing unit tests and live Chromium screenshots.\n\n### Completed Edits for Current Request (NOT YET Wired into UI/Map or Compiled!)\n1. `/src/types/rescue.ts`: Added `MapLayerFilter = \'all\' | \'repair_shops\' | \'safe_stations\'` and `RepairShop` interface.\n2. `/src/utils/openingHours.ts`: Implemented pure `evaluateOpeningHours(openingHoursRaw, now)` supporting `24/7`, weekday + time ranges, `off` rules, overnight spans, and missing-hours fallback (`\"M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a \342\200\242 G\341\273\215i x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"`).\n3. `/src/utils/openingHours.test.ts`: Created unit tests for `evaluateOpeningHours`.\n4. `/src/data/mockRepairShops.ts`: Created `MOCK_REPAIR_SHOPS_SEED` (5 District 1 shops: 2 with `\'24/7\'`, 1 with `null` hours, 2 daytime-only shops so late-night filtering visibly hides closed shops).\n5. `/src/utils/repairShopApi.ts`: Implemented `fetchNearbyRepairShops` (calls Geoapify `service.vehicle.repair` radius 2500m, fallback to `MOCK_REPAIR_SHOPS_SEED`), `mapGeoapifyFeaturesToRepairShops`, `getOpenRepairShops`, `formatShopDistanceLabel`, `estimateMotorbikeMinutes`, and `buildGoogleMapsSearchUrl`.\n\n### Skills Read in Session\n- `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` + `references/10_mobile_touch_apps.md`\n\n### Key File Context Already Read\n- Viewed `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx` (151 lines)\n- Viewed `/src/components/steps/IdleHomeStep.tsx` (46 lines)\n- Viewed `/src/utils/mapApi.test.ts` (50 lines)\n- Viewed `/src/components/BottomSheetShell.tsx` (91 lines)\n- Previously read/wrote `MapTabView.tsx` (245 lines), `RescueMap.tsx` (222 lines), `useRescueOrderState.ts` (232 lines), `useRescueGeo.ts` (134 lines), `mapLayers.ts` (126 lines), `mapMarkers.ts` (104 lines).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **File Line-Count Headroom**:\n  - `src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx` is at `245` lines and `src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts` is at `232` lines \342\200\224 MUST modularize before adding repair-shop props/UI (e.g., extract `<MapBottomSheetContent />` from `MapTabView.tsx` and keep repair shop routing/selection state in a dedicated `/src/hooks/useRepairShopState.ts` hook).\n  - `src/components/RescueMap.tsx` is at `222` lines \342\200\224 extract marker syncing into `/src/hooks/useMapMarkersSync.ts` so `RescueMap.tsx` stays well under `250` lines.\n- **Avoid `window.open` / `window.alert`**: System runtime constraints forbid `window.open`. Use standard `<a href={buildGoogleMapsSearchUrl(shop)} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">` for the `\"Google Maps\"` button in `RepairShopDetailSheet.tsx`.\n- **StationPreviewCard Position**: On `step === \'idle\'`, `StationPreviewCard` currently uses `top-16`; with `MapFilterChips` mounted at `top-14` below `<TopOverlayBar />`, move `StationPreviewCard` to `top-28` so chips and preview card never overlap.\n- **Marker Centering & Hit Target**: Follow `createStationMarkerElement` pattern for `createRepairShopMarkerElement` \342\200\224 outer `44x44` `<button>` for touch accessibility, inner `bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full p-2 shadow-md border-2 border-white` with wrench SVG and top-right green dot `w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full ring-2 ring-white`.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Earlier resolved across session:\n  1. `motion/react` `useContext` null in Vite 8 -> Fixed with `resolve: { dedupe: [\'react\', \'react-dom\'] }` in `/vite.config.ts`.\n  2. File > 250 lines -> Prevented/fixed via modular splits (`SafeStationListPicker.tsx`, `useRescueMapMechanicOverlay.ts`, etc.).\n  3. Mechanic marker visual centering -> Fixed via `anchor: \'center\'` + `relative flex h-10 w-10` icon container with absolutely positioned ETA pill underneath.\n  4. Duplicate `\"kho\341\272\243ng\"` in mechanic auto-reply -> Fixed in `pricingAndSimLogic.ts`.\n- No unresolved errors currently.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Codebase currently on disk still compiles cleanly against the *previous* completed turn (the 5 new files created for repair shops are standalone and not imported yet).\n- Dev server is still running the *previous* completed code until all new files are wired and `restart_dev_server` is called.\n- No open Chromium sessions left behind.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Unit Tests for `repairShopApi.ts`** (optional/recommended):\n   - Add tests in `/src/utils/mapApi.test.ts` (or `/src/utils/repairShopApi.test.ts`) verifying `mapGeoapifyFeaturesToRepairShops`, `getOpenRepairShops` hiding closed shops, `buildGoogleMapsSearchUrl`, and `formatShopDistanceLabel`.\n2. **Add Blue Shop Route Layer & Repair Shop Marker**:\n   - `/src/components/map/mapLayers.ts`: Add `\'shop-route\'` source + `\'shop-route-casing\'` (`#ffffff`, width 7) + `\'shop-route-line\'` (`#2563eb`, width 4.5, solid blue).\n   - `/src/components/map/mapMarkers.ts`: Add `createRepairShopMarkerElement(shop, isHighlighted, onClick)` (`bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full p-2 shadow-md border-2 border-white` + wrench SVG + top-right `w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full ring-2 ring-white`).\n3. **Create UI & State Modules (All `< 250` lines)**:\n   - `/src/hooks/useRepairShopState.ts`: Fetches `fetchNearbyRepairShops(userCoord)` whenever GPS changes, computes `openRepairShops = getOpenRepairShops(shops)`, holds `mapFilter: MapLayerFilter` (`\'all\'`), `selectedShopId: string | null`, `shopRoute: GeoJsonLineString | null`, `isLoadingShopRoute: boolean`, and `navigateToShop(shop)` (calls `fetchMechanicDrivingRoute(userCoord, shop.coord)` to set `shopRoute`), `clearShopRoute()`, and `selectShopAndOpenMap`.\n   - `/src/components/map/MapFilterChips.tsx`: Floating horizontal pill chips (`bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm`) below `TopOverlayBar`: `\"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"`, `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe (\304\220ang m\341\273\237)\"` (with green online dot), `\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n 24/7\"`.\n   - `/src/components/steps/RepairShopDetailSheet.tsx`: Shown inside `BottomSheetShell` when `step === \'idle\'` and `selectedShop !== null` (with back button `\"\342\206\220 Danh s\303\241ch\"` / `\"\304\220\303\263ng\"`): displays shop name, green `\"\304\220ang m\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a\"` / `\"M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a \342\200\242 G\341\273\215i x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"` badge, distance (`formatShopDistanceLabel`), address, and 3 buttons: `\"D\341\272\253n \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"` (triggers blue OSRM route), `\"G\341\273\215i ti\341\273\207m\"` (`tel:...` + inline call notice), `\"Google Maps\"` (`<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href={buildGoogleMapsSearchUrl(shop)}>`).\n   - `/src/hooks/useMapMarkersSync.ts` + `/src/components/RescueMap.tsx`: Render/filter station markers & open repair shop markers based on `mapFilter` (`all` shows both; `repair_shops` hides stations; `safe_stations` hides repair shops), draw `\'shop-route\'` blue line & `fitMapBoundsSafely` when `shopRoute` updates, and shift `StationPreviewCard` to `top-28` so it clears `MapFilterChips`.\n   - `/src/components/tabs/MapBottomSheetContent.tsx` + `/src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx`: Extract step content switch + `RepairShopDetailSheet` into `MapBottomSheetContent.tsx` so `MapTabView.tsx` stays ~160 lines; adjust `BottomSheetShell.tsx` height when a shop detail sheet is open (`max-h-[46%]`).\n   - `/src/components/tabs/NearbyRepairShopsSection.tsx` + `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx` + `/src/App.tsx`: Add `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"` section on Home tab (below `NearbyStationsCarousel` or cleanly spaced) showing top open repair shops + `\"Xem b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223 \342\206\222\"`, tapping opens Map tab with `mapFilter = \'repair_shops\'` and `selectedShopId` set so its detail sheet opens immediately.\n   - Ensure `useRescueOrderState.ts` stays `< 250` lines when composing `useRepairShopState`.\n4. **Verify Build, Tests, Line Limits & Browser**:\n   - Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts` and `find src -type f \\( -name \'*.ts\' -o -name \'*.tsx\' \\) -exec wc -l {} +` (confirm EVERY file is `< 250` lines and all tests pass).\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n   - Call `restart_dev_server`.\n   - Run 1 targeted `playwright-cli` (`--browser=chromium`, `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`, `.playwright-cli/r17-*.png`) verification round testing:\n     1. Home tab shows `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"` with only open/24-7/no-hours shops (closed shops hidden!).\n     2. Clicking into Map tab: floating filter chips (`T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243`, `Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe (\304\220ang m\341\273\237)`, `Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n 24/7`) visible; toggling filters updates visible station vs blue wrench markers cleanly!\n     3. Clicking a blue repair shop marker opens `RepairShopDetailSheet` with badge `\"\304\220ang m\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a\"` (or `\"M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a \342\200\242 G\341\273\215i x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"`), distance, address, `\"D\341\272\253n \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"`, `\"G\341\273\215i ti\341\273\207m\"`, `\"Google Maps\"` (`https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=...`), and clicking `\"D\341\272\253n \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"` draws the blue `#2563eb` OSRM route!\n     4. Inspect screenshots with `view_file` / inline attachments and verify `0` console errors/warnings.\n5. **Final Response**: Summarize concisely in Vietnamese without exposing file paths or internal system details.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Language**: Vietnamese in final response and all UI copy.\n- **File Size**: Every `.ts`/`.tsx` file under `src/` must remain strictly `< 250` lines.\n- **Runtime Constraints**: Avoid `window.open` / `window.alert`. No `font-mono` misuse. Keep existing Clean Light Mode, fixed pricing, vouchers, and 60fps route animation intact.\n- **Verification**: Must pass unit tests, `< 250` line check, `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and live Playwright screenshot inspection AFTER the final edit.\n</summary>"
