  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Coordinating Parallel Updates**\n\nI\'m now coordinating updates to `/src/components/BottomSheetShell.tsx`, `/src/components/RescueMap.tsx`, `/src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx`, `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx`, `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts`, and `/src/App.tsx`. I\'m focusing on ensuring these stay comfortable and updated in parallel, without any issues.\n\n\n**Refining Component Interactions**\n\nI\'m making progress refining the interactions between the components. In `BottomSheetShell.tsx`, I\'ve added a conditional `max-h` and changed the font. `RescueMap.tsx` now leverages `useMapMarkersSync` and dynamically renders the shop route. I\'ve also adjusted the `StationPreviewCard` position. In `MapTabView.tsx`, I\'ve implemented the `MapFilterChips` and a cleaner structure.  `HomeTab.tsx` now includes `NearbyRepairShopsSection`. Finally, `useRescueOrderState.ts` integrates `useRepairShopState` and adds shop-clearing methods.\n\n\n"
