  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Home Page Content**\n\nI\'m currently focused on running a Playwright script on localhost:3000 to verify the home page rendering in a mobile viewport (430x900). My main concern is to confirm the presence of \"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\" alongside open/24-7/missing-hours shop indicators, and crucially, to ensure the console is error-free.\n\n\n**Testing Map Interactions**\n\nI\'ve shifted my focus to map interactions. I\'m verifying the \"B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\" tab loads correctly, ensuring MapLibre and markers render, and the filter chips display. I will also test the interaction with the repair shop chips and markers. Furthermore, I\'ll confirm that clicking a repair shop marker correctly opens the `RepairShopDetailSheet`, and that it contains the expected information. I\'m grabbing screenshots along the way.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14455179960859707475"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"mkdir -p .playwright-cli && bash -c \'\\nset -e\\ntrap \\\"playwright-cli close || true\\\" EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open http://localhost:3000 --browser=chromium\\nplaywright-cli resize 430 900\\nsleep 2\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"text=Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\");\\n  const sectionText = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").innerText();\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"HOME_SECTION_TEXT:\\\\\\\", sectionText.replace(/\\\\\\\\n+/g, \\\\\\\" | \\\\\\\"));\\n  await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r17-home.png\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\", { name: \\\\\\\"B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\\\\\\\" }).click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[role=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tablist\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"][aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"B\341\273\231 l\341\273\215c l\341\273\233p b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[data-testid^=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r17-map-all.png\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"tab\\\\\\\", { name: /Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe/ }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\\n  const shopPins = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[data-testid^=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").count();\\n  const stationPins =