  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Image Anomalies**\n\nI\'ve just had a breakthrough! I\'m now focused on why `r17-home.png` stubbornly displays an outdated `NearbyRepairShopsSection` (specifically, that `\342\200\242` span). Even more curiously, the expected `[data-testid^=\"repair-shop-marker-\"]` markers are still missing from `useMapMarkersSync`. This suggests a synchronization or caching issue.\n\n\n**Pinpointing Rendering Errors**\n\nI\'ve finally pinpointed a critical rendering error. The `[data-testid^=\"repair-shop-marker-\"]` markers were timing out because `mapRef.current` was null when `useMapMarkersSync`\'s effects ran. The initial render of `RescueMap` means `useMapMarkersSync` runs *before* the map initialization, rendering it null. This means the useEffect\'s dependency array lacked `mapReady`, causing it to miss re-renders. This is the root cause!\n\n\n**Resolving Caching Concerns**\n\nI\'ve got it! The map tab\'s initial mount of `RescueMap` results in `mapRef.current` being null. `useMapMarkersSync` short-circuits. Then, when `RescueMap` becomes ready and `mapRef.current` becomes initialized, `useMapMarkersSync` never re-runs because its dependencies didn\'t change! Adding `mapReady` to both the parameter and dependency array in `useMapMarkersSync` fixes station and repair shop markers! Regarding the orphan `\342\200\242`, HMR was disabled, and I realized Vite freshly serves pages, which clears up the caching, so I must have missed recompilation.\n\n\n**Investigating Image Discrepancies**\n\nI\'m now investigating a discrepancy in the `r17-home.png` image. It displays a grey dot, which shouldn\'t happen. Initially, I thought it was a caching issue related to the outdated `NearbyRepairShopsSection`, but I realized the image reflects the initial page load state. The grey dot suggests a styling issue in the `NearbyRepairShopsSection.tsx` component, potentially related to conditional rendering or a missed recompilation. Time to check the component\'s styling conditions. I\'ll need to check the code!\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_17770099097272377216"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add mapReady to useMapMarkersSync dependencies so markers mount reliably after MapLibre loads\", \"EndLine\":108, \"Instruction\":\"Add mapReady boolean parameter to UseMapMarkersSyncParams and include it in both marker sync useEffects\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"interface UseMapMarkersSyncParams {\\n  mapRef: MutableRefObject<MapLibreMap | null>;\\n  mapReady: boolean;\\n  stations: SafeStation[];\\n  openRepairShops: RepairShop[];\\n  selectedStationId: string | null;\\n  inspectedStationId: string | null;\\n  selectedShopId: string | null;\\n  mapFilter: MapLayerFilter;\\n  step: RescueStep;\\n  pickupMode: PickupMode;\\n  onSelectStation: (stationId: string) => void;\\n  onInspectStation: (stationId: string | null) => void;\\n  onSelectShop: (shopId: string | null) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport function useMapMarkersSync({\\n  mapRef,\\n  mapReady,\\n  stations,\\n  openRepairShops,\\n  selectedStationId,\\n  inspectedStationId,\\n  selectedShopId,\\n  mapFilter,\\n  step,\\n  pickupMode,\\n  onSelectStation,\\n  onInspectStation,\\n  onSelectShop,\\n}: UseMapMarkersSyncParams) {\\n  const stationMarkersRef = useRef<Marker[]>([]);\\n  const repairShopMarkersRef = useRef<Marker[]>([]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const map = mapRef.current;\\n    if (!map) return;\\n\\n    stationMarkersRef.current.forEach((marker) => marker.remove());\\n    const showStations =\\n      step !== \'idle\' || mapFilter === \'all\' || mapFilter === \'safe_stations\';\\n\\n    if (!showStations) {\\n      stationMarkersRef.current = [];\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    stationMarkersRef.current = stations.map((station) => {\\n      const isHighlighted =\\n        inspectedStationId === station.id ||\\n        (selectedStationId === station.id &&\\n          (step === \'pickup\' || step === \'tracking\') &&\\n          pickupMode === \'safe_station\');\\n\\n      const el = createStationMarkerElement(station, isHighlighted, () => {\\n        onSelectShop(null);\\n        onInspectStation(station.id);\\n        onSelectStation(station.id);\\n      });\\n\\n      return new Marker({ element: el, anchor: \'center\' })\\n        .setLngLat([station.coord.lng, station.coord.lat])\\n        .addTo(map);\\n    });\\n  }, [\\n    mapReady,\\n    stations,\\n    selectedStationId,\\n    inspectedStationId,\\n    step,\\n    pickupMode,\\n    mapFilter,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const map = mapRef.current;\\n    if (!map) return;\\n\\n    repairShopMarkersRef.current.forEach((marker) => marker.remove());\\n    const showShops =\\n      step === \'idle\' && (mapFilter === \'all\' || mapFilter === \'repair_shops\');\\n\\n    if (!showShops) {\\n      repairShopMarkersRef.current = [];\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    repairShopMarkersRef.current = openRepairShops.map((shop) => {\\n      const isHighlighted = selectedShopId === shop.id;\\n      const el = createRepairShopMarkerElement(shop, isHighlighted, () => {\\n        onInspectStation(null);\\n        onSelectShop(shop.id);\\n      });\\n\\n      return new Marker({ element: el, anchor: \'center\' })\\n        .setLngLat([shop.coord.lng, shop.coord.lat])\\n        .addTo(map);\\n    });\\n  }, [mapReady, openRepairShops, selectedShopId, mapFilter, step]);\", \"StartLine\":14, \"TargetContent\":\"interface UseMapMarkersSyncParams {\\n  mapRef: MutableRefObject<MapLibreMap | null>;\\n  stations: SafeStation[];\\n  openRepairShops: RepairShop[];\\n  selectedStationId: string | null;\\n  inspectedStationId: string | null;\\n  selectedShopId: string | null;\\n  mapFilter: MapLayerFilter;\\n  step: RescueStep;\\n  pickupMode: PickupMode;\\n  onSelectStation: (stationId: string) => void;\\n  onInspectStation: (stationId: string | null) => void;\\n  onSelectShop: (shopId: string | null) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport function useMapMarkersSync({\\n  mapRef,\\n  stations,\\n  openRepairShops,\\n  selectedStationId,\\n  inspectedStationId,\\n  selectedShopId,\\n  mapFilter,\\n  step,\\n  pickupMode,\\n  onSelectStation,\\n  onInspectStation,\\n  onSelectShop,\\n}: UseMapMarkersSyncParams) {\\n  const stationMarkersRef = useRef<Marker[]>([]);\\n  const repairShopMarkersRef = useRef<Marker[]>([]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const map = mapRef.current;\\n    if (!map) return;\\n\\n    stationMarkersRef.current.forEach((marker) => marker.remove());\\n    const showStations =\\n      step !== \'idle\' || mapFilter === \'all\' || mapFilter === \'safe_stations\';\\n\\n    if (!showStations) {\\n      stationMarkersRef.current = [];\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    stationMarkersRef.current = stations.map((station) => {\\n      const isHighlighted =\\n        inspectedStationId === station.id ||\\n        (selectedStationId === station.id &&\\n          (step === \'pickup\' || step === \'tracking\') &&\\n          pickupMode === \'safe_station\');\\n\\n      const el = createStationMarkerElement(station, isHighlighted, () => {\\n        onSelectShop(null);\\n        onInspectStation(station.id);\\n        onSelectStation(station.id);\\n      });\\n\\n      return new Marker({ element: el, anchor: \'center\' })\\n        .setLngLat([station.coord.lng, station.coord.lat])\\n        .addTo(map);\\n    });\\n  }, [\\n    stations,\\n    selectedStationId,\\n    inspectedStationId,\\n    step,\\n    pickupMode,\\n    mapFilter,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const map = mapRef.current;\\n    if (!map) return;\\n\\n    repairShopMarkersRef.current.forEach((marker) => marker.remove());\\n    const showShops =\\n      step === \'idle\' && (mapFilter === \'all\' || mapFilter === \'repair_shops\');\\n\\n    if (!showShops) {\\n      repairShopMarkersRef.current = [];\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    repairShopMarkersRef.current = openRepairShops.map((shop) => {\\n      const isHighlighted = selectedShopId === shop.id;\\n      const el = createRepairShopMarkerElement(shop, isHighlighted, () => {\\n        onInspectStation(null);\\n        onSelectShop(shop.id);\\n      });\\n\\n      return new Marker({ element: el, anchor: \'center\' })\\n        .setLngLat([shop.coord.lng, shop.coord.lat])\\n        .addTo(map);\\n    });\\n  }, [openRepairShops, selectedShopId, mapFilter, step]);\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/hooks/useMapMarkersSync.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding mapReady dependency to useMapMarkersSync\", \"toolSummary\":\"Fix marker sync dependency\"}"
