  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing Verification Script**\n\nI\'m currently running the complete Chromium Playwright verification script, encompassing home navigation, filter chips, markers, the repair shop detail sheet, and the OSRM blue route. I\'ve noted that on `MapLibre` marker buttons, Playwright might sometimes misinterpret elements.\n\n\n**Analyzing Marker Visibility**\n\nI\'m now investigating marker visibility in relation to viewport and bottom sheet occlusion, considering that shops within a 1.1-2.5km radius of `[10.7769, 106.7009]` at initial zoom `15.2` might be partially or fully off-screen or behind the bottom sheet. Specifically, I\'m checking if zooming out to `13.5` or `13.8` improves visibility. I need to verify what occurs during the `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe (\304\220ang m\341\273\237)\"` chip tap, including fitting bounds and zoom levels (e.g., zoom `13.8`) for optimal display.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_215734542580910331"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"mkdir -p .playwright-cli && bash -c \'\\nset -e\\ntrap \\\"playwright-cli close || true\\\" EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open http://localhost:3000 --browser=chromium\\nplaywright-cli resize 430 900\\nsleep 2\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"text=Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(800);\\n  await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r17-home.png\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\", { name: \\\\\\\"B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\\\\\\\", exact: true }).click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[role=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tablist\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"][aria-label=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"B\341\273\231 l\341\273\215c l\341\273\233p b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[data-testid^=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\", { state: \\\\\\\"attached\\\\\\\" });\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\\n  const shopAll = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[data-testid^=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").count();\\n  const stationAll = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[aria-label*=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ph\303\272t \304\221i b\341\273\231\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").count();\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"ALL_SHOPS:\\\\\\\", shopAll, \\\\\\\"ALL_STATIONS:\\\\\\\", stationAll);\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r17-map-all.png\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"tab\\\\\\\", { name: /Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe/ }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(600);\\n  const shopPins = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[data-testid^=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").count();\\n  const stationPins = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[aria-label*=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ph\303\272t \304\221i b\341\273\231\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").count();\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"SHOPS_FILTER_COUNT:\\\\\\\", shopPins, \\\\\\\"STATIONS_WHEN_SHOP_FILTER:\\\\\\\", stationPins);\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r17-map-shops-only.png\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"tab\\\\\\\", { name: /Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n/ }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(400);\\n  const shopPins = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[data-testid^=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").count();\\n  const stationPins = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[aria-label*=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ph\303\272t \304\221i b\341\273\231\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").count();\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"STATION_FILTER_SHOPS:\\\\\\\", shopPins, \\\\\\\"STATION_FILTER_STATIONS:\\\\\\\", stationPins);\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"tab\\\\\\\", { name: /Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe/ }).click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[data-testid^=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\", { state: \\\\\\\"attached\\\\\\\" });\\n}\\\"\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[data-testid^=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").first().dispatchEvent(\\\\\\\"click\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-detail-sheet\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\");\\n  const gmapsHref = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-detail-sheet\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"] a[target=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]\\\\\\\").getAttribute(\\\\\\\"href\\\\\\\");\\n  const telHref = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"repair-shop-detail-sheet\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"] a[href^=