  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Planning the Implementation**\n\nI\'ve decided to tackle the implementation by first updating `useRescueGeo.ts`, then creating the `LocationSearchModal.tsx`, and finally, modifying `useRescueOrderState.ts`, `HomeTab.tsx`, and `App.tsx`. I think this is the most efficient order.\n\n\n**Refining the Geo Logic**\n\nI\'m now deep in the design of `useRescueGeo.ts`. I\'m focusing on how the `activeLocation` state will be initialized, primarily from `DEFAULT_HCMC_COORD`. The `resolveGpsAndReverseGeocode()` helper is where things get interesting: it\'ll fetch the user\'s GPS and then reverse-geocode. I\'m making sure fallback mechanisms are robust, even when the geolocation API fails. I\'m planning to expose `activeLocation` and derived `userLocation` through a memo.\n\n\n**Detailing the State Logic**\n\nI\'m zeroing in on the finer points of `useRescueGeo.ts` and how it interacts with the rest of the application. The automatic re-running of `fetchNearbySafeStations` and re-scans for Open Repair Shops, via a dependency on `activeLocation`\'s coordinates in `useRescueOrderState.ts`, feels like a breakthrough. I\'m building out the `selectSearchedLocation` function within the geo context, which updates `activeLocation` with the selected suggestion. I\'m feeling confident about this design. The `isLocatingGps` state variable is now implemented.\n\n\n**Designing the Search Modal**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the UI design for the `LocationSearchModal`. It will be fixed across the entire desktop viewport. I\'m leveraging `useEffect` to autofocus the input. The input bar will resemble Google Maps, with a search icon, input, and a clear \"X\" button. Underneath the input, there will be a prominent option for \"S\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n,\" with an emerald GPS icon, showing either the current GPS/address or \"L\341\272\245y t\341\273\215a \304\221\341\273\231 GPS ch\303\255nh x\303\241c qua thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213,\" and a spinner while locating GPS. The Geoapify Autocomplete will be debounced for 300ms.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3792266930409815870"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  DEFAULT_HCMC_COORD,\\n  FALLBACK_USER_LOCATION,\\n  MOCK_SAFE_STATIONS,\\n} from \'../data/mockRescueData\';\\nimport type {\\n  ActiveLocation,\\n  GeoCoord,\\n  GeoJsonLineString,\\n  LocationSuggestion,\\n  PickupMode,\\n  RescueStep,\\n  SafeStation,\\n  UserLocation,\\n} from \'../types/rescue\';\\nimport { reverseGeocodeCoord } from \'../utils/geocodeApi\';\\nimport { fetchNearbySafeStations, fetchWalkingRoute } from \'../utils/mapApi\';\\nimport { getNearestSafeStation } from \'../utils/rescueLogic\';\\n\\nexport function useRescueGeo(\\n  step: RescueStep,\\n  pickupMode: PickupMode,\\n  selectedStation: SafeStation | null,\\n  onStationsReady: (stations: SafeStation[]) => void,\\n) {\\n  const [activeLocation, setActiveLocation] = useState<ActiveLocation>({\\n    lat: DEFAULT_HCMC_COORD.lat,\\n    lng: DEFAULT_HCMC_COORD.lng,\\n    address: FALLBACK_USER_LOCATION.address,\\n    isCurrentGPS: true,\\n  });\\n  const [isLocatingGps, setIsLocatingGps] = useState(false);\\n  const [stations, setStations] = useState<SafeStation[]>(MOCK_SAFE_STATIONS);\\n  const [isLoadingStations, setIsLoadingStations] = useState(false);\\n  const [walkingRoute, setWalkingRoute] = useState<GeoJsonLineString | null>(\\n    null,\\n  );\\n  const [routeSummary, setRouteSummary] = useState<{\\n    distanceMeters: number;\\n    durationMinutes: number;\\n  } | null>(null);\\n  const [isLoadingRoute, setIsLoadingRoute] = useState(false);\\n  const geocodeAbortRef = useRef<AbortController | null>(null);\\n\\n  const applyReverseGeocodedCoord = useCallback(\\n    async (coord: GeoCoord, isRealGps: boolean) => {\\n      geocodeAbortRef.current?.abort();\\n      const controller = new AbortController();\\n      geocodeAbortRef.current = controller;\\n\\n      const resolvedAddress = await reverseGeocodeCoord(coord, controller.signal);\\n      if (controller.signal.aborted) return;\\n\\n      setActiveLocation({\\n        lat: coord.lat,\\n        lng: coord.lng,\\n        address:\\n          isRealGps || !resolvedAddress.startsWith(\'V\341\273\213 tr\303\255 GPS\')\\n            ? resolvedAddress\\n            : FALLBACK_USER_LOCATION.address,\\n        isCurrentGPS: true,\\n      });\\n    },\\n    [],\\n  );\\n\\n  const useCurrentGpsLocation = useCallback((): Promise<void> => {\\n    setIsLocatingGps(true);\\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\\n      if (typeof navigator === \'undefined\' || !navigator.geolocation) {\\n        applyReverseGeocodedCoord(DEFAULT_HCMC_COORD, false).finally(() => {\\n          setIsLocatingGps(false);\\n          resolve();\\n        });\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(\\n        (pos) => {\\n          const coord = {\\n            lat: pos.coords.latitude,\\n            lng: pos.coords.longitude,\\n          };\\n          setActiveLocation((prev) => ({\\n            lat: coord.lat,\\n            lng: coord.lng,\\n            address: prev.address,\\n            isCurrentGPS: true,\\n          }));\\n          applyReverseGeocodedCoord(coord, true).finally(() => {\\n            setIsLocatingGps(false);\\n            resolve();\\n          });\\n        },\\n        () => {\\n          applyReverseGeocodedCoord(DEFAULT_HCMC_COORD, false).finally(() => {\\n            setIsLocatingGps(false);\\n            resolve();\\n          });\\n        },\\n        { enableHighAccuracy: true, timeout: 6000, maximumAge: 60000 },\\n      );\\n    });\\n  }, [applyReverseGeocodedCoord]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    useCurrentGpsLocation();\\n    return () => geocodeAbortRef.current?.abort();\\n  }, [useCurrentGpsLocation]);\\n\\n  const selectSearchedLocation = useCallback((item: LocationSuggestion) => {\\n    geocodeAbortRef.current?.abort();\\n    setActiveLocation({\\n      lat: item.lat,\\n      lng: item.lng,\\n      address: item.fullAddress,\\n      isCurrentGPS: false,\\n    });\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const userLocation: UserLocation = useMemo(\\n    () => ({\\n      address: activeLocation.address,\\n      district: activeLocation.isCurrentGPS\\n        ? \'V\341\273\213 tr\303\255 GPS hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i\'\\n        : \'\304\220\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\215n\',\\n      coord: { lat: activeLocation.lat, lng: activeLocation.lng },\\n      source: activeLocation.isCurrentGPS ? \'gps\' : \'fallback\',\\n    }),\\n    [activeLocation],\\n  );\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const controller = new AbortController();\\n    setIsLoadingStations(true);\\n\\n    fetchNearbySafeStations(\\n      { lat: activeLocation.lat, lng: activeLocation.lng },\\n      controller.signal,\\n    )\\n      .then(({ stations: nextStations }) => {\\n        if (controller.signal.aborted) return;\\n        setStations(nextStations);\\n        onStationsReady(nextStations);\\n      })\\n      .finally(() => {\\n        if (!controller.signal.aborted) {\\n          setIsLoadingStations(false);\\n        }\\n      });\\n\\n    return () => controller.abort();\\n  }, [activeLocation.lat, activeLocation.lng]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const shouldRoute =\\n      (step === \'pickup\' || step === \'tracking\') &&\\n      pickupMode === \'safe_station\' &&\\n      selectedStation !== null;\\n\\n    if (!shouldRoute || !selectedStation) {\\n      setWalkingRoute(null);\\n      setRouteSummary(null);\\n      setIsLoadingRoute(false);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const controller = new AbortController();\\n    setIsLoadingRoute(true);\\n\\n    fetchWalkingRoute(\\n      { lat: activeLocation.lat, lng: activeLocation.lng },\\n      selectedStation.coord,\\n      controller.signal,\\n    )\\n      .then((res) => {\\n        if (controller.signal.aborted) return;\\n        setWalkingRoute(res.geometry);\\n        setRouteSummary({\\n          distanceMeters: res.distanceMeters,\\n          durationMinutes: res.durationMinutes,\\n        });\\n      })\\n      .finally(() => {\\n        if (!controller.signal.aborted) {\\n          setIsLoadingRoute(false);\\n        }\\n      });\\n\\n    return () => controller.abort();\\n  }, [\\n    step,\\n    pickupMode,\\n    activeLocation.lat,\\n    activeLocation.lng,\\n    selectedStation?.id,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  const nearestStation = getNearestSafeStation(stations);\\n\\n  return {\\n    activeLocation,\\n    userLocation,\\n    isLocatingGps,\\n    selectSearchedLocation,\\n    useCurrentGpsLocation,\\n    stations,\\n    nearestStation,\\n    isLoadingStations,\\n    walkingRoute,\\n    routeSummary,\\n    isLoadingRoute,\\n    clearRoute: () => {\\n      setWalkingRoute(null);\\n      setRouteSummary(null);\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Upgrade useRescueGeo to manage global activeLocation with Geoapify reverse geocoding and location picker callbacks\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/hooks/useRescueGeo.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating useRescueGeo with activeLocation and reverse geocoding\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update useRescueGeo hook\"}"
