  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Marker Logic**\n\nI\'m currently working on cleanly wiring the marker rendering logic within `/src/hooks/useMapMarkersSync.ts`. The goal is to display amber `GasStation` markers when the application state is `step === \'idle\'` and the filter is set to `\'gas_stations\'`. This logic will also hide general stations and repair shops when the gas station filter is active.\n\n\n**Implementing Gas Route**\n\nI\'ve been focusing on integrating the gas route functionality. The plan is to auto-fit the map bounds to the user\'s coordinates and nearby gas stations when the filter is set to \'gas_stations\', and no route is active. I am ensuring that the bottom sheet handles the gas station list effectively, and I am wiring all of the components that need the new gas station props. Also, I am composing the gas station data in `useRescueOrderState` to be used.\n\n\n**Integrating Safe Station Logic**\n\nI\'m now integrating logic for the `chosenGasSafeStation`. If it\'s selected, I\'m including it in `effectiveStations` to ensure precise coordinate resolution for various components. I also updated `handleQuickCategory` to manage the `\'gas_station\'` case by calling `handleOpenMapWithGasStations()`, and am adding `handleSelectGasStationForPickup` to set up the pickup flow. Lastly, I\'m making sure that the map filter changes clear the gas route appropriately.\n\n\n"
