  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **MotoSOS** \342\200\224 Clean Light Mode mobile-first motorbike rescue & 24/7 Safe Station web app (React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind CSS v4 + TypeScript + MapLibre GL + Geoapify + OSRM + `motion/react`), rendered in a centered `430px` phone shell (`max-w-[430px] h-[100dvh]`) on `bg-slate-900`.\n- **Completed Prior Requests in Session**:\n  1. **Nearby Open Repair Shops (`Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n`)**: Geoapify `service.vehicle.repair` fetch + `opening_hours` check + Home quick section + Map filter chips + blue wrench markers with emerald dot + Google Maps detail sheet + OSRM blue route. Verified (28/28 unit tests, Chromium screenshots, 0 errors).\n  2. **Global Active Location & Google Maps Location Search (`activeLocation` + `LocationSearchModal`)**: `ActiveLocation` state (`{ lat, lng, address, isCurrentGPS }`), Geoapify Reverse Geocoding on mount/GPS, split Hero Bar (`\"B\341\272\241n \304\221ang g\341\272\267p s\341\273\261 c\341\273\221 \341\273\237 \304\221\303\242u?\"` -> `LocationSearchModal` with auto-focus, clear `X`, `\"S\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n\"`, 300ms debounced Geoapify Address Autocomplete), automatic radar rescan + MapLibre relocation. Verified (31/31 unit tests, Chromium screenshots, 0 errors).\n- **Current Active User Request (Gas Stations Feature \342\200\224 85% Built, Final 3 Files Pending Wiring & Verification)**:\n  Preserve all existing features (Clean Light Mode, `activeLocation` location search, fixed package pricing, 3 vouchers, open repair shops, 60fps yellow route cutting animation) and upgrade the **\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"** flow:\n  1. **Clicking `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"` on Home Tab (`HomeActionGrid`)**:\n     - Switch immediately to Tab `\"B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\"` (`step = \'idle\'`).\n     - Activate map filter `\'gas_stations\'` (add `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"` chip to floating `MapFilterChips`).\n     - Automatically scan gas stations around current `activeLocation` (works for both real GPS and searched addresses).\n  2. **`fetchNearbyGasStations(lat, lng)` + Haversine Distance Sorting**:\n     - If `VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY || NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY` is present, POST `https://places.googleapis.com/v1/places:searchNearby` (`includedTypes: [\"gas_station\"]`, `rankPreference: \"DISTANCE\"`, `maxResultCount: 10`, radius `3000`).\n     - Otherwise, use Geoapify (`VITE_GEOAPIFY_KEY || NEXT_PUBLIC_GEOAPIFY_KEY`): `https://api.geoapify.com/v2/places?categories=service.vehicle.fuel&filter=circle:${lng},${lat},3000&bias=proximity:${lng},${lat}&limit=10&apiKey=...` (with Saigon fallback stations if offline/error).\n     - Compute exact Haversine distance (`computeHaversineMeters`), sort ascending, and mark #1 with `\"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\"`.\n  3. **Amber Fuel Markers, Bounds Fitting & `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n nh\341\272\245t\"` Bottom Sheet**:\n     - Markers: `bg-amber-500 text-white border-2 border-white shadow-md` with `Fuel` icon; `fitBounds` frames user + nearest gas stations automatically.\n     - Bottom Sheet when `mapFilter === \'gas_stations\'` shows `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n nh\341\272\245t\"` list with:\n       - Name (Petrolimex, PVOIL, COMECO...), compact address, distance & walking minutes, `\"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\"` badge on item #1, open status.\n       - 3 action buttons per item:\n         1. `\"V\341\272\275 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"`: draws OSRM route from user to gas station on the app\'s MapLibre map (`gas-route` orange/amber `#ea580c` layer).\n         2. `\"Google Maps\"`: `<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=lat,lng\">` (avoid `window.open`).\n         3. `\"\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y\"`: selects this gas station as the Safe Station pickup point (`pickupMode = \'safe_station\'`), activates `ANTOAN20` voucher, and enters `step = \'pickup\'`!\n- **Strict Constraint**: Every `.ts`/`.tsx` file under `src/` MUST remain strictly `< 250` lines.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed & Tested Prior Turns\n- `src/utils/repairShopApi.ts`, `src/utils/openingHours.ts`, `src/utils/geocodeApi.ts`, `src/hooks/useRepairShopState.ts`, `src/hooks/useRescueGeo.ts`, `src/components/modals/LocationSearchModal.tsx`, `src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx` (all passing 31 unit tests & Chromium verification prior to this task).\n\n### Completed Edits for Current Gas Stations Task (NOT YET Wired in `MapTabView.tsx`, `useRescueOrderState.ts`, `App.tsx`, NOT YET Compiled)\n1. `/src/types/rescue.ts`: Extended `MapLayerFilter` with `\'gas_stations\'` and added `GasStation` interface.\n2. `/src/utils/gasStationApi.ts`: Implemented `getGoogleMapsApiKey`, `buildGoogleMapsDirectionsUrl`, `gasStationToSafeStation`, `mapGooglePlacesToGasStations`, `mapGeoapifyFeaturesToGasStations`, `buildFallbackGasStations`, and `fetchNearbyGasStations` (Google Places New -> Geoapify -> Mock fallback, sorted by Haversine, `isNearest` on index 0).\n3. `/src/utils/gasStationApi.test.ts`: Added unit tests covering Google Places & Geoapify parsing, Haversine sorting, `isNearest`, `gasStationToSafeStation`, and `buildGoogleMapsDirectionsUrl`.\n4. `/src/hooks/useGasStationState.ts`: Created hook auto-fetching `fetchNearbyGasStations(userCoord.lat, userCoord.lng)`, holding `gasStations`, `isLoadingGasStations`, `selectedGasStationId`, `gasRoute`, `isLoadingGasRoute`, `routeToGasStation(station)`, `clearGasRoute()`.\n5. `/src/components/map/mapLayers.ts`: Added `\'gas-route\'` source, `\'gas-route-casing\'` (`#ffffff`, 7), and `\'gas-route-line\'` (`#ea580c`, 4.5).\n6. `/src/components/map/mapMarkers.ts`: Added `createGasStationMarkerElement(station, isHighlighted, onClick)` with `bg-amber-500 text-white border-2 border-white shadow-md` + `Fuel` SVG icon.\n7. `/src/components/map/MapFilterChips.tsx`: Added `\'gas_stations\'` (`\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"` + count) filter chip.\n8. `/src/components/steps/GasStationListSheet.tsx`: Created `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n nh\341\272\245t\"` scrollable list sheet with `\"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\"` pill on #1, distance + walking minutes, and 3 buttons (`\"V\341\272\275 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"`, `\"Google Maps\"`, `\"\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y\"`).\n9. `/src/hooks/useMapMarkersSync.ts`: Added amber `GasStation` marker syncing (`step === \'idle\' && mapFilter === \'gas_stations\'`), `\'gas-route\'` rendering, and `fitMapBoundsSafely` around user + nearest 5 gas stations.\n10. `/src/components/BottomSheetShell.tsx`: Added `isGasListOpen?: boolean` (`max-h-[48%]` when `step === \'idle\' && isGasListOpen`).\n11. `/src/components/RescueMap.tsx`: Added `gasStations`, `selectedGasStationId`, `gasRoute`, `onSelectGasStation` props and passed to `useMapMarkersSync`.\n12. `/src/components/tabs/MapBottomSheetContent.tsx`: Added rendering of `<GasStationListSheet />` when `step === \'idle\' && mapFilter === \'gas_stations\' && !selectedShop`.\n\n### Remaining Unedited Files\n1. `/src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx` (currently 218 lines \342\200\224 needs gas station props wired into `RescueMap`, `MapFilterChips`, `BottomSheetShell`, and `MapBottomSheetContent`; **must stay `< 250` lines**).\n2. `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts` (currently 220 lines \342\200\224 needs `useGasStationState` wired, `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"` quick action routing to `mapFilter = \'gas_stations\'`, and `\"\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y\"` handler; **must stay `< 250` lines**).\n3. `/src/App.tsx` (currently 143 lines \342\200\224 needs gas station props passed from `useRescueOrderState` to `MapTabView`).\n\n### Skills Already Read\n- `ultra-mode`, `frontend-design`, `computer-use` (all read earlier in session).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Important Wiring for `\"\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y\"` (`GasStation` -> `PickupSelectionStep`)**:\n  - `fetchNearbySafeStations` fetches up to 4 general stations (convenience/fuel/police), whereas `fetchNearbyGasStations` fetches up to 10 fuel stations in 3km. Therefore, a gas station chosen via `\"\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y\"` might NOT exist inside `geo.stations`.\n  - Solution: In `useRescueOrderState.ts`, keep `const [chosenGasSafeStation, setChosenGasSafeStation] = useState<SafeStation | null>(null)` and compute `effectiveStations = useMemo(() => chosenGasSafeStation && !geo.stations.some(s => s.id === chosenGasSafeStation.id) ? [chosenGasSafeStation, ...geo.stations] : geo.stations, [geo.stations, chosenGasSafeStation])`. Pass `effectiveStations` into `resolvePickupTarget`, `MapTabView`, `SafetyTab`, and `RescueMap` (`stations`)!\n  - In `handleSelectGasStationForRescue(gas: GasStation)`:\n    1. `const safe = gasStationToSafeStation(gas);`\n    2. `setChosenGasSafeStation(safe);`\n    3. `setSelectedStationId(safe.id);`\n    4. `setPickupMode(\'safe_station\');`\n    5. `setSelectedVoucherId(\'ANTOAN20\');` (explicitly activates `ANTOAN20` Safe Station voucher as requested!)\n    6. `gasStations.clearGasRoute();`\n    7. `repairShops.selectShop(null);`\n    8. `setEnteredFromQuickStations(true);`\n    9. `setStep(\'pickup\');`\n- **Important Routing for Home `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"` Button**:\n  - In `HomeActionGrid.tsx`, clicking `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"` calls `onQuickCategorySelect(\'gas_station\')`.\n  - In `useRescueOrderState.ts`, update `handleQuickCategory`:\n    ```ts\n    if (category === \'gas_station\') {\n      handleOpenMapWithGasStations();\n      return;\n    }\n    ```\n    where `handleOpenMapWithGasStations` sets: `setInspectedStationId(null)`, `repairShops.selectShop(null)`, `repairShops.setMapFilter(\'gas_stations\')`, `gasStations.clearGasRoute()`, `setStep(\'idle\')`, `setActiveTab(\'map\')`!\n- **Clear `gasRoute` When Switching Map Filters**:\n  - Wrap `handleChangeMapFilter(nextFilter)` in `useRescueOrderState.ts` so switching away from `\'gas_stations\'` calls `gasStations.clearGasRoute()` (and switching away from `\'repair_shops\'` clears `shopRoute` if desired / already handled in `useRepairShopState`).\n- **Avoid `window.open`**: Runtime constraints forbid `window.open` and `window.alert`. `GasStationListSheet.tsx` uses `<a href={buildGoogleMapsDirectionsUrl(...)} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">` as required.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Earlier resolved across session:\n  1. `useMapMarkersSync` missing `mapReady` dep caused pins not to appear on tab switch -> Fixed by adding `mapReady` to deps.\n  2. Initial `map.flyTo` overriding `fitMapBoundsSafely` on tab switch -> Fixed via `prevRecenterRef` & `prevCoordRef` in `RescueMap.tsx`.\n  3. Line limit `< 250` on `MapTabView.tsx`, `useRescueOrderState.ts`, `LocationSearchModal.tsx` -> Resolved by extracting `MapBottomSheetContent.tsx` and compacting imports/props.\n- No current compilation/runtime errors \342\200\224 only the final 3-file wiring step remains before compiling.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace has edits in 12 files for the Gas Stations feature; `MapTabView.tsx`, `useRescueOrderState.ts`, and `App.tsx` still reflect the previous turn\'s interface and have NOT yet been updated to connect the new gas-station hooks/props.\n- Running dev server still serves the pre-gas-station state until the final 3 files are updated, compiled, and `restart_dev_server` is called.\n- No open Chromium sessions or leftover `.playwright-cli` folders exist.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Wire Remaining 3 Files (Keep Every File Strictly `< 250` Lines)**:\n   - `/src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx` (view first to confirm exact lines; keep `< 250` lines by accessing `props.*` cleanly):\n     - Add `gasStations`, `selectedGasStationId`, `gasRoute`, `isLoadingGasStations`, `isLoadingGasRoute`, `onSelectGasStation`, `onDrawGasRoute`, `onPickGasStationForRescue` to `MapTabViewProps`.\n     - Pass `gasStations`, `selectedGasStationId`, `gasRoute`, `onSelectGasStation` to `<RescueMap />`.\n     - Pass `gasStationCount={props.gasStations.length}` to `<MapFilterChips />`.\n     - Pass `isGasListOpen={step === \'idle\' && props.mapFilter === \'gas_stations\' && !props.selectedShop}` to `<BottomSheetShell />`.\n     - Pass gas station props into `<MapBottomSheetContent />`.\n   - `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts` (currently 220 lines; keep `< 250` lines):\n     - Import `useGasStationState` and `gasStationToSafeStation`.\n     - Compose `const gasStations = useGasStationState(geo.userLocation.coord)`.\n     - Maintain `chosenGasSafeStation` and `effectiveStations` (`useMemo`), use `effectiveStations` for `pickupTarget`, clear `chosenGasSafeStation` in `handleResetFlow` and `handleSelectSearchLocation`/`handleResetToGpsLocation`.\n     - Update `handleQuickCategory` so `\'gas_station\'` triggers `handleOpenMapWithGasStations()`, add `handleSelectGasStationForRescue(station)` (sets `chosenGasSafeStation`, `selectedStationId`, `pickupMode = \'safe_station\'`, `selectedVoucherId = \'ANTOAN20\'`, clears `gasRoute`, `setStep(\'pickup\')`), add `handleChangeMapFilter` clearing `gasStations.clearGasRoute()`.\n     - Export `gasStations`, `effectiveStations`, `handleSelectGasStationForRescue`, `handleChangeMapFilter`.\n   - `/src/App.tsx`:\n     - Update `MapTabView`, `SafetyTab`, and `HomeTab` `stations` to `s.effectiveStations` (or `s.geo.stations` for Home/Safety and `s.effectiveStations` for MapTabView).\n     - Wire all gas station props (`gasStations={s.gasStations.gasStations}`, `selectedGasStationId={s.gasStations.selectedGasStationId}`, `gasRoute={s.gasStations.gasRoute}`, `isLoadingGasStations={s.gasStations.isLoadingGasStations}`, `isLoadingGasRoute={s.gasStations.isLoadingGasRoute}`, `onChangeMapFilter={s.handleChangeMapFilter}`, `onSelectGasStation={s.gasStations.setSelectedGasStationId}`, `onDrawGasRoute={s.gasStations.routeToGasStation}`, `onPickGasStationForRescue={s.handleSelectGasStationForRescue}`) into `<MapTabView />`.\n2. **Verify Build, Tests, Line Limits & Server**:\n   - Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts` (verify all existing + `gasStationApi.test.ts` tests pass).\n   - Run `find src -type f \\( -name \'*.ts\' -o -name \'*.tsx\' \\) -exec wc -l {} + | sort -nr` (verify EVERY file is `< 250` lines).\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n   - Call `restart_dev_server`.\n3. **Verify Live UI in Chromium (`playwright-cli`)**:\n   - Run 1 Chromium walkthrough (`430x900`, `trap \'playwright-cli close || true\' EXIT`, screenshots with `{ animations: \'disabled\' }`) testing:\n     1. Click `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"` button on Home tab -> opens Map tab with `\'gas_stations\'` chip active (`C\303\242y x\304\203ng`), amber Fuel markers visible on map, `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n nh\341\272\245t\"` list in Bottom Sheet with `\"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\"` badge on item #1, distance/walking minutes, `\"V\341\272\275 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"`, `\"Google Maps\"` (`https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=...`), `\"\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y\"`.\n     2. Click `\"V\341\272\275 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"` -> draws orange OSRM route on the MapLibre canvas; capture screenshot and inspect via image result.\n     3. Click `\"\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y\"` -> transitions cleanly to Step 2 (`PickupSelectionStep`) with the selected gas station pre-selected AND `ANTOAN20` discount (`-20.000\304\221`) automatically applied in the invoice; capture screenshot and inspect.\n     4. Check `playwright-cli console error` reports 0 errors & 0 warnings, then `rm -rf .playwright-cli`.\n4. **Final Response**: Summarize concisely in Vietnamese without exposing file paths or internal system details.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Language**: Vietnamese in UI copy and final response.\n- **File Size**: Every `.ts`/`.tsx` file under `src/` must be strictly `< 250` lines.\n- **Runtime Constraints**: Avoid `window.open` / `window.alert`. No `font-mono` misuse. Keep all prior features (Clean Light Mode, `activeLocation` search, fixed package pricing, 3 vouchers, open repair shops, and 60fps route animation with dynamic tail trimming) intact.\n- **Verification**: Do not claim completion until unit tests, line audit, `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and Chromium screenshot verification succeed after the final code edit.\n</summary>"
