  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the API Cause**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the root cause! Lines 122-125 in `gasStationApi.ts` reveal that the Geoapify API returns `\"Mac Thi Buoi Street\"` when a `service.vehicle.fuel` POI lacks a `props.name`. This clarifies the unexpected name display.\n\n\n**Refining the Name Formatting**\n\nI\'ve got a much better formatting solution now! If the name is missing or whitespace-only, I\'ll meaningfully format it. I\'ll prefer the street name, or `address_line1`, replacing \"Street\" suffixes with a simpler name, to provide clearer display names. The `rawAddr` formatting is improved, favoring the street and district to ensure consistency in address display, which is much better than the current setup!\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2083738549735033227"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Improve unnamed Geoapify fuel station naming and compact street+district formatting\", \"EndLine\":133, \"Instruction\":\"Prefix unnamed fuel POIs with \'C\303\242y x\304\203ng \' and preserve street+district in compact address\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"    const props = feature.properties ?? {};\\n    const meters = computeHaversineMeters(originCoord, { lat, lng });\\n    const cleanStreet = (props.street || props.address_line1 || \'\')\\n      .replace(/\\\\s+Street$/i, \'\')\\n      .trim();\\n    const areaPart = props.district || props.suburb || \'\';\\n    const rawAddr =\\n      (props.name?.trim() ? props.address_line2?.trim() : \'\') ||\\n      [cleanStreet, areaPart].filter(Boolean).join(\', \') ||\\n      props.formatted?.trim() ||\\n      \'Khu v\341\273\261c g\341\272\247n v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n\';\\n    const stationName =\\n      props.name?.trim() ||\\n      (cleanStreet ? `C\303\242y x\304\203ng ${cleanStreet}` : `C\303\242y x\304\203ng #${idx + 1}`);\\n\\n    list.push({\\n      id: props.place_id || `geo-gas-${idx}-${lng.toFixed(4)}-${lat.toFixed(4)}`,\\n      name: stationName,\\n      address: formatCompactStationAddress(rawAddr),\\n      walkingDistanceMeters: meters,\\n      walkingMinutes: estimateWalkingMinutes(meters),\\n      openStatusLabel:\\n        props.opening_hours === \'24/7\' ? \'M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a 24/7\' : \'Tr\341\273\261c 24/7 \342\200\242 C\303\263 nh\303\242n vi\303\252n\',\\n      coord: { lat, lng },\\n    });\", \"StartLine\":112, \"TargetContent\":\"    const props = feature.properties ?? {};\\n    const meters = computeHaversineMeters(originCoord, { lat, lng });\\n    const rawAddr =\\n      props.address_line2?.trim() ||\\n      props.formatted?.trim() ||\\n      [props.street, props.suburb, props.district].filter(Boolean).join(\', \') ||\\n      \'Khu v\341\273\261c g\341\272\247n v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n\';\\n\\n    list.push({\\n      id: props.place_id || `geo-gas-${idx}-${lng.toFixed(4)}-${lat.toFixed(4)}`,\\n      name:\\n        props.name?.trim() ||\\n        props.address_line1?.trim() ||\\n        `C\303\242y x\304\203ng #${idx + 1}`,\\n      address: formatCompactStationAddress(rawAddr),\\n      walkingDistanceMeters: meters,\\n      walkingMinutes: estimateWalkingMinutes(meters),\\n      openStatusLabel:\\n        props.opening_hours === \'24/7\' ? \'M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a 24/7\' : \'Tr\341\273\261c 24/7 \342\200\242 C\303\263 nh\303\242n vi\303\252n\',\\n      coord: { lat, lng },\\n    });\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/utils/gasStationApi.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Polishing Geoapify gas station naming\", \"toolSummary\":\"Improve unnamed gas station display\"}"
