  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Center Pin Components**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `CenterPinOverlay.tsx` component to render a fixed pin at the center of the map canvas, ensuring it doesn\'t interfere with pointer events. Next steps include updating `mapLayers.ts`, `useRescueGeo.ts`, and `LocationSearchModal.tsx` to integrate these new components for the Center Pin Mode.\n\n\n**Designing Pin Picker Mode**\n\nI\'m currently designing the visual components for the pin picker. I\'m imagining a high-visibility, orange/emerald pin with a glowing contact dot and subtle bounce animation when dragging. I\'m also working on the `PinPickerSheet` component, which will render a bottom sheet with a header, live address preview, coordinates display, and cancel/confirm buttons. I plan to add the GPS accuracy circle source and layers to `mapLayers.ts`, and I\'m updating `useRescueGeo.ts` to use `watchBestGpsPosition`.\n\n\n"
