  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Exploring Geolocation Options**\n\nI\'ve been examining how to handle geolocation in headless Chromium using Playwright. I\'ve found I can override `navigator.geolocation` or leverage `page.context().setGeolocation()` along with `grantPermissions([\'geolocation\'])`. I\'m especially interested in `navigator.geolocation.watchPosition` now, combined with `page.context().setGeolocation`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4931092473168319257"
      name: "run_command"
