  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Chromium Script**\n\nI\'m currently focused on verifying a Chromium script using `playwright-cli` within a 430x900 viewport. The plan involves opening the Map tab, then checking the initial `scrollLeft` and `scrollWidth` values. I intend to perform real scrolling actions after this initial verification to ensure proper functionality.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_15281828442121760543"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"bash -c \'\\nset -e\\nmkdir -p _verify\\ntrap \\\"playwright-cli close || true\\\" EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open http://localhost:3000\\nplaywright-cli resize 430 900\\nsleep 1.2\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\", { name: \\\\\\\"B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\\\\\\\" }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1000);\\n  const chipBar = page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"map-filter-chips\\\\\\\");\\n  const initialDims = await chipBar.evaluate(el => ({ scrollLeft: el.scrollLeft, scrollWidth: el.scrollWidth, clientWidth: el.clientWidth }));\\n  const box = await chipBar.boundingBox();\\n  await page.mouse.move(box.x + 280, box.y + box.height / 2);\\n  await page.mouse.down();\\n  await page.mouse.move(box.x + 100, box.y + box.height / 2, { steps: 10 });\\n  await page.mouse.up();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n  const afterDragScrollLeft = await chipBar.evaluate(el => el.scrollLeft);\\n  const allStillSelected = await chipBar.getByRole(\\\\\\\"tab\\\\\\\", { name: \\\\\\\"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\\\\\\\" }).getAttribute(\\\\\\\"aria-selected\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\"_verify/chips-dragged.png\\\\\\\", animations: \\\\\\\"disabled\\\\\\\" });\\n  await chipBar.getByRole(\\\\\\\"tab\\\\\\\", { name: /Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n 24\\\\/7/ }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(600);\\n  const safeSelected = await chipBar.getByRole(\\\\\\\"tab\\\\\\\", { name: /Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n 24\\\\/7/ }).getAttribute(\\\\\\\"aria-selected\\\\\\\");\\n  const centeredBox = await chipBar.getByRole(\\\\\\\"tab\\\\\\\", { name: /Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n 24\\\\/7/ }).boundingBox();\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\"_verify/chips-centered.png\\\\\\\", animations: \\\\\\\"disabled\\\\\\\" });\\n  return { initialDims, afterDragScrollLeft, allStillSelected, safeSelected, centeredBox };\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli console error\\n\'\",