  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 4
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **MotoSOS** \342\200\224 mobile-first motorbike rescue & 24/7 Safe Station web app (React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind CSS v4 + TypeScript + MapLibre GL + Geoapify + OSRM + `motion/react`) rendered inside a centered `430px` phone shell (`max-w-[430px] h-[100dvh]`) on `bg-slate-900`.\n- **Completed Prior Requests in This Session** (all implemented, unit-tested 37/37, built, linted, and Chromium-verified):\n  1. **Gas Stations Feature (`C\303\242y x\304\203ng g\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t`)**: Clicking `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng\"` -> Map tab with `\'gas_stations\'` chip + amber pins + bounds fit + `\"C\303\242y x\304\203ng g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n nh\341\272\245t\"` Bottom Sheet (`\"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\"` badge, `\"V\341\272\275 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\"`, `\"Google Maps\"` external `<a>`, `\"\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y\"` applying Safe Station + `ANTOAN20`).\n  2. **High-Accuracy GPS, Clean Reverse Geocoding, Accuracy Circle & Center Pin Mode**:\n     - `watchBestGpsPosition` (`enableHighAccuracy: true, timeout: 10000, maximumAge: 0`, collects best sample up to 2.5s or `accuracy <= 20m`, stores `accuracyMeters`, displays `\"\304\220\341\273\231 ch\303\255nh x\303\241c GPS: \302\261Xm\"` badge).\n     - Clean Street Reverse Geocoding (`parseReverseGeocodeAddress` ignores nearby building/agency `properties.name`, formats `[housenumber, street]` + `suburb || quarter || district || city`).\n     - Geographic blue accuracy circle polygon (`gps-accuracy-fill` / `gps-accuracy-stroke`) + `\"Ch\341\273\215n tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p tr\303\252n b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\"` Center Pin Mode (`CenterPinOverlay`, `PinPickerSheet`, `useMapPinPicker`, `map.unproject([w/2, h*0.33])` on `moveend`).\n  3. **Horizontal Filter Chips Swipe & Drag (`MapFilterChips`)**: `pointer-events-auto w-full overflow-x-auto touch-pan-x`, `shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap select-none`, desktop drag-to-scroll (`>5px` drag threshold), and `scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\', inline: \'center\', block: \'nearest\' })`.\n- **Current Active User Request (Luxury Super-App Home Redesign \342\200\224 ~50% Completed, UI Components & Wiring Remaining)**:\n  Preserve ALL existing logic (MapLibre, CARTO, Geoapify, OSRM, `activeLocation`, fixed pricing, 60fps yellow route cutting animation, horizontal filter chip bar), and redesign the **Home Tab** into a Luxury Super-App with real campaign photography without visual clutter:\n  1. **Obsidian Dark Header & Elevated Floating 8-Icon Card (`HomeTab.tsx` + `HomeActionGrid.tsx`)**:\n     - Header container: `bg-[#090D16] text-white rounded-b-[32px] pt-5 pb-12 px-5 relative overflow-hidden` with top emerald ambient glow (`bg-emerald-500/20 blur-3xl`).\n     - Title `\"MotoSOS Priority\"` + champagne gold-bordered badge `\"24/7 VIP Rescue\"`, below it the current street address in `text-slate-300` (clickable to open `LocationSearchModal`) + compact frosted `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` pill.\n     - Search bar inside dark region: `bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/15 rounded-2xl p-1.5` with bright emerald `\"G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay\"` (`bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 font-bold rounded-xl`).\n     - 8-icon grid inside floating white card (`bg-white rounded-3xl p-4 shadow-[0_14px_34px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] border border-slate-100 -mt-7 mx-4 relative z-10`). Remove 5-color rainbow pastel icons; unify 6 icons to charcoal/smoke-slate (`bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/70 text-slate-800`), keeping only 2 subtle accents: `\"L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p\"` (emerald) and `\"G\341\273\255i SOS\"` (muted rose).\n  2. **Exclusive Campaign Peek-a-boo Carousel (`CampaignBannerCarousel.tsx`)**:\n     - Horizontal swipe + desktop drag-to-scroll carousel (`w-[86%] shrink-0 snap-start`) showing 12% of the next card + dynamic pagination dots below.\n     - 4 curated real-photo banners with fallback gradient and dark left-to-right scrim (`bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/95 via-slate-950/70 to-slate-950/20`):\n       - Banner 1 (`ANTOAN20`): `\"\304\220\341\273\230C QUY\341\273\200N BAN \304\220\303\212M\"`, `\"Gi\341\272\243m 20.000\304\221 khi ch\341\273\235 th\341\273\243 t\341\272\241i Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n\"`, `\"\303\201p d\341\273\245ng ngay\"`\n       - Banner 2 (`BANMOI25`): `\"TH\303\200NH VI\303\212N M\341\273\232I\"`, `\"T\341\272\267ng 25.000\304\221 cho l\341\272\247n c\341\273\251u h\341\273\231 \304\221\341\272\247u ti\303\252n\"`, `\"Nh\341\272\255n \306\260u \304\221\303\243i\"`\n       - Banner 3 (`DEMKHUYA15`, `out_of_fuel`): `\"C\341\273\250U H\341\273\230 H\341\272\276T X\304\202NG\"`, `\"Giao 2L x\304\203ng RON 95 t\341\272\255n n\306\241i ch\341\273\211 t\341\273\253 65.000\304\221\"`, `\"G\341\273\215i ngay\"`\n       - Banner 4 (`null`): `\"AN T\303\202M TUY\341\273\206T \304\220\341\273\220I\"`, `\"100% Th\341\273\243 x\303\241c minh danh t\303\255nh & B\303\241o gi\303\241 c\341\273\221 \304\221\341\273\213nh\"`, `\"Xem b\341\272\243ng gi\303\241\"`\n     - Clicking any banner button pre-selects its voucher (and `out_of_fuel` / `safe_station` mode where applicable) and transitions to the rescue flow on the Map Tab.\n  3. **\"\304\220\341\272\267c Quy\341\273\201n \304\220\341\273\221i T\303\241c 24/7\" Section (`PartnerPerksCarousel.tsx`)**:\n     - Placed immediately below `\"Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"`: horizontal scroll + drag row of 3 compact photo cards (`w-[195px] shrink-0 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100 shadow-sm overflow-hidden`, top `h-24 w-full object-cover`):\n       - `\"Circle K x MotoSOS\"`: Ch\341\273\235 th\341\273\243 t\341\272\241i c\341\273\255a h\303\240ng ti\341\273\207n l\341\273\243i, nh\341\272\255n ngay \306\260u \304\221\303\243i gi\341\272\243m 20k.\n       - `\"\304\220\341\272\267c quy\341\273\201n C\341\273\251u H\341\273\231 \304\220\303\252m\"`: Mi\341\273\205n ph\303\255 ki\341\273\203m tra \303\241p su\341\272\245t l\341\273\221p & b\303\254nh \341\272\257c quy t\341\272\255n n\306\241i.\n       - `\"G\303\263i An T\303\242m \304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng D\303\240i\"`: Gi\341\272\243m 15k m\341\273\215i khung gi\341\273\235 t\341\273\253 22h00 \342\200\223 05h00.\n  4. **Clean Repair Shop Data & Compact Single-Row Cards (`repairShopApi.ts` + `NearbyRepairShopsSection.tsx`)**:\n     - Normalize generic English names (`\"Motorbike repair\"`, `\"Repair Shop\"`, etc.) -> `\"Ti\341\273\207m S\341\273\255a Xe L\306\260u \304\220\341\273\231ng\"`; replace `\"Saigon\"` -> `\"TP.HCM\"`.\n     - Remove the bulky `\"M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a \342\200\242 G\341\273\215i x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"` green pill box; make each card 1 crisp row (`p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-3.5`): dark rounded-xl wrench box (`bg-slate-900 text-white w-11 h-11 rounded-xl`), bold name, 1 compact meta line (`\342\227\217 \304\220ang m\341\273\237 \342\200\242 1.1 km \342\200\242 \304\220. Nguy\341\273\205n Th\341\273\213 Minh Khai`), and minimal circular arrow button on the right.\n- **Strict Constraint**: Every `.ts`/`.tsx` file under `src/` MUST remain strictly `< 250` lines. No unused `VipNightShieldBanner` regressions if superseded.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed in Current Task (Not Yet Wired or Compiled)\n1. `/src/data/homePromotions.ts`: Created with `CAMPAIGN_BANNERS` (exact 4 Unsplash URLs, tags, titles, CTAs, `voucherId`, `targetIssue`, `targetPickupMode`, `targetStep`) and `PARTNER_PERKS` (3 partner cards).\n2. `/src/utils/repairShopApi.ts`: Added `normalizeRepairShopName`, `normalizeRepairShopAddress`, `formatShopCompactMeta`, and wired them into `mapGeoapifyFeaturesToRepairShops`.\n3. `/src/utils/repairShopApi.test.ts`: Added unit tests asserting `\"Motorbike repair\"` -> `\"Ti\341\273\207m S\341\273\255a Xe L\306\260u \304\220\341\273\231ng\"`, `\"Repair Shop\"` -> `\"Ti\341\273\207m S\341\273\255a Xe L\306\260u \304\220\341\273\231ng\"`, `\"Saigon\"` -> `\"TP.HCM\"`, and `formatShopCompactMeta(1120, ...)` -> `\"1.1 km \342\200\242 ...\"`.\n4. `/src/components/tabs/CampaignBannerCarousel.tsx`: Created 4-banner Peek-a-boo real-photo carousel (`w-[86%] shrink-0 snap-start`, dark left-to-right scrim, desktop drag-to-scroll with `>5px` threshold, dynamic pagination dots).\n5. `/src/components/tabs/PartnerPerksCarousel.tsx`: Created `\"\304\220\341\272\267c Quy\341\273\201n \304\220\341\273\221i T\303\241c 24/7\"` horizontal photo-card carousel (`w-[195px] shrink-0`, `h-24 w-full object-cover`, desktop drag-to-scroll).\n\n### Remaining Unedited Files for Current Task\n1. `/src/components/tabs/HomeActionGrid.tsx` (update into floating white card `-mt-7 mx-4 relative z-10`, unify 6 icons to charcoal/slate-50, accent only `\"L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p\"` emerald and `\"G\341\273\255i SOS\"` muted rose).\n2. `/src/components/tabs/NearbyRepairShopsSection.tsx` (remove bulky `\"M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a \342\200\242 G\341\273\215i x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"` green box; redesign to compact single-row card with dark `w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white` wrench icon, `\342\227\217 \304\220ang m\341\273\237 \342\200\242 <dist> \342\200\242 <address>` subline using `formatShopCompactMeta`, and minimalist circular arrow button).\n3. `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx` (redesign header into Obsidian dark hero `bg-[#090D16] text-white rounded-b-[32px] pt-5 pb-12 px-5 relative overflow-hidden` with emerald top blur glow, `\"MotoSOS Priority\"` + `\"24/7 VIP Rescue\"`, `text-slate-300` clickable address, frosted `\"Test th\341\273\243\"`, frosted search bar + bright emerald `\"G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay\"`, floating `HomeActionGrid`, then `CampaignBannerCarousel` -> `NearbyStationsCarousel` -> `PartnerPerksCarousel` -> `NearbyRepairShopsSection`).\n4. `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts` (currently 242 lines \342\200\224 **must stay `< 250` lines**; add `handleSelectCampaignBanner(banner)` and `handleSelectPartnerPerk(perk)` to pre-apply `voucherId`, `targetIssue`, `targetPickupMode`, and enter Map Tab at `targetStep`).\n5. `/src/App.tsx` (pass `onSelectCampaignBanner` and `onSelectPartnerPerk` into `<HomeTab />`).\n\n### Skills Already Read\n- `ultra-mode`, `frontend-design`, `computer-use` (all read earlier in session).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **`rescueLogic.test.ts` Dependency**: `formatCompactStationAddress(\'Ly Tu Trong Street, Saigon, Ho Chi Minh City, 71016, Vietnam\')` is tested to return `\'\304\220. Ly Tu Trong, Q.1\'`, so keep `rescueLogic.ts` unchanged and apply the `\"Saigon\"` -> `\"TP.HCM\"` replacement cleanly inside `repairShopApi.ts` (`normalizeRepairShopName`, `normalizeRepairShopAddress`, `formatShopCompactMeta`).\n- **Pre-applying Vouchers from Campaign Banners / Partner Perks**:\n  - Notice `handleChangePickupMode(\'current_location\')` clears `ANTOAN20` if switching away from `\'safe_station\'`. So inside `handleSelectCampaignBanner(banner)`:\n    1. `clearOverlays(false)`\n    2. `setSelectedIssue(banner.targetIssue ?? null)`\n    3. `setPickupMode(banner.targetPickupMode ?? \'current_location\')`\n    4. `setSelectedVoucherId(banner.voucherId)`\n    5. `setEnteredFromQuickStations(false)`\n    6. `setStep(banner.targetStep)` (`\'pickup\'` for Fuel Rescue banner 3 so user immediately sees `80.000\304\221 - 15.000\304\221 = 65.000\304\221`; `\'issue\'` for Banners 1, 2, 4 so voucher `ANTOAN20`/`BANMOI25` is preselected and Safe Station mode is pre-set for `ANTOAN20`!)\n    7. `setActiveTab(\'map\')`\n  - For `handleSelectPartnerPerk(perk)`:\n    1. `clearOverlays(false)`\n    2. `setSelectedIssue(null)`\n    3. `setPickupMode(perk.targetPickupMode ?? \'current_location\')`\n    4. `setSelectedVoucherId(perk.voucherId)`\n    5. `setEnteredFromQuickStations(false)`\n    6. `setStep(\'issue\')`\n    7. `setActiveTab(\'map\')`\n- **File Line Limit `< 250`**: `useRescueOrderState.ts` is currently 242 lines! When adding `handleSelectCampaignBanner` and `handleSelectPartnerPerk`, compact lines cleanly (or combine them into a single `handleSelectPromotion` helper or trim whitespace) so `useRescueOrderState.ts` remains strictly `<= 248` lines!\n- **Unused `VipNightShieldBanner.tsx` & `SAFETY_BANNER_SLIDES`**: Can keep or remove cleanly once `HomeTab.tsx` uses `CampaignBannerCarousel`. Keeping/leaving no broken imports ensures `tsc --noEmit` stays spotless.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Resolved across earlier turns:\n  1. Strict mode Playwright locator `getByText(\'-20.000\304\221\')` matched 2 elements -> fixed with `{ exact: true }`.\n  2. Unnamed Geoapify gas station showed `\"Mac Thi Buoi Street\"` / `\"Saigon\"` -> fixed in `gasStationApi.ts` (`C\303\242y x\304\203ng <street>`, `Mac Thi Buoi, Khu ph\341\273\221 9`).\n  3. `GeoJSON.FeatureCollection` missing ambient namespace in `gpsWatcher.ts` -> replaced with explicit `GeoJsonPolygonCollection` interface.\n  4. `getByRole(\'button\', { name: \'B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\' })` matched 3 buttons -> used `{ name: \'B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\', exact: true }`.\n  5. File line lengths exceeding 249 lines caught via `wc -l` -> extracted subcomponents/hooks so all files stay strictly `< 250` lines.\n- No current compilation/runtime errors pending other than wiring the remaining 5 files.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- 5 files created/edited in the workspace (`homePromotions.ts`, `repairShopApi.ts`, `repairShopApi.test.ts`, `CampaignBannerCarousel.tsx`, `PartnerPerksCarousel.tsx`) are NOT yet referenced by `HomeTab.tsx`, `useRescueOrderState.ts`, or `App.tsx`, and have NOT yet been compiled/tested together.\n- Dev server is still serving the pre-Home-redesign build until the remaining 5 files are updated, tested, built, and `restart_dev_server` is called.\n- No open Playwright sessions or temporary `.playwright-cli` / `_verify` directories exist.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Update Remaining 5 Files (Keep Every File Strictly `< 250` Lines)**:\n   - `/src/components/tabs/HomeActionGrid.tsx`:\n     - Wrap grid in floating white card (`-mt-7 mx-4 relative z-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-4 shadow-[0_14px_34px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)]`).\n     - Neutralize 6 icon boxes to `border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50 text-slate-800`; accent only `L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p` (`border border-emerald-200/80 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700`) and `G\341\273\255i SOS` (`border border-rose-200/80 bg-rose-50 text-rose-700`).\n   - `/src/components/tabs/NearbyRepairShopsSection.tsx`:\n     - Remove the green pill box `\"M\341\273\237 c\341\273\255a \342\200\242 G\341\273\215i x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"`.\n     - Render single-row card (`p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between gap-3.5`): dark square icon (`relative flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white` + tiny emerald live dot), bold shop name (`shop.name`), 1 compact subline (`<span className=\"inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" /> \304\220ang m\341\273\237 \342\200\242 {formatShopCompactMeta(shop.distanceMeters, shop.address)}`), and minimal circular arrow (`h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-700`).\n   - `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx`:\n     - Replace white light header with Obsidian Dark Header (`bg-[#090D16] text-white rounded-b-[32px] pt-5 pb-12 px-5 relative overflow-hidden` + `bg-emerald-500/20 blur-3xl` glow).\n     - Title `\"MotoSOS Priority\"` + champagne gold badge `\"24/7 VIP Rescue\"` + clickable `text-slate-300` current street + frosted `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` pill.\n     - Dark-glass search bar (`bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/15 rounded-2xl p-1.5`) with `\"G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay\"` (`bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 font-bold rounded-xl`).\n     - Float `<HomeActionGrid />` directly below header (`-mt-7 mx-4 relative z-10`).\n     - Below inside `px-5 pb-28`: `<CampaignBannerCarousel />`, `<NearbyStationsCarousel />`, `<PartnerPerksCarousel />`, `<NearbyRepairShopsSection />`.\n   - `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts`:\n     - Add `handleSelectCampaignBanner(banner)` and `handleSelectPartnerPerk(perk)` (applying voucher + issue/mode + entering `\'map\'` tab), keeping file `< 250` lines.\n   - `/src/App.tsx`:\n     - Pass `onSelectCampaignBanner={s.handleSelectCampaignBanner}` and `onSelectPartnerPerk={s.handleSelectPartnerPerk}` to `<HomeTab />`.\n2. **Verify Tests, Line Limits, Compilation & Lint**:\n   - Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts` (all tests including new `repairShopApi.test.ts` assertions must pass).\n   - Run `find src -type f \\( -name \'*.ts\' -o -name \'*.tsx\' \\) -exec wc -l {} + | sort -nr | head -n 10` (every single file MUST be `< 250` lines).\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n   - Call `restart_dev_server`.\n3. **Verify Live UI in Chromium (`playwright-cli`)**:\n   - Run 1 comprehensive `430x900` Chromium check (`trap \'playwright-cli close || true\' EXIT`):\n     - Capture top of Home (`_verify/home-luxury-top.png`): verify Obsidian header `\"MotoSOS Priority\"`, `\"24/7 VIP Rescue\"`, dark frosted search bar + `\"G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay\"`, floating white 8-icon card (charcoal + emerald + rose accents), and Peek-a-boo 4-banner real-photo carousel (`86%` width with next card peeking).\n     - Test dragging `campaign-banner-carousel` horizontally without triggering navigation, then capture scrolled Home (`_verify/home-luxury-bottom.png`) showing `\"\304\220\341\272\267c Quy\341\273\201n \304\220\341\273\221i T\303\241c 24/7\"` 3 photo cards and compact single-row `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"` (dark `bg-slate-900` wrench icons, no bulky green box).\n     - Click Banner 1 (`ANTOAN20`) -> select an issue -> verify Step 2 has Safe Station mode + `ANTOAN20 (-20.000\304\221)` applied (`_verify/banner-voucher-applied.png`).\n     - Check `playwright-cli console error` reports `Errors: 0, Warnings: 0`.\n     - Inspect screenshots via `view_file` (do NOT fail to visually verify!), then `rm -rf _verify .playwright-cli`.\n4. **Final Response**: Concise Vietnamese summary of all completed visual & functional upgrades and verified results, without exposing file paths or internal details.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Language**: Vietnamese UI copy and final response.\n- **File Size**: Strictly `< 250` lines for every `.ts`/`.tsx` file under `src/`.\n- **UI/UX**: Preserve all working features (MapLibre, CARTO, Geoapify, OSRM, `activeLocation`, High-Accuracy GPS, Center Pin Mode, fixed pricing, 3 vouchers, 60fps yellow route cutting animation, horizontal filter chip swipe/drag). Ensure text contrast over banner photography uses the dark gradient scrim and fallback gradient is always present.\n- **Runtime**: Never use `window.alert` or `window.open`.\n</summary>"
