  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Prioritizing Parallel Updates**\n\nI\'m moving forward with parallel updates to five files. The focus is now on `/src/components/tabs/HomeActionGrid.tsx`, where I\'m wrapping the grid in a floating, elevated white card, adding some margin and rounding the corners for a cleaner aesthetic. This will give it a nice z-index, so it floats.\n\n\n**Refining Component Visuals**\n\nI\'m now focusing on two key components. First, I\'m adjusting the appearance of the icon boxes in `HomeActionGrid.tsx`, neutralizing their visual weight with charcoal/smoke-slate colors, except for \"L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p\" and \"G\341\273\255i SOS,\" which will be highlighted with emerald and rose accents, respectively. Second, I\'m redesigning `NearbyRepairShopsSection.tsx`, simplifying the card layout to a single-row design for a cleaner and more compact display of information. I am also replacing the green pill box with a single-row layout.\n\n\n**Updating Home Tab Design**\n\nI\'m now implementing the redesigned home tab, focusing on a dark, obsidian header with an emerald glow. The header will feature the title \"MotoSOS Priority\" with a champagne gold badge. The street address will be displayed below, clickable to open the location search modal. A frosted \"Test th\341\273\243\" pill and a dark search bar with a bright emerald button will complete the header. The HomeActionGrid will float below the header and I\'ll add the campaign carousel.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1602055554544128852"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Elevate HomeActionGrid into a floating luxury card and unify 6 icon tones to charcoal/slate with subtle emerald and rose accents only for Flat Tire and SOS\", \"EndLine\":147, \"Instruction\":\"Update HomeActionGrid tones and floating white card container\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"const NEUTRAL_ICON_TONE =\\n  \'border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50 text-slate-800\';\\n\\nconst ISSUE_GRID: Array<{\\n  id: IssueType;\\n  label: string;\\n  icon: typeof CircleDot;\\n  tone: string;\\n}> = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'flat_tire\',\\n    label: \'L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p\',\\n    icon: CircleDot,\\n    tone: \'border border-emerald-200/80 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'engine_dead\',\\n    label: \'Ch\341\272\277t m\303\241y\',\\n    icon: Wrench,\\n    tone: NEUTRAL_ICON_TONE,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'out_of_fuel\',\\n    label: \'H\341\272\277t x\304\203ng\',\\n    icon: Fuel,\\n    tone: NEUTRAL_ICON_TONE,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'battery_jump\',\\n    label: \'K\303\255ch b\303\254nh\',\\n    icon: BatteryCharging,\\n    tone: NEUTRAL_ICON_TONE,\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nconst STATION_GRID: Array<{\\n  id: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  icon: typeof Store;\\n  tone: string;\\n  category?: SafeStationCategory;\\n  isSos?: boolean;\\n}> = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'store\',\\n    label: \'C\341\273\255a h\303\240ng 24/7\',\\n    icon: Store,\\n    tone: NEUTRAL_ICON_TONE,\\n    category: \'convenience\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'fuel\',\\n    label: \'C\303\242y x\304\203ng\',\\n    icon: Fuel,\\n    tone: NEUTRAL_ICON_TONE,\\n    category: \'gas_station\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'police\',\\n    label: \'C\303\264ng an\',\\n    icon: Shield,\\n    tone: NEUTRAL_ICON_TONE,\\n    category: \'police\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'sos\',\\n    label: \'G\341\273\255i SOS\',\\n    icon: AlertCircle,\\n    tone: \'border border-rose-200/80 bg-rose-50 text-rose-700\',\\n    isSos: true,\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport function HomeActionGrid({\\n  onQuickIssueSelect,\\n  onQuickCategorySelect,\\n  onQuickSosSelect,\\n}: HomeActionGridProps) {\\n  return (\\n    <section\\n      aria-label=\\\"D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 c\341\273\251u h\341\273\231 v\303\240 Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n\\\"\\n      className=\\\"relative z-10 mx-4 -mt-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-4 shadow-[0_14px_34px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)]\\\"\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-2 gap-y-3.5\\\">\\n        {ISSUE_GRID.map((item) => {\\n          const Icon = item.icon;\\n          return (\\n            <motion.button\\n              key={item.id}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              whileTap={{ scale: 0.92 }}\\n              onClick={() => onQuickIssueSelect(item.id)}\\n              className=\\\"group flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 rounded-2xl p-1 text-center transition-transform focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 active:scale-95\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span\\n                className={`flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 ${item.tone}`}\\n              >\\n                <Icon className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-700\\\">\\n                {item.label}\\n              </span>\\n            </motion.button>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n\\n        {STATION_GRID.map((item) => {\\n          const Icon = item.icon;\\n          return (\\n            <motion.button\\n              key={item.id}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              whileTap={{ scale: 0.92 }}\\n              onClick={() =>\\n                item.isSos\\n                  ? onQuickSosSelect()\\n                  : item.category && onQuickCategorySelect(item.category)\\n              }\\n              className=\\\"group flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 rounded-2xl p-1 text-center transition-transform focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 active:scale-95\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span\\n                className={`flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 ${item.tone}`}\\n              >\\n                <Icon className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-700\\\">\\n                {item.label}\\n              </span>\\n            </motion.button>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n}\", \"StartLine\":19, \"TargetContent\":\"const ISSUE_GRID: Array<{\\n  id: IssueType;\\n  label: string;\\n  icon: typeof CircleDot;\\n  tone: string;\\n}> = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'flat_tire\',\\n    label: \'L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p\',\\n    icon: CircleDot,\\n    tone: \'bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-50 to-emerald-100/80 text-emerald-600\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'engine_dead\',\\n    label: \'Ch\341\272\277t m\303\241y\',\\n    icon: Wrench,\\n    tone: \'bg-gradient-to-b from-sky-50 to-sky-100/80 text-sky-600\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'out_of_fuel\',\\n    label: \'H\341\272\277t x\304\203ng\',\\n    icon: Fuel,\\n    tone: \'bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-50 to-amber-100/80 text-amber-600\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'battery_jump\',\\n    label: \'K\303\255ch b\303\254nh\',\\n    icon: BatteryCharging,\\n    tone: \'bg-gradient-to-b from-teal-50 to-teal-100/80 text-teal-600\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nconst STATION_GRID: Array<{\\n  id: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  icon: typeof Store;\\n  tone: string;\\n  category?: SafeStationCategory;\\n  isSos?: boolean;\\n}> = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'store\',\\n    label: \'C\341\273\255a h\303\240ng 24/7\',\\n    icon: Store,\\n    tone: \'bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-50 to-emerald-100/80 text-emerald-600\',\\n    category: \'convenience\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'fuel\',\\n    label: \'C\303\242y x\304\203ng\',\\n    icon: Fuel,\\n    tone: \'bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-50 to-amber-100/80 text-amber-600\',\\n    category: \'gas_station\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'police\',\\n    label: \'C\303\264ng an\',\\n    icon: Shield,\\n    tone: \'bg-gradient-to-b from-sky-50 to-sky-100/80 text-sky-600\',\\n    category: \'police\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'sos\',\\n    label: \'G\341\273\255i SOS\',\\n    icon: AlertCircle,\\n    tone: \'bg-gradient-to-b from-rose-50 to-rose-100/80 text-rose-600\',\\n    isSos: true,\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport function HomeActionGrid({\\n  onQuickIssueSelect,\\n  onQuickCategorySelect,\\n  onQuickSosSelect,\\n}: HomeActionGridProps) {\\n  return (\\n    <section aria-label=\\\"D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 c\341\273\251u h\341\273\231 v\303\240 Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n\\\" className=\\\"mt-5\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-2 gap-y-4\\\">\\n        {ISSUE_GRID.map((item) => {\\n          const Icon = item.icon;\\n          return (\\n            <motion.button\\n              key={item.id}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              whileTap={{ scale: 0.92 }}\\n              onClick={() => onQuickIssueSelect(item.id)}\\n              className=\\\"group flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 rounded-2xl p-1 text-center transition-transform focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 active:scale-95\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span\\n                className={`flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-black/5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 ${item.tone}`}\\n              >\\n                <Icon className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-700\\\">\\n                {i