    thinking: "**Analyzing Mobile Viewports**\n\nI\'m now running a comprehensive `playwright-cli` verification, targeting a `430x900` mobile viewport. This checks the Luxury Super-App Home redesign, voucher wiring, and console output. The tests use `http://localhost:3000`. I\'m focusing on ensuring all aspects function correctly.\n\n\n**Verifying Visual Elements**\n\nI\'ve moved on to meticulously verifying specific visual elements. I\'ve taken a screenshot of the top of the Home page to check the Obsidian header, search bar, the floating card, and the carousel. I\'m testing the horizontal dragging functionality of the banner carousel to ensure it scrolls correctly and doesn\'t trigger unwanted clicks. Afterwards, I will capture a screenshot of the bottom of the home tab.\n\n\n"
