  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals Now**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the visual elements. Those screenshots are quite striking. I\'ve taken note of the Obsidian Dark header with the emerald glow. The `MotoSOS Priority` label and champagne gold badge certainly stand out. I\'m moving on to dissect the other image components.\n\n\n**Dissecting UI Components**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into specific UI elements. The frosted pill combined with the address is interesting. I\'m noting the vibrant \'G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 ngay\' button, the floating 8-icon card with accented \'L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p\' and \'G\341\273\255i SOS\', and the real-photo carousel, with its peeking banner and pagination. I\'m also analyzing the \'Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n\' cards and the \'\304\220\341\272\267c Quy\341\273\201n \304\220\341\273\221i T\303\241c\' section, paying attention to the details of the \'Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe\' cards.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
