  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Home Repair Shops**\n\nI\'m now diving into live Chromium verification, specifically targeting the new requirements. My focus is on the `430x900` mobile viewport. I\'m starting with the Home Repair Shops, aiming to verify the shop\'s phone number after scrolling to a specific string.\n\n\n**Confirming Map Interactions**\n\nI\'m now focused on the map interactions, specifically the \"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\" mode and pin clicks. I\'m verifying the presence of `MapFilterChips` and simultaneous markers for Safe Stations, Repair Shops, and Gas Stations. Then I will click on a Repair Shop pin to confirm the OSRM route, map fitting, and the appearance of the `FloatingPlaceCard` with all required details. Finally, I will check the visibility of the `MapFilterChips` in step 2.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9642764412982674054"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"mkdir -p _verify\\ntrap \'playwright-cli close || true\' EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open http://localhost:3000\\nplaywright-cli resize 430 900\\nsleep 1.5\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => {\\n  await page.getByText(\'Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\').scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(600);\\n  const callLinks = await page.locator(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"home-repair-shop-\\\\\\\"] a[href^=\\\\\\\"tel:\\\\\\\"]\').count();\\n  const routeBtns = await page.locator(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"home-repair-shop-\\\\\\\"] button:has-text(\\\\\\\"\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i\\\\\\\")\').count();\\n  console.log(\'HOME_SHOPS_CHECK:\', JSON.stringify({ callLinks, routeBtns }));\\n  if (callLinks < 1 || routeBtns < 1) throw new Error(\'Expected Call and Route buttons on Home repair shops\');\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=_verify/home-shops-phone.png\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: \'B\341\272\243n \304\221\341\273\223\', exact: true }).click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"map-filter-chips\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\\n  const repairPins = await page.locator(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\"]\').count();\\n  const gasPins = await page.locator(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"gas-station-marker-\\\\\\\"]\').count();\\n  console.log(\'MAP_ALL_PINS:\', JSON.stringify({ repairPins, gasPins }));\\n  if (repairPins < 1 || gasPins < 1) throw new Error(\'Expected both repair shop and gas pins visible in All mode\');\\n  await page.locator(\'[data-testid^=\\\\\\\"repair-shop-marker-\\\\\\\"]\').first().click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"floating-place-card\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1000);\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=_verify/map-all-floating-card.png\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async page => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 s\341\273\255a xe ngay/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'text=B\306\260\341\273\233c 1 / 3\');\\n  const chipsVisibleStep1 = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"map-filter-chips\\\\\\\"]\').isVisible();\\n  if (!chipsVisibleStep1) throw new Error(\'MapFilterChips must stay visible on Step 1\');\\n  await page.getByText(\'L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p\', { exact: true }).click();\\n  await page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: /Ch\341\273\215n \304\221i\341\273\203m ch\341\273\235 th\341\273\243/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'text=B\306\260\341\273\233c 2 / 3\');\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"step2-place-list\\\\\\\"]\');\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(600);\\n  const chipsVisibleStep2 = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"map-filter-chips\\\\\\\"]\').isVisible();\\n  const listBox = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"step2-place-list\\\\\\\"]\').boundingBox();\\n  const confirmBox = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"confirm-order-btn\\\\\\\"]\').boundingBox();\\n  const step2CallLinks = await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"step2-place-list\\\\\\\"] a[href^=\\\\\\\"tel:\\\\\\\"]\').count();\\n  console.log(\'STEP2_GEOMETRY:\', JSON.stringify({ chipsVisibleStep2, listBottom: listBox?.y + listBox?.height, confirmTop: confirmBox?.y, step2CallLinks }));\\n  if (!chipsVisibleStep2) throw new Error(\'MapFilterChips must stay visible on Step 2\');\\n  if (!listBox || !confirmBox || (listBox.y + listBox.height) > confirmBox.y) {\\n    throw new Error(\'Step 2 place list is overlapping or obscured by confirm footer!\');\\n  }\\n  if (step2CallLinks < 1) throw new Error(\'Expected tel: call links inside Step 2 place list\');\\n  await page.locator(\'[data-testid=\\\\\\\"step2-place-list\\\\\\\"] button:has-text(\\\\\\\"\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i\\\\\\\")\').first().click(