    thinking: "**Observing Visual Validation**\n\nI\'m struck by the value of that visual inspection. The image `_verify/home-shops-phone.png` shows \"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\" remarkably well-defined! Each card boasts a dark `bg-slate-900` background, a wrench icon, and a live dot, with a bold name like \"H\341\272\273m 18A Nguy\341\273\205n.\" This is exactly what I was hoping to validate.\n\n\n**Refining Map Visualization**\n\nI\'m now focused on refining the map\'s visual presentation. Specifically, I\'m examining how different pin types are displayed in the image `_verify/map-all-floating-card.png`. I noticed the Repair Shop pins were outside the frame! My solution is to update `useMapMarkersSync.ts` to `fitBounds` when mapFilter is \'all\', so Safe Stations, Repair Shops, and Gas Stations are immediately visible. I\'m testing this by rebuilding and restarting the server.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_11919038410209551714"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Auto-fit map bounds in All mode so Safe Stations, Repair Shops, and Gas Stations are all visible together in viewport\", \"EndLine\":217, \"Instruction\":\"Include mapFilter === \'all\' bounds fitting in useMapMarkersSync.ts\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  useEffect(() => {\\n    const map = mapRef.current;\\n    if (!map || !mapReady || step === \'tracking\' || inspectRoute || gasRoute) return;\\n\\n    if (mapFilter === \'all\') {\\n      const points: [number, number][] = [\\n        [userCoord.lng, userCoord.lat],\\n        ...stations.slice(0, 3).map((s): [number, number] => [s.coord.lng, s.coord.lat]),\\n        ...openRepairShops.slice(0, 2).map((s): [number, number] => [s.coord.lng, s.coord.lat]),\\n        ...gasStations.slice(0, 2).map((g): [number, number] => [g.coord.lng, g.coord.lat]),\\n      ];\\n      if (points.length > 1) {\\n        const bounds = computeBoundsBox(points);\\n        if (bounds) fitMapBoundsSafely(map, containerRef.current, bounds, 15.0, 550);\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (mapFilter === \'repair_shops\' && openRepairShops.length > 0) {\\n      const points: [number, number][] = [\\n        [userCoord.lng, userCoord.lat],\\n        ...openRepairShops.slice(0, 5).map((s): [number, number] => [s.coord.lng, s.coord.lat]),\\n      ];\\n      const bounds = computeBoundsBox(points);\\n      if (bounds) fitMapBoundsSafely(map, containerRef.current, bounds, 15.0, 550);\\n    }\\n\\n    if (mapFilter === \'gas_stations\' && gasStations.length > 0) {\\n      const points: [number, number][] = [\\n        [userCoord.lng, userCoord.lat],\\n        ...gasStations.slice(0, 5).map((g): [number, number] => [g.coord.lng, g.coord.lat]),\\n      ];\\n      const bounds = computeBoundsBox(points);\\n      if (bounds) fitMapBoundsSafely(map, containerRef.current, bounds, 15.2, 550);\\n    }\\n  }, [mapFilter, step, mapReady, stations, openRepairShops, gasStations, inspectRoute, gasRoute, userCoord.lat, userCoord.lng]);\\n\\n  return {\\n    clearAllMarkers: () => {\\n      stationMarkersRef.current.forEach((m) => m.remove());\\n      stationMarkersRef.current = [];\\n      repairShopMarkersRef.current.forEach((m) => m.remove());\\n      repairShopMarkersRef.current = [];\\n      gasMarkersRef.current.forEach((m) => m.remove());\\n      gasMarkersRef.current = [];\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\", \"StartLine\":184, \"TargetContent\":\"  useEffect(() => {\\n    const map = mapRef.current;\\n    if (!map || !mapReady || step === \'tracking\' || inspectRoute || gasRoute) return;\\n\\n    if (mapFilter === \'repair_shops\' && openRepairShops.length > 0) {\\n      const points: [number, number][] = [\\n        [userCoord.lng, userCoord.lat],\\n        ...openRepairShops.slice(0, 5).map((s): [number, number] => [s.coord.lng, s.coord.lat]),\\n      ];\\n      const bounds = computeBoundsBox(points);\\n      if (bounds) fitMapBoundsSafely(map, containerRef.current, bounds, 15.0, 550);\\n    }\\n\\n    if (mapFilter === \'gas_stations\' && gasStations.length > 0) {\\n      const points: [number, number][] = [\\n        [userCoord.lng, userCoord.lat],\\n        ...gasStations.slice(0, 5).map((g): [number, number] => [g.coord.lng, g.coord.lat]),\\n      ];\\n      const bounds = computeBoundsBox(points);\\n      if (bounds) fitMapBoundsSafely(map, containerRef.current, bounds, 15.2, 550);\\n    }\\n  }, [mapFilter, step, mapReady, openRepairShops, gasStations, inspectRoute, gasRoute, userCoord.lat, userCoord.lng]);\\n\\n  return {\\n    clearAllMarkers: () => {\\n      stationMarkersRef.current.forEach((m) => m.remove());\\n      stationMarkersRef.current = [];\\n      repairShopMarkersRef.current.forEach((m) => m.remove());\\n      repairShopMarkersRef.current = [];\\n      gasMarkersRef.current.forEach((m) => m.remove());\\n      gasMarkersRef.current = [];\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/hooks/useMapMarkersSync.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating All-mode bounds fitting in useMapMarkersSync\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update All-mode bounds fitting\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\222\016\n\217\016\001i\024}\023\354\337\350)T\301\2439>\ng\305\346\364\274\301\362F\260\273\335q\270\232\215\206a\372g(E\242\r\310\204\322\262h\270\361\237)\304;-f\371\217]\003\352\'\a\025\244\256\252\344\036\247\216\303\036~\246\356\246\336\351\f\030\226r\342\303\376\245 \333\024d\a\265r\271\2007\016e\223nz\370#w\367\3452E\374\357x-\271x\267Rc\270\344\342\315%\311\r\3740\231\234\211\325E\374\357\227\200\311\234\363\3729\265\025I\245V\n\2401\307{\263\317s\246\2060.;\263\353Re\227*CeQ\326\375\317\\\202\335\320\236%I\177\347\'J}s\203\235\271/j\223\273)\354\371\037\a(\312\337F/0\215l\316\2206\341\b\033{\263\216\032\261\316\354l\005$\200\030\342&z3\v\\\255\254\334s\356\305%\266\215\266\372\252f\331\245\033}P\363\022)\036Zv\263\216\313\306\317\033\232)\226M!m\326\241\025\375\212\214\350-\336o9\234C\340;\373\352!4\"IO\304\033\323:\363\361B!\343\237\207d\254p\261_vv\234\206@\241\033\317\356\202\234sj\273:\240\331\251S\256sX\336\307\335;\216s\265l\020\265x\311\321\345T\371i\346\r\034!\016bS\200\037v%6N\276\317\212\300\317|\247\025\325\355\005\305t\245\325\374\024=\211\215\364\366\367\216\260WS\236\227\\\345.\020\312\016|\323\266\023\316(>\317_L\025BFg\363p\224p\257\030\350\334\206\022\257\252\255\307Yj\321\252QE\r6\0328G\362\3441\265\276\330w\273&\027\2223|\322)\336\t\036\343\326\256P\267\364\254\252!gG\336A\025\301\204\351\223\224|L\204\371\032mC\f\b\330MB\302R\311e\334\375\204\v\217U\273\363\220=@8$.}I\000\214\'\366\367)\221\034\214i\004\311\261h\325)\343\225K\211\363\251\253+\234y\032\037\241\035\023\213\254\fNBL\261(0\221\320L\242V\361\302\356\350\005\251a8\272\250\025M\223\r\023\300(\267\327xtZv\273\270\251\313\262\233\261v\f\037\312\236\216b\351y\342\212i6\337IX\b\017\313\b]\331ie\265\343%\233\221\245\252\337\031\253\332\367LB\204\251N^\2325kyJ,\361`j\237\000\322E\245A\335\335.\206\241\356jg\271\244\034\364\211\271\030/\213Yw\240\257\302\231[\241W\357\201\226\337\247\n\342jh\030\314\311\262\377\336T\230U\207\340z\271\207\363\250L1q\266\