  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 5
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **MotoSOS** \342\200\224 mobile-first motorbike rescue & 24/7 Safe Station web app (React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind CSS v4 + TypeScript + MapLibre GL + CARTO Positron + Geoapify + OSRM + `motion/react`) centered inside a `430px` phone shell (`max-w-[430px] h-[100dvh]`) on `bg-slate-900`.\n- **Previous Session Turn Completed**: Luxury Super-App Home Redesign (`MotoSOS Priority` Obsidian header `#090D16`, `24/7 VIP Rescue`, elevated floating 8-icon card, 4-banner real-photo Peek-a-boo carousel with `ANTOAN20`/`BANMOI25`/`DEMKHUYA15`, `\304\220\341\272\267c Quy\341\273\201n \304\220\341\273\221i T\303\241c 24/7`, compact single-row repair shop cards, normalized `\"Ti\341\273\207m S\341\273\255a Xe L\306\260u \304\220\341\273\231ng\"` & `\"TP.HCM\"`) \342\200\224 verified in Chromium (`430x900`).\n- **Active User Request (Implementation Complete, Final Browser Re-Verification Pending)**:\n  Preserve all existing functionality and upgrade the Map Tab, Step 2, and Repair Shop contact details:\n  1. **Fix Step 2 Obscured List & Expand Map Visibility**:\n     - Prevent `\"Gi\303\241 d\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 g\341\273\221c / X\303\241c nh\341\272\255n g\341\273\215i th\341\273\243\"` footer from covering the Step 2 place list: use a compact 2-column mode selector (`T\341\272\241i ch\341\273\227` | `Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n`) and an explicit scrollable container (`max-h-[210px] overflow-y-auto space-y-2 pr-1`) positioned cleanly ABOVE the pinned invoice/confirm block.\n     - Add a Collapse/Expand toggle button (`\"Thu g\341\273\215n\"` / `\"M\341\273\237 r\341\273\231ng\"`, `data-testid=\"toggle-sheet-btn\"`) on `BottomSheetShell` so users can collapse the sheet (`max-h-[72px]`) to view the full map & routes at any step.\n     - Keep `MapFilterChips` (`T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243` | `C\303\242y x\304\203ng` | `Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe (\304\220ang m\341\273\237)` | `Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n 24/7`) mounted below the header on ALL steps whenever not in Center Pin mode.\n  2. **Unified Map Pins in `\"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"` Mode + OSRM Route & Floating Place Card**:\n     - When `mapFilter === \'all\'`, simultaneously render:\n       - Safe Stations 24/7: Emerald circle pins (`bg-emerald-500 text-white border-2 border-white`)\n       - Open Repair Shops: Blue circle pins (`bg-blue-600`) with emerald live dot (`bg-emerald-400`)\n       - Nearest Gas Stations: Amber circle pins (`bg-amber-500`)\n     - Auto-`fitBounds` in `all` mode across `[userCoord, ...stations.slice(0,3), ...openRepairShops.slice(0,2), ...gasStations.slice(0,2)]` (`maxZoom: 15.0`) so all 3 marker types fit inside the viewport.\n     - Tapping ANY pin on the map OR tapping `\"\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i\"` / selecting a place in lists immediately calls OSRM (`fetchWalkingRoute` or `fetchMechanicDrivingRoute`), fits bounds (`fitMapBoundsSafely`), and renders a compact **Floating Place Card** (`FloatingPlaceCard.tsx`) right above `BottomSheetShell` with name, badge, distance, ETA, address, phone (for shops), and quick action buttons (`G\341\273\215i 09xx...`, `\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i`, `\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y`, `Maps`).\n  3. **Deterministic Vietnamese Mobile Phones & 1-Tap Actions Everywhere**:\n     - Check `properties.contact?.phone || properties.datasource?.raw?.phone`; if missing, deterministically assign a standard VN mobile hotline from an 8-number pool (`REPAIR_SHOP_PHONE_POOL`: `0908 412 739`, `0933 819 204`, `0918 654 321`, etc.) hashed by `shop.id` so numbers never jump across reloads.\n     - Show the phone number + `\"G\341\273\215i 09xx...\"` (`href=\"tel:...\"`) + `\"\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i\"` on:\n       1. `FloatingPlaceCard` when inspecting a Repair Shop pin/card\n       2. Every Repair Shop row in Step 2\'s list (`Step2PlaceListPicker.tsx`)\n       3. `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"` on the Home Tab (`NearbyRepairShopsSection.tsx`)\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed Code Edits (All Compiled, Linted & Unit-Tested)\n1. `/src/types/rescue.ts`: Added `InspectedPlace` discriminated union (`safe_station` | `repair_shop` | `gas_station`).\n2. `/src/utils/repairShopApi.ts`: Added `REPAIR_SHOP_PHONE_POOL`, deterministic `resolveRepairShopPhone(shopId, rawPhone)`, and `formatShortCallLabel(phone)`.\n3. `/src/utils/repairShopApi.test.ts`: Added unit tests covering `resolveRepairShopPhone` (`+84` normalization, deterministic fallback format `09xx xxx xxx`) and `formatShortCallLabel`. **All 39/39 unit tests pass**.\n4. `/src/components/map/mapMarkers.ts`: Updated `createStationMarkerElement` to solid `bg-emerald-500 text-white border-2 border-white` pins.\n5. `/src/hooks/useActivePlaceInspect.ts` *(created)*: Manages `inspectedPlace`, `inspectRoute`, `inspectRouteSummary`, `isLoadingInspectRoute`, `inspectAndRoutePlace`, and `clearInspection` via OSRM (`fetchMechanicDrivingRoute` for shops, `fetchWalkingRoute` for safe stations / gas stations).\n6. `/src/components/map/FloatingPlaceCard.tsx` *(created)*: Compact floating card with `data-testid=\"floating-place-card\"`, displaying distance/ETA, address, phone, `G\341\273\215i 09xx...` (`tel:`), `\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i`, `\304\220\303\263n t\341\272\241i \304\221\303\242y` (for stations/gas), and Google Maps link.\n7. `/src/components/steps/Step2PlaceListPicker.tsx` *(created)*: Displays distance-sorted nearby Safe Stations, Open Repair Shops (with phone + `G\341\273\215i 09xx...` + `\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i`), and Gas Stations inside `max-h-[210px] overflow-y-auto space-y-2 pr-1` (`data-testid=\"step2-place-list\"`), filtered dynamically by `mapFilter`.\n8. `/src/components/BottomSheetShell.tsx`: Added `floatingTopSlot` right above the sheet alongside `LocateFixed`, `data-testid=\"toggle-sheet-btn\"` (`Thu g\341\273\215n` / `M\341\273\237 r\341\273\231ng`, resetting to expanded on `step` change), and `max-h-[76%]` on Step 2 (`pickup`).\n9. `/src/components/steps/PickupSelectionStep.tsx`: Replaced vertical radio cards + old list with compact 2-column mode selector (`T\341\272\241i ch\341\273\227` | `Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n`) and `<Step2PlaceListPicker />` positioned cleanly above pinned `OrderInvoiceBar`.\n10. `/src/components/tabs/NearbyRepairShopsSection.tsx`: Semantic `<article>` cards (`data-testid=\"home-repair-shop-${shop.id}\"`, no nested interactive elements) showing `shop.phone`, `<a href=\"tel:...\">G\341\273\215i 09xx...</a>`, and `<button>\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i</button>`.\n11. `/src/hooks/useMapMarkersSync.ts`: Renders all 3 pin layers in `\'all\'` mode (`step !== \'tracking\'`), binds click -> `onInspectPlace`, renders/fits `inspectRoute` onto `walking-route` / `shop-route` / `gas-route`, and auto-fits `\'all\'` bounds (`maxZoom: 15.0`) to show all 3 categories on initial load.\n12. `/src/components/RescueMap.tsx`, `/src/components/tabs/MapBottomSheetContent.tsx`, `/src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx`, `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts`, `/src/App.tsx`: Fully wired; `MapFilterChips` renders whenever `!props.pinPicker.isActive` (every step!).\n13. Removed superseded files: `/src/components/map/StationPreviewCard.tsx`, `/src/components/steps/RepairShopDetailSheet.tsx`, `/src/components/steps/SafeStationListPicker.tsx`.\n\n### Verification Status After Final Edit (`useMapMarkersSync.ts`)\n- **Unit tests**: `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts` -> **39/39 passed**.\n- **Line count audit**: Max file size in `src/` is **246 lines** (`useRescueOrderState.ts`), `MapTabView.tsx` = 237, `Step2PlaceListPicker.tsx` = 234, `PickupSelectionStep.tsx` = 232 \342\200\224 **all `< 250` lines**.\n- **`compile_applet` + `lint_applet`**: Both **succeeded with 0 errors**.\n- **NOT YET DONE after final `useMapMarkersSync.ts` edit**:\n  - `restart_dev_server` (must be called so dev server serves updated `useMapMarkersSync.ts`).\n  - Complete end-to-end Chromium visual verification & screenshot inspection (`_verify/*.png` currently still contains older `_verify/home-shops-phone.png` and pre-bounds-fix `_verify/map-all-floating-card.png`).\n\n### Skills Already Read\n- `ultra-mode`, `frontend-design`, `computer-use` (all read earlier in session).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Step 1 Start Button Text on Map Idle**: `IdleHomeStep.tsx` renders **`G\341\273\214I S\341\273\254A XE KH\341\272\250N C\341\272\244P`** (NOT `\"G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 s\341\273\255a xe ngay\"` \342\200\224 use `getByRole(\'button\', { name: /G\341\273\214I S\341\273\254A XE KH\341\272\250N C\341\272\244P/i })` in Playwright!).\n- **HTML Nesting Hygiene**: `NearbyRepairShopsSection` and `Step2PlaceListPicker` use `<article>` / `<div>` wrappers around separate `<a href=\"tel:...\">` and `<button>` controls \342\200\224 never nesting interactive tags inside `<button>`.\n- **Why First Map Test Timed Out Clicking Pin**: Before the final edit to `useMapMarkersSync.ts`, `mapFilter === \'all\'` left zoom at `15.2`, putting Geoapify\'s closest open repair shop (`1104m` away) outside the `430x900` viewport (`element is outside of the viewport`). Adding the `\'all\'` mode `fitBounds` fixes that so all 3 pin colors are clickable on initial Map open.\n- **Confirmed Visually in `_verify/home-shops-phone.png`**: Home tab repair shop cards look crisp (`H\341\272\273m 18A Nguy\341\273\205n Th\341\273\213 Minh Khai` with `0978 312 690` / `G\341\273\215i 0978...` / `\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i`, `S\306\241n S\341\273\255a Xe` with `0933 819 204`, `Ti\341\273\207m S\341\273\255a Xe L\306\260u \304\220\341\273\231ng`).\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n1. `playwright-cli` unknown CLI flags (`--viewport-size`, `--headless`) -> resolved by opening URL then calling `playwright-cli resize 430 900` (headless is default).\n2. `MapTabView.tsx` reached `266` lines -> compacted imports/props to `237` lines (strictly `< 250`).\n3. `repair-shop-marker-*` outside viewport in `\'all\'` mode -> fixed in `useMapMarkersSync.ts` by fitting `\'all\'` mode bounds across nearest stations, repair shops, and gas stations (`maxZoom: 15.0`).\n4. Playwright selector `/G\341\273\215i th\341\273\243 s\341\273\255a xe ngay/i` timed out on `IdleHomeStep` -> actual button text in `IdleHomeStep.tsx` line 29 is **`G\341\273\214I S\341\273\254A XE KH\341\272\250N C\341\272\244P`**.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Currently `_verify/` holds leftover screenshots (`home-shops-phone.png`, `map-all-floating-card.png`) from the aborted run before `useMapMarkersSync.ts` was updated; `.playwright-cli` browser was closed cleanly via `trap` (0 open sessions, 0 console errors).\n- Dev server has NOT yet been restarted after editing `useMapMarkersSync.ts`.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. Call `restart_dev_server` so port 3000 serves the latest build including the `\'all\'`-mode `fitBounds` fix.\n2. Run 1 clean `playwright-cli` verification script at `430x900` (`trap \'playwright-cli close || true\' EXIT`):\n   - **Test A (`_verify/verify-home-shops.png`)**: Scroll Home to `\"Ti\341\273\207m s\341\273\255a xe \304\221ang m\341\273\237 g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n\"` -> verify phone numbers, `a[href^=\"tel:\"]`, and `\"\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i\"` buttons, then click `\"\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i\"` on the first Home repair shop -> verify Map tab opens, OSRM route draws, and `[data-testid=\"floating-place-card\"]` displays Name + Distance + ETA + Phone + `\"G\341\273\215i 09...\"`.\n   - **Test B (`_verify/verify-map-all.png`)**: Close FloatingPlaceCard (`X`), click `\"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"` tab chip -> verify all 3 marker layers (Safe Station emerald, Repair Shop blue `[data-testid^=\"repair-shop-marker-\"]`, Gas Station amber `[data-testid^=\"gas-station-marker-\"]`) are visible in viewport, then click an in-viewport `[data-testid^=\"repair-shop-marker-\"]` -> verify `[data-testid=\"floating-place-card\"]` appears cleanly right above `BottomSheetShell`.\n   - **Test C (`_verify/verify-step2-list.png` & `_verify/verify-step2-collapsed.png`)**: Click `getByRole(\'button\', { name: /G\341\273\214I S\341\273\254A XE KH\341\272\250N C\341\272\244P/i })` -> verify `[data-testid=\"map-filter-chips\"]` is visible on Step 1 -> click `L\341\273\247ng l\341\273\221p` -> click `Ch\341\273\215n \304\221i\341\273\203m ch\341\273\235 th\341\273\243` -> verify `[data-testid=\"map-filter-chips\"]` is visible on Step 2, `[data-testid=\"step2-place-list\"]` sits strictly above `[data-testid=\"confirm-order-btn\"]` with zero overlap, contains `tel:` call links, clicking `\"\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i\"` on a Step 2 row shows `[data-testid=\"floating-place-card\"]`, and clicking `[data-testid=\"toggle-sheet-btn\"]` collapses the Bottom Sheet cleanly while keeping the map + route + `FloatingPlaceCard` visible.\n   - Check `playwright-cli console error` (`Errors: 0, Warnings: 0`).\n3. Call `view_file` on `_verify/verify-map-all.png`, `_verify/verify-step2-list.png`, and `_verify/verify-step2-collapsed.png` to visually inspect rendered UI for zero clipping, zero overlap, and proper alignment. If any visual issue appears, fix and re-verify; once confirmed clean, run `rm -rf _verify .playwright-cli`.\n4. Send a concise Vietnamese summary covering all verified changes (without exposing file paths or internal details).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Language**: Vietnamese UI copy and final summary response.\n- **Line Limit**: Strictly `< 250` lines per `.ts`/`.tsx` file under `src/`.\n- **Cleanliness**: Remove `_verify` and `.playwright-cli` before finishing; never use `window.alert` or `window.open`; preserve Clean Light Mode, fixed pricing, vouchers, and 60fps route animation.\n</summary>"
