  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Carousel Interaction**\n\nI\'m now running the `playwright-cli` verification on `http://localhost:3000` at coordinates `430 900`. I\'m recording a video, `.playwright-cli/carousel-motion.webm`, and asserting numeric measurements related to the scroll, hover pause, and subsequent resume. This should validate the carousel\'s motion and interaction as expected.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_891148090554771428"
