  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Completing Police Station Integration**\n\nI\'m making swift progress on incorporating police station markers. I just finished adding the `createPoliceStationMarkerElement` function and now I\'m adapting `FloatingPlaceCard.tsx` to handle the \'police_station\' type. My next step will be updating `useMapMarkersSync.ts` to ensure these markers are synced properly across \'all\' and \'police_stations\' view modes.\n\n\n**Implementing Police Station Edits**\n\nI\'m now focusing on parallel edits: integrating the \'police_station\' view, mapping police routes in indigo, and adjusting the bottom sheet for the police list height. Specifically, I\'m working to integrate police station details into `FloatingPlaceCard.tsx`, incorporating badges, and phone links including call options like \"G\341\273\215i 113\" when the local phone number is unavailable. I\'m also ensuring phone numbers are handled correctly and dynamically within the card.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7057555570093518211"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add createPoliceStationMarkerElement with indigo shield badge and G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t tag\", \"EndLine\":140, \"Instruction\":\"Add createPoliceStationMarkerElement right after createGasStationMarkerElement\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const pin = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n  pin.className = isHighlighted\\n    ? \'relative flex items-center justify-center bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full p-2 border-2 border-white shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/40 ring-4 ring-amber-500/25 scale-110 transition-transform\'\\n    : \'relative flex items-center justify-center bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full p-2 border-2 border-white shadow-md transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\';\\n  pin.innerHTML = getCategorySvgMarkup(\'gas_station\');\\n\\n  button.appendChild(pin);\\n  return button;\\n}\\n\\nexport function createPoliceStationMarkerElement(\\n  station: PoliceStation,\\n  isHighlighted: boolean,\\n  onClick: () => void,\\n): HTMLButtonElement {\\n  const button = document.createElement(\'button\');\\n  button.type = \'button\';\\n  button.setAttribute(\'data-testid\', `police-station-marker-${station.id}`);\\n  button.setAttribute(\\n    \'aria-label\',\\n    `${station.name}, ${station.distanceMeters}m \302\267 ${station.durationMinutes} ph\303\272t`,\\n  );\\n  button.setAttribute(\'aria-pressed\', String(isHighlighted));\\n  button.className =\\n    \'group relative flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full focus:outline-none cursor-pointer\';\\n  button.addEventListener(\'click\', (event) => {\\n    event.stopPropagation();\\n    onClick();\\n  });\\n\\n  const pin = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n  pin.className = isHighlighted\\n    ? \'relative flex items-center justify-center bg-indigo-700 text-white rounded-full p-2 border-2 border-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-700/40 ring-4 ring-indigo-500/30 scale-110 transition-transform\'\\n    : \'relative flex items-center justify-center bg-indigo-700 text-white rounded-full p-2 border-2 border-white shadow-md transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\';\\n  pin.innerHTML = getCategorySvgMarkup(\'police\');\\n  button.appendChild(pin);\\n\\n  if (station.isNearest) {\\n    const tag = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n    tag.className =\\n      \'pointer-events-none absolute -top-2.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-indigo-700 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-extrabold text-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-white whitespace-nowrap\';\\n    tag.textContent = \'G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\';\\n    button.appendChild(tag);\\n  }\\n\\n  return button;\\n}\", \"StartLine\":124, \"TargetContent\":\"  const pin = document.createElement(\'span\');\\n  pin.className = isHighlighted\\n    ? \'relative flex items-center justify-center bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full p-2 border-2 border-white shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/40 ring-4 ring-amber-500/25 scale-110 transition-transform\'\\n    : \'relative flex items-center justify-center bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full p-2 border-2 border-white shadow-md transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\';\\n  pin.innerHTML = getCategorySvgMarkup(\'gas_station\');\\n\\n  button.appendChild(pin);\\n  return button;\\n}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/map/mapMarkers.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding police marker builder to mapMarkers.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Police marker builder\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\350\f\n\345\f\001i\024}\023V\342\216\352\033\350\227\273\203{V\267F<\343\023\232m\v\375\263\302~\314?\351\027\367\256Q\354\361\035\202\341\034QVJE\221!\037WF0\323\364\225_{\002II\204\036\254Dfh\004^D5\177\241\305w\270\020\024g\027\265\r\377?\001\fJj\264zy\302\273\332\237;\322\b\250\350\262\337\312\360~\324\345\"\021\032\032\210\237\240\313\224\335\a\'\202IO\003x\244#+\327\242\256;\322\372\263\300?]\0172\3323\004\247\232\301\335\323>\235<\f\257.o\036\233\2106\\\374l\036Qz\353/fL\207ke\300\320\252\353\302^<]\254\220I\225\034d\374\224\036H\307\204B^\336,\f+\257D&\225\2059\023\347\026\\\331\367\236\034\021\325]\003\261U\251\344/\257\177\t\231\226\211.\361\300}\232\357D\365\240\2344\212\235p\n\365\332h\251F`?\327\330\256\226\213\025\312\271.\272\316<L\330\257MB\031\354\317\020K\207(\033B\210\305\367\266\2660R\267\002\365s\257X\245\271\372[Q\340|\356hnY8\362\320\370\311wp\030\235G\254V&\300}\030\210\232\212M\253y\372G\361h\324\250\273X7~U~\323\202\266\303J\262N\342BU\\\351+q\335W\363\315\rG\261aHo\303\251C*\307pQU\253\370l\375)\206\030\272r\201\\\367<\205\274\362\222\370\344t-\330\207\260q9\331\306\377\234\320a|\'\262\206\v\252Hq]\304&4\3459j\314\237\213\320j\303\354\342\243\217\315\264\004j\273\251/\364?^\324\354r1E5a9\376\331\022\"\364\r1\202G\200\342\364\342\271\274\371\346\322\214\016\356\304\273!\331\360\264 4ak\235w\247W\t\032\326\315&\311\351\373\345\375\243\'\001i\240@0We\330D\017\346v\232\374p|k4\303w\375w`\302k\206p)\320Z\27567\312h\326\312\241\'TX\2626\221t\235\306\266\232\r\344#\027f\2010C\252.\356\204\344\026,\224\vR\342|M\322\255\342\273u\003\321\2305\241\336N_\346P\204\223\221\205<\330I\306\372\206O\301?%\222\307C\277\375\315\251h\232,x\314\003\204\266Su\344@\251\326&b\324\276\n\332P$1p~\300=\230\351>e\216\032,\266M-?\213p\030\222\227\aO#*!\2034I(4\271\365\237\210[\257G\'\234\334\t\257\325\001\344\030\277\f\341WzF\205g\241Z\320F\024\313\022\335\261\265\365.\026!\300q\357j\002\260@,\256\2303\250\314\024\363Y\337\024\305\362{\271\272n*\274\307\305\023\351\357\265\325\342\314\002N\333\r\321\005\177\353j\2717J\022\351/\273P\317\316\315, \220\031w\032\365\336\373\234\016kjm\002\254!W\356\027\221tX\325\200\255;y\003>\247\272g\260\305\t\020\375\016X&\"\237gf\344\375o\t6\027\177\317\333\316\350\0202\033\036:\333\240~\376\367$2\004\377\031\365/\fwT\336i7B\354\237\345\3028\362\257\"\322\b\266\256\330{\323\245J\374u\224s\020\245-pig\311\222\357\0013\225/\0378\001%\033\202\263\354S\004\no\236[\332\241\2279\246\260d\346\306\004\201\006\030e\301u`\310\250\315t\324j\335\177\016\362]\266\367F\272\346Z-\t\230\377\335\f\tA\241\237\252e\b\357E3\227\253\022\005\200J\312~N/.\217p\327\017\005\315\356G\312\001\344\225\375,\307\364i\370\311\242b1\203\b\223pKh\r\033\325\n\275\331\352\310t>\016C^P\324xe\350\022\207\2052\370\303Kwz\372\274I;\263\240\363I\272\343JHA\206\235\206\315\035\005\021\271O_L\376\262\207\v\325~$E\000d\341\260\341\327\245%\"\a\245^\337\232\371\277{\302\'`2\217\323\362\313\023\002\214\337%]\004C#\351\006\234[\321\233\260t\341Rx\002\231f\330\337v~\177\350\b\352\271e\177!\250\027\303\230v\316\366\310\023p]\016\200\fl\356~\034\a\266\252\360yE8\341g\376z/\314\027\300\312\020\206\302`\267n4\201:T\324\333\316\267\025\375h_\374\367(\346\2541\202=&\323\035~\021\026\321D\361\322\255\367<\305s\032\300@\222\322A\322\262|\250\"\"9\001\351\264[\224|\200\021\204\261\261<\260v\310\361\355\375N2\244\321\262-\377\336ck\222\2621\016\234\323\361\374\350\3648\211\276\n$\302^\254*z\322\306\025\205Q\364Rv\2007\037\334\367\366\351\034\364R\326/{^\266\256\355\237\313\357\242\317\035\372O\275VLL::-WY\022\027\030St\016\360\236\252\b\027\340\367\320E\216\256\354\372\266%\230x$\035\342\253\310\364V\242+\021\217\a\252EgL\342\365\245`\376\0013]OS\bX\303\177\354\275v|\327\343\276\345\254_\034\223\323\356\260v\030\355\247\277\000\030\320\321\302,~\3128|D\223\030H\311\3334\226\344!\374M\031\230\v\315/\253\017x\222edo^\216\253\344G\251\2314`\343\311dO\325\234\336u\315*;e\347\372\256\211\204\236\b\2315OyD\v\317\2234o\215\306\n\240\222\221\034\305i\224\226\366m\266\271\177A\336W\217\231\265\333\240\026Z\021/\035|\212\371pN\3606$\323\316\217\373ssE\325\024\223x\325B7Nf\265-\206\312\272\352\263\367\030-\222)\316\376`\004\366\314\"\324\364`\227\211&d\242H7\365^\024)\240\302\343\370\223\362\032\236>\363^\364|D]\354\271\355\244Cu4\254\206\t\372D\201{\025$\003&:\334\032u|R\376\nA\343\306wE\361\215\027J`\340-\213\363@jh(\305\005\"\267C\203~\005}\255x\256t\360\253\303\234\205^Pe\376RJ\a\211\244\374\367\024\334\000\230\225 \346\200w.\004s\035\263\353\307^72\377\235\266\267Ug\367k\034\\<a\v\373\321\004Y\022+\016\273\017\344cE\361G\351\000\3039:H\206,T\336\261\345@|/\202\260-\227\333\356\352"
