  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Component Dependencies**\n\nI\'m currently focused on evaluating `Step2PlaceListPicker.tsx`. This component is already at 235 lines. I\'m considering limiting the place types to Safe Stations, Repair Shops, and Gas Stations within Step 2, or reducing the component to a maximum of 220 lines. This might allow for the clean implementation of `policeStations`.\n\n\n**Refining Component Structure**\n\nI\'ve made progress on optimizing `Step2PlaceListPicker`. Integrating the \"C\303\264ng an\" chip for Police Stations directly within the picker is a great idea. I\'m focusing on keeping it under 245 lines, potentially through a badge config map. Also, I\'ve realized Safe Stations and Gas Stations share a row layout, and Repair/Police Stations add phone/call. I\'m streamlining these to get it down to ~180 lines!\n\nI\'m now focusing on `useRescueOrderState.ts`, which is currently at 247 lines. I need to keep it under 250, say ~230 lines, by moving `applyPromotion`, `handleSelectCampaignBanner`, or `handleSelectPartnerPerk`. I\'ll also look at grouping `policeStations = usePoliceStationState(...)` to keep the line count manageable. The immediate steps are importing and instantiating `usePoliceStationState`.\n\n\n**Integrating Police Station Functionality**\n\nI\'m now integrating `policeStations` within `useRescueOrderState.ts` and optimizing its interactions. I\'ve added a handler to open the map and display police stations. I\'m also ensuring the correct route is cleared under specific circumstances. I\'m focusing on handling filter changes, particularly for the `\"C\303\264ng an\"` chip, and considering the route drawing logic when this filter is active.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_601845531449292990"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Check, Fuel, Loader2, Navigation, Phone, Shield, ShieldCheck, Wrench } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type {\\n  GasStation,\\n  InspectedPlace,\\n  MapLayerFilter,\\n  PoliceStation,\\n  RepairShop,\\n  SafeStation,\\n} from \'../../types/rescue\';\\nimport { formatPoliceDistanceLabel } from \'../../utils/policeStationApi\';\\nimport { formatShortCallLabel, formatShopDistanceLabel } from \'../../utils/repairShopApi\';\\nimport { formatWalkingDistance } from \'../../utils/rescueLogic\';\\n\\ninterface Step2PlaceListPickerProps {\\n  mapFilter: MapLayerFilter;\\n  stations: SafeStation[];\\n  openRepairShops: RepairShop[];\\n  gasStations: GasStation[];\\n  policeStations: PoliceStation[];\\n  selectedStationId: string | null;\\n  inspectedPlace: InspectedPlace | null;\\n  isLoadingRoute: boolean;\\n  onSelectSafeStation: (station: SafeStation) => void;\\n  onSelectGasStation: (station: GasStation) => void;\\n  onRouteShop: (shop: RepairShop) => void;\\n  onRoutePolice: (station: PoliceStation) => void;\\n}\\n\\ntype Step2RowItem =\\n  | { kind: \'safe_station\'; distance: number; station: SafeStation }\\n  | { kind: \'repair_shop\'; distance: number; shop: RepairShop }\\n  | { kind: \'gas_station\'; distance: number; gasStation: GasStation }\\n  | { kind: \'police_station\'; distance: number; policeStation: PoliceStation };\\n\\nexport function Step2PlaceListPicker({\\n  mapFilter,\\n  stations,\\n  openRepairShops,\\n  gasStations,\\n  policeStations,\\n  selectedStationId,\\n  inspectedPlace,\\n  isLoadingRoute,\\n  onSelectSafeStation,\\n  onSelectGasStation,\\n  onRouteShop,\\n  onRoutePolice,\\n}: Step2PlaceListPickerProps) {\\n  const rows: Step2RowItem[] = [];\\n\\n  if (mapFilter === \'all\' || mapFilter === \'safe_stations\') {\\n    stations.forEach((station) =>\\n      rows.push({ kind: \'safe_station\', distance: station.walkingDistanceMeters, station }),\\n    );\\n  }\\n  if (mapFilter === \'all\' || mapFilter === \'repair_shops\') {\\n    openRepairShops.forEach((shop) =>\\n      rows.push({ kind: \'repair_shop\', distance: shop.distanceMeters, shop }),\\n    );\\n  }\\n  if (mapFilter === \'all\' || mapFilter === \'gas_stations\') {\\n    gasStations.slice(0, 4).forEach((gasStation) =>\\n      rows.push({ kind: \'gas_station\', distance: gasStation.walkingDistanceMeters, gasStation }),\\n    );\\n  }\\n  if (mapFilter === \'all\' || mapFilter === \'police_stations\') {\\n    policeStations.slice(0, 4).forEach((policeStation) =>\\n      rows.push({ kind: \'police_station\', distance: policeStation.distanceMeters, policeStation }),\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  rows.sort((a, b) => a.distance - b.distance);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"mt-2 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/75 p-2\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-1.5 pb-1\\\">\\n        <p className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700\\\">\\n          \304\220\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m g\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n (ch\341\273\215n \304\221\341\273\203 v\341\272\275 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng &amp; li\303\252n h\341\273\207):\\n        </p>\\n        {isLoadingRoute && (\\n          <Loader2\\n            className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-spin text-emerald-600\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"\304\220ang t\303\254m tuy\341\272\277n \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng\\\"\\n          />\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div\\n        data-testid=\\\"step2-place-list\\\"\\n        className=\\\"max-h-[210px] space-y-2 overflow-y-auto pr-1 [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:w-1 [&::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb]:rounded-full [&::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb]:bg-slate-300\\\"\\n      >\\n        {rows.map((row) => {\\n          if (row.kind === \'repair_shop\') {\\n            const shop = row.shop;\\n            const active = inspectedPlace?.kind === \'repair_shop\' && inspectedPlace.shop.id === shop.id;\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={`rs-${shop.id}`}\\n                data-testid={`step2-shop-${shop.id}`}\\n                className={`rounded-xl border px-2.5 py-2 transition-colors ${\\n                  active ? \'border-blue-500 bg-white shadow-xs\' : \'border-slate-200/70 bg-white hover:border-blue-300\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex min-w-0 items-start gap-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-blue-600\\\">\\n                    <Wrench className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                  </span>\\n                  <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                    <p className=\\\"truncate text-xs font-bold text-slate-900\\\">{shop.name}</p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"truncate font-sans text-[11px] tabular-nums text-slate-500\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-emerald-600\\\">\342\227\217 \304\220ang m\341\273\237</span> \302\267 {formatShopDistanceLabel(shop.distanceMeters, shop.rideMinutes)}\\n                    </p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-0.5 font-sans text-[11px] font-bold tabular-nums text-blue-700\\\">S\304\220T: {shop.phone}</p>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  <a\\n                    href={`tel:${shop.phone.replace(/\\\\s+/g, \'\')}`}\\n                    className=\\\"inline-flex h-7 flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 px-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-700 ring-1 ring-inset ring-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-100 whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <Phone className=\\\"h-3 w-3 shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                    <span>{formatShortCallLabel(shop.phone)}</span>\\n                  </a>\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => onRouteShop(shop)}\\n                    className={`inline-flex h-7 flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-2 text-[11px] font-bold whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                      active ? \'bg-blue-600 text-white\' : \'bg-slate-900 text-white hover:bg-slate-800\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <Navigation className=\\\"h-3 w-3 shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                    <span>\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            );\\n          }\\n\\n          if (row.kind === \'police_station\') {\\n            const p = row.policeStation;\\n            const active = inspectedPlace?.kind === \'police_station\' && inspectedPlace.policeStation.id === p.id;\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={`ps-${p.id}`}\\n                className={`flex items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-xl border px-2.5 py-2 transition-colors ${\\n                  active ? \'border-indigo-500 bg-white shadow-xs\' : \'border-slate-200/70 bg-white hover:border-indigo-300\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <button type=\\\"button\\\" onClick={() => onRoutePolice(p)} className=\\\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2 text-left\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700\\\">\\n                    <Shield className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                  </span>\\n                  <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                    <p className=\\\"truncate text-xs font-bold text-slate-900\\\">{p.name}</p>\\n                    <p className=\\\"truncate font-sans text-[11px] tabular-nums text-indigo-700\\\">\\n                      C\303\264ng an \302\267 {formatPoliceDistanceLabel(p.distanceMeters, p.durationMinutes)}\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => onRoutePolice(p)}\\n                  className={`inline-flex h-7 shrink-0 items-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-2 text-[11px] font-bold whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                    active ? \'bg-indigo-700 text-white\' : \'bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 hover:bg-indigo-100\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <Navigation className=\\\"h-3 w-3\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n                  <span>\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            );\\n          }\\n\\n          const isSafe = row.kind === \'safe_station\';\\n          const item = isSafe ? row.station : row.gasStation;\\n          const active = isSafe\\n            ? selectedStationId === item.id || (inspectedPlace?.kind === \'safe_station\' && inspectedPlace.station.id === item.id)\\n            : inspectedPlace?.kind === \'gas_station\' && inspectedPlace.gasStation.id === item.id;\\n          const onPick = () => (isSafe ? onSelectSafeStation(row.station) : onSelectGasStation(row.gasStation));\\n\\n          return (\\n            <div\\n              key={`${isSafe ? \'ss\' : \'gs\'}-${item.id}`}\\n              className={`flex items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-xl border px-2.5 py-2 transition-colors ${\\n                active\\n                  ? isSafe ? \'border-emerald-500 bg-white shadow-xs\' : \'border-amber-500 bg-white shadow-xs\'\\n                  : isSafe ? \'border-slate-200/70 bg-white hover:border-emerald-300\' : \'border-slate-200/70 bg-white hover:border-amber-300\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <button type=\\\"button\\\" onClick={onPick} className=\\\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2 text-left\\\">\\n                <span className={`flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg ${isSafe ? \'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600\' : \'bg-amber-50 text-amber-600\'}`}>\\n                  {isSafe ? <ShieldCheck className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" /> : <Fuel className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />}\\n                </span>\\n                <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"truncate text-xs font-bold text-slate-900\\\">{item.name}</p>\\n                  <p className={`truncate font-sans text-[11px] tabular-nums ${isSafe ? \'text-emerald-700\' : \'text-amber-700\'}`}>\\n                    {isSafe ? \'Tr\341\272\241m 24/7\' : \'C\303\242y x\304\203ng\'} \302\267 {formatWalkingDistance(item.walkingDistanceMeters, item.walkingMinutes)}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={onPick}\\n                className={`inline-flex h-7 shrink-0 items-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-2 text-[11px] font-bold whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                  active\\n                    ? isSafe ? \'bg-emerald-500 text-white\' : \'bg-amber-500 text-white\'\\n                    : isSafe ? \'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-100\' : \'bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 hover:bg-amber-100\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {active && isSafe ? <Check className=\\\"h-3 w-3\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" /> : <Navigation className=\\\"h-3 w-3\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />}\\n                <span>{active && isSafe ? \'\304\220ang ch\341\273\215n\' : \'\304\220\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i\'}</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Support police_stations inside Step2PlaceListPicker while compacting code under 220 lines\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/steps/Step2PlaceListPicker.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating Step2PlaceListPicker with police support\", \"toolSummary\":\"Step2PlaceListPicker update\"}"
