  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 6
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: **MotoSOS** \342\200\224 mobile-first motorbike rescue & 24/7 Safe Station web app (React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind CSS v4 + TypeScript + MapLibre GL + CARTO Positron + Geoapify + OSRM + `motion/react`), rendered in a centered `430px` phone shell (`max-w-[430px] h-[100dvh]`) on `bg-slate-900`.\n- **Previously Completed in Earlier Turns (Verified & Clean)**:\n  1. Map Tab & Step 2 UX upgrades (non-obscured `max-h-[210px]` Step 2 place list, `BottomSheetShell` Collapse/Expand button, 3-pin `\"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"` mode, OSRM routes + `FloatingPlaceCard`, deterministic VN shop phone numbers).\n  2. Seamless One-Way Infinite Loop carousels for `CampaignBannerCarousel` (`3.5s` auto-step, `useCarouselInteraction` with `>6px` drag threshold & `1.5s` resume delay) and `PartnerPerksCarousel` (`0.5px/frame` RAF continuous glide).\n  3. Full **C\303\264ng an (Police Stations)** feature (`policeStationApi.ts`, `usePoliceStationState.ts`, `PoliceStationListSheet.tsx`, `#4338ca` Indigo OSRM route, Indigo Shield markers with `\"G\341\272\247n nh\341\272\245t\"`, `G\341\273\215i kh\341\272\251n c\341\272\245p 113`, 4-layer `\"T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"` mode).\n- **Current Active User Request (Planning Complete \342\200\224 Zero Code Edits Started Yet)**:\n  Preserve all existing UI & features and implement a complete **Push Notifications & Synchronized Notification Center** system (every file strictly `< 250` lines):\n  1. **Global Notification Management (`NotificationProvider` / `useNotifications`)**:\n     - Store `{ id, title, message, type: \'rescue\' | \'promo\' | \'safety\' | \'chat\', timestamp, isRead, targetTab }`, browser notification `permission`, `pushEnabled`, and `triggerNotification(...)`.\n     - Seed 2 initial unread notifications:\n       - *\"Ch\303\240o m\341\273\253ng t\341\273\233i MotoSOS Priority \342\200\224 T\341\272\267ng m\303\243 BANMOI25 gi\341\272\243m 25.000\304\221\"* (`promo`, `targetTab: \'home\'`)\n       - *\"C\341\272\243nh b\303\241o an to\303\240n \304\221\303\252m: Lu\303\264n \306\260u ti\303\252n ch\341\273\235 th\341\273\243 t\341\272\241i Tr\341\272\241m An To\303\240n 24/7\"* (`safety`, `targetTab: \'safety\'`)\n  2. **System Push (`Notification` API) + Dynamic Island Banner + Web Audio Chime**:\n     - Request `Notification.requestPermission()` when user taps enable push OR submits their first rescue order.\n     - Every `triggerNotification(...)` call:\n       - Plays a subtle 2-note Web Audio chime via `AudioContext` (safe `try/catch`, no external mp3).\n       - Fires `new Notification(title, { body: message })` when `pushEnabled && Notification.permission === \'granted\'`.\n       - Displays an **In-App Floating Push Banner** sliding down smoothly from the top of the `430px` phone shell (`bg-slate-950/95 text-white backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-white/10 p-3.5 z-[100]`), auto-dismissing after 4s, supporting swipe-up/dismiss or tap-to-open `targetTab`.\n  3. **Wire All 7 App Lifecycle Triggers Automatically**:\n     1. Order confirmed (`handleConfirmRescue`): `\"\304\220\303\243 g\341\273\255i y\303\252u c\341\272\247u c\341\273\251u h\341\273\231\"` + order code & selected issue (`type: \'rescue\'`, `targetTab: \'map\'`).\n     2. `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` mechanic accepted (`handleDemoAdvance` -> `\'accepted\'`): `\"Th\341\273\243 Tu\341\272\245n (4.9\342\230\205) \304\221\303\243 nh\341\272\255n \304\221\306\241n\"` + license plate & ETA (`type: \'rescue\'`, `targetTab: \'map\'`).\n     3. Mechanic reaches **75%** route progress (`useRescueMapMechanicOverlay` -> ~1 min left, guarded once per route): `\"Th\341\273\243 ch\341\273\211 c\303\262n c\303\241ch b\341\272\241n kho\341\272\243ng 200m, vui l\303\262ng ch\303\272 \303\275 \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i\"` (`type: \'rescue\'`, `targetTab: \'map\'`).\n     4. Mechanic arrives at pickup (`handleMechanicArrived`): `\"Th\341\273\243 s\341\273\255a xe \304\221\303\243 t\341\273\233i \304\221i\341\273\203m h\341\272\271n!\"` (`type: \'rescue\'`, `targetTab: \'map\'`).\n     5. Mechanic auto-reply in chat (`useMechanicSimulation`): `\"Tin nh\341\272\257n m\341\273\233i t\341\273\253 Th\341\273\243 Tu\341\272\245n\"` + reply text (`type: \'chat\'`, `targetTab: \'map\'`).\n     6. Voucher applied (`ANTOAN20`, `BANMOI25`, `DEMKHUYA15`, via banner/perk or Step 2 voucher selection): `\"\303\201p d\341\273\245ng \306\260u \304\221\303\243i th\303\240nh c\303\264ng\"` + discount amount (`type: \'promo\'`, `targetTab: \'map\'`).\n     7. `\"G\341\273\255i SOS\"` pressed (`handleQuickSos`): `\"\304\220\303\243 k\303\255ch ho\341\272\241t ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\231 SOS & chia s\341\272\273 t\341\273\215a \304\221\341\273\231 GPS hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i\"` (`type: \'safety\'`, `targetTab: \'map\'`).\n  4. **Header Bell Button & `NotificationCenterModal`**:\n     - Place a frosted-glass `Bell` button right beside `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` on `HomeTab`\'s Obsidian header, with a red unread badge (`bg-rose-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold`).\n     - Opening `NotificationCenterModal` displays:\n       - Quick toggle bar `\"Nh\341\272\255n th\303\264ng b\303\241o \304\221\341\272\251y tr\303\252n thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213\"` (`\304\220\303\243 b\341\272\255t` / `B\341\272\255t ngay`).\n       - Filter tabs (`T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243`, `C\341\273\251u h\341\273\231`, `\306\257u \304\221\303\243i`, `An to\303\240n`) + `\"\304\220\303\241nh d\341\272\245u \304\221\303\243 \304\221\341\273\215c t\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"`.\n       - Full notification list (unread items styled with light emerald tint + emerald dot; tapping marks read and navigates to `item.targetTab`).\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Current Workspace State\n- Workspace is clean (`npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts` passes **46/46** tests, `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` pass, no `.playwright-cli` or `_verify` scratch directories left behind).\n- **No code edits for Push Notifications have been written yet.**\n- **Files Inspected & Ready to Edit**:\n  - `/src/main.tsx` (6 lines \342\200\224 ideal place to wrap `<App />` in `<NotificationProvider>`, keeping `App.tsx` compact)\n  - `/src/App.tsx` (180 lines \342\200\224 renders `HomeTab`, `MapTabView`, `FloatingPushBanner`, `NotificationCenterModal`, etc.)\n  - `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx` (202 lines \342\200\224 Obsidian header where `Bell` button sits next to `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` on lines 119\342\200\223127)\n  - `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts` (234 lines \342\200\224 order confirm, demo advance, quick SOS, voucher selection, promotions, arrival callback)\n  - `/src/hooks/useMechanicSimulation.ts` (178 lines \342\200\224 mechanic chat auto-reply timeout around lines 144\342\200\223162)\n  - `/src/hooks/useRescueMapMechanicOverlay.ts` (193 lines \342\200\224 `stepFrame` RAF loop tracking `progress` 0..1)\n  - `/src/components/RescueMap.tsx` (212 lines \342\200\224 forwards `onMechanicApproaching` prop from `MapTabView` to `useRescueMapMechanicOverlay`)\n  - `/src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx` (245 lines \342\200\224 caution: near 250-line limit!)\n  - `/src/data/mockRescueData.ts` (202 lines \342\200\224 `VOUCHER_OPTIONS`, `MOCK_MECHANIC`, etc.)\n\n### Skills Read in Session\n- `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md` (read)\n- `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md` (read)\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **File Line Limit Constraint**: User strictly enforces **every file `< 250` lines**. Watch `MapTabView.tsx` (245 lines), `RescueMap.tsx` (212 lines), and `useRescueOrderState.ts` (234 lines) when adding notification props/triggers \342\200\224 keep edits concise or extract pure helpers into `src/utils/notificationLogic.ts` and `src/utils/rescuePromoHelpers.ts` if needed.\n- **Wrapping `NotificationProvider` cleanly**: Wrapping `<App />` in `<NotificationProvider>` inside `/src/main.tsx` lets `useRescueOrderState` call `useNotifications()` directly without bloating `App.tsx`!\n- **75% Route Notification Guard**: In `useRescueMapMechanicOverlay.ts`, `stepFrame` runs at 60fps via `requestAnimationFrame`. Use a local boolean `let approachingNotified = false` inside the `useEffect` (checked at `progress >= 0.75 && progress < 1`) and store `onMechanicApproaching` in a ref (`useRef`) so adding the callback NEVER resets or restarts the `useEffect` RAF route animation! Same for `onMechanicMessage` in `useMechanicSimulation.ts` (store in `useRef` so changing callbacks never re-fetches OSRM routes).\n- **Safe Browser Notification & AudioContext in Headless/Unsupported Environments**: Always guard `\'Notification\' in window` and wrap `AudioContext` + `new window.Notification(...)` inside `try/catch` so Chromium headless never logs uncaught console errors when `Notification.permission === \'default\'` or `AudioContext` is blocked prior to gesture.\n- **Promo Notification Deduplication**: When user selects `ANTOAN20`, `BANMOI25`, or `DEMKHUYA15` via `setSelectedVoucherId` OR via `applyPromotion` (Home banner / perk), trigger `\"\303\201p d\341\273\245ng \306\260u \304\221\303\243i th\303\240nh c\303\264ng\"` via a centralized `handleSelectVoucher(voucherId)` + `applyPromotion(...)` in `useRescueOrderState.ts` (avoid double-firing or firing when `voucherId === null`).\n- **Chat Notification Filter Mapping**: Filter tab `\"C\341\273\251u h\341\273\231\"` should match both `\'rescue\'` and `\'chat\'` notification types so mechanic chat alerts remain visible under `\"C\341\273\251u h\341\273\231\"`.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n*(From earlier session rounds, resolved cleanly)*\n1. Fixed CSS `scroll-smooth` + `snap-x snap-mandatory` fighting RAF increments and 1x-DPR `scrollLeft` truncation in carousels via virtual float accumulation and explicit `behavior: \'instant\'` wrapping.\n2. Fixed `[role=\"tab\"]` selector for `MapFilterChips` in Playwright (`getByRole(\'tab\', ...)`).\n3. Kept `policeStationApi.ts` (186 lines) and `MapTabView.tsx` (245 lines) strictly under 250 lines.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Dev server is currently running updated Police Station code on port 3000 (`0` console errors).\n- `HomeTab.tsx` currently receives: `onOpenLocationSearch`, `onCallMechanicNow`, `onQuickIssueSelect`, `onQuickCategorySelect`, `onQuickSosSelect`, `onSelectStationCard`, `onOpenRepairShopsMap`, `onTriggerDemoMechanic`, `onSelectCampaignBanner`, `onSelectPartnerPerk`. Add `onOpenNotifications: () => void` cleanly; `HomeTab` can also read `unreadCount` directly from `useNotifications()` (or take `unreadCount` prop) so props stay minimal.\n- Inside `App.tsx`, `FloatingPushBanner` and `NotificationCenterModal` should render inside the `430px` phone shell (`<div className=\"relative mx-auto flex h-[100dvh] w-full max-w-[430px] ...\">`), ensuring the Dynamic Island banner (`z-[100]`) floats cleanly at the top edge of the phone viewport and `NotificationCenterModal` (`z-[90]`) stays framed inside the mobile shell.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Create Types, Pure Logic, Sound & Unit Tests** (in parallel):\n   - `/src/types/notification.ts`: `NotificationType`, `AppNotification`, `NotificationFilterTab`, `BrowserPushPermission`.\n   - `/src/utils/notificationLogic.ts`: `INITIAL_NOTIFICATIONS`, `filterNotifications`, `countUnreadNotifications`, `markNotificationRead`, `markAllNotificationsRead`, `createAppNotification`, `resolveOrderCode`.\n   - `/src/utils/notificationSound.ts`: `playNotificationChime()` (safe Web Audio API 2-note chime).\n   - `/src/utils/notificationLogic.test.ts`: `node:test` unit tests verifying initial seeds, unread counting, `\'rescue\'` filter including `\'chat\'`, single mark-read, mark-all-read, and record creation.\n2. **Create `NotificationContext` & Notification UI Components**:\n   - `/src/context/NotificationContext.tsx`: `NotificationProvider` & `useNotifications()` hook managing state, 4s auto-hide Dynamic Island timer, Web Audio chime, `Notification.requestPermission()`, `new Notification(...)`, `markAsRead`, `markAllAsRead`, `toggleDevicePush`.\n   - `/src/components/notifications/FloatingPushBanner.tsx`: Dark glass Dynamic Island push banner (`bg-slate-950/95 text-white backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-white/10 p-3.5 z-[100]`), swipe-up dismiss + click-to-navigate + close `X`, `data-testid=\"floating-push-banner\"`.\n   - `/src/components/notifications/NotificationCenterModal.tsx`: Modal/drawer with `data-testid=\"notification-center-modal\"`, push permission toggle bar (`\"Nh\341\272\255n th\303\264ng b\303\241o \304\221\341\272\251y tr\303\252n thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213\"`), filter tabs (`T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243` | `C\341\273\251u h\341\273\231` | `\306\257u \304\221\303\243i` | `An to\303\240n`), `\"\304\220\303\241nh d\341\272\245u \304\221\303\243 \304\221\341\273\215c t\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"`, and notification cards (unread highlight + dot, tap -> marks read & navigates to `targetTab`).\n3. **Wire Provider, Header Bell & All 7 App Triggers**:\n   - `/src/main.tsx`: Wrap `<App />` in `<NotificationProvider>`.\n   - `/src/components/tabs/HomeTab.tsx`: Add frosted Bell button (`data-testid=\"header-bell-btn\"`) beside `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` showing red unread badge (`bg-rose-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold`, `data-testid=\"header-bell-badge\"`).\n   - `/src/hooks/useRescueMapMechanicOverlay.ts`, `/src/components/RescueMap.tsx`, `/src/components/tabs/MapTabView.tsx`: Add `onMechanicApproaching` callback (using a ref inside `useRescueMapMechanicOverlay` to avoid breaking RAF dependencies) fired once at `progress >= 0.75`. Note: keep `MapTabView.tsx` strictly `< 250` lines (combine minor prop types/formatting if needed!).\n   - `/src/hooks/useMechanicSimulation.ts`: Add `onMechanicReply` callback (via ref) fired when mechanic sends auto-reply message after 1500ms.\n   - `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts`: Integrate `useNotifications()` cleanly (or invoke `triggerNotification` helper) for all 7 events:\n     1. Order confirmed + `requestPushPermission()` on first order\n     2. `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` mechanic accepted\n     3. 75% progress approaching (`~200m`)\n     4. Mechanic arrived\n     5. Mechanic chat reply\n     6. Promo voucher applied (`ANTOAN20`, `BANMOI25`, `DEMKHUYA15`)\n     7. `\"G\341\273\255i SOS\"` activated\n   - `/src/App.tsx`: Render `<FloatingPushBanner>` and `<NotificationCenterModal>`, wire Bell button & `onMechanicApproaching`, handle `onSelectNotification` navigation (`setActiveTab(item.targetTab)`).\n4. **Build, Lint, Test & Visual Browser Verification (`ultra-mode` + `computer-use`)**:\n   - Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/*.test.ts` AND verify `wc -l` across every modified/added file is `< 250` lines.\n   - Run `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` in parallel.\n   - Call `restart_dev_server`.\n   - Run `playwright-cli` at `430 900`:\n     - Verify Header Bell badge shows `\"2\"` unread on load, open `NotificationCenterModal`, test filter tabs (`T\341\272\245t c\341\272\243`, `C\341\273\251u h\341\273\231`, `\306\257u \304\221\303\243i`, `An to\303\240n`), `\"\304\220\303\241nh d\341\272\245u \304\221\303\243 \304\221\341\273\215c t\341\272\245t c\341\272\243\"` clears badge, and tap `\"Test th\341\273\243\"` / `\"G\341\273\255i SOS\"` / Voucher banner triggers **Dynamic Island FloatingPushBanner** (`[data-testid=\"floating-push-banner\"]`) and increments unread badge.\n     - Capture screenshots under `.playwright-cli/` (e.g. `notif-home-banner.png`, `notif-center-modal.png`), inspect them with `view_file`/command attachments, confirm 0 console errors (`playwright-cli console error`), then delete `.playwright-cli/`.\n5. **Final Response**: Concise Vietnamese summary without internal details or file paths.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Line Limit**: Every `.ts` / `.tsx` file under `src/` MUST be strictly `< 250` lines.\n- **UI Preservation**: Keep Obsidian Home Header, Clean Light Mode, GPS `activeLocation`, fixed prices, vouchers, Police/Gas/Repair filters, one-way infinite carousels, and 60fps yellow route-trimming animation intact.\n- **Language**: All UI text and final response in Vietnamese.\n- **Safety/Cleanliness**: No `window.alert` / `window.open`, no telemetry/debug UI, clean up `.playwright-cli` before finishing.\n</summary>"
