  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Line Counts**\n\nI\'m pleased to see that `MapTabView.tsx` remains under the target line count; that\'s progress. I\'m now turning my attention to updating `/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts` and `/src/App.tsx` concurrently. The focus is ensuring the line count of `useRescueOrderState.ts` does not go overboard.\n\n\n**Refining State Hook**\n\nI\'ve been working on `useRescueOrderState.ts` and am making good headway. I\'ve successfully imported `useNotifications` and `buildVoucherNotificationMessage`, keeping the line count down. Using `useCallback` for `handleMechanicReply` and passing it to `useMechanicSimulation` keeps things clean and manageable. This implementation leaves me with plenty of lines in the target.\n\n\n**Implementing Notifications**\n\nI\'m focused on integrating notifications now. I\'ve implemented `notifyVoucher` using `useCallback`, triggering a promo notification. Also, `handleSelectVoucher` uses `notifyVoucher` to trigger the notification. In `handleConfirmRescue`, I added a check for push permission and trigger a rescue notification after a timeout. Finally, in `handleDemoAdvance`, I trigger a notification when entering the \'accepted\' step.\n\n\n**Refining Arrival Logic**\n\nI\'m now refining the arrival notification system. I\'m considering the flow when the demo advances from \'accepted\' to \'arrived\'. I\'m also thinking of how to handle the \"Test th\341\273\243\" tap that fast-forwards arrival. I\'m focusing on ensuring the arrival notification fires correctly in all scenarios and considering using a `useEffect` on `[step, trackingStatus]` or a `prevStatusRef` for efficient implementation. The goal is to notify when the mechanic arrives, but only once.\n\n\n**Finalizing Arrival Logic**\n\nI\'ve got the arrival notification logic ironed out. Using `useEffect` and `prevTrackingStatusRef`, I\'m confident the notification fires correctly whether the mechanic arrives naturally or via \"Test th\341\273\243\". I\'m triggering a notification with the title \"Th\341\273\243 s\341\273\255a xe \304\221\303\243 t\341\273\233i \304\221i\341\273\203m h\341\272\271n!\" and a message that mentions the mechanic and location. Also, I\'ve added a call for the `handleMechanicApproaching` and `handleQuickSos` functions.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6175765859790899735"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Integrate all 7 lifecycle push notification triggers into useRescueOrderState\", \"Instruction\":\"Import useNotifications and buildVoucherNotificationMessage, wire order confirm, demo accept, 75% approaching, arrival, mechanic chat reply, promo voucher, and SOS notifications\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":15, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import { useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { useNotifications } from \'../context/NotificationContext\';\\nimport type { CampaignBannerItem, PartnerPerkItem } from \'../data/homePromotions\';\\nimport { FALLBACK_USER_LOCATION, INITIAL_ACTIVITY_HISTORY, ISSUE_OPTIONS, MOCK_MECHANIC, MOCK_SAFE_STATIONS, VOUCHER_OPTIONS } from \'../data/mockRescueData\';\\nimport type { AppTab, GasStation, IssueType, LocationSuggestion, MapLayerFilter, PickupMode, RescueActivityItem, RescueStep, SafeStation, SafeStationCategory, TrackingStatus, VoucherId } from \'../types/rescue\';\\nimport { gasStationToSafeStation } from \'../utils/gasStationApi\';\\nimport { buildVoucherNotificationMessage } from \'../utils/notificationLogic\';\\nimport { calculateRescuePricing, formatVnd } from \'../utils/pricingAndSimLogic\';\\nimport { buildMechanicApproachCoord, findStationByCategory, getIssueLabel, getNearestSafeStation, getNextDemoTrackingStatus, resolvePickupTarget } from \'../utils/rescueLogic\';\\nimport { useActivePlaceInspect } from \'./useActivePlaceInspect\';\\nimport { useGasStationState } from \'./useGasStationState\';\\nimport { useMapPinPicker } from \'./useMapPinPicker\';\\nimport { useMechanicSimulation } from \'./useMechanicSimulation\';\\nimport { usePoliceStationState } from \'./usePoliceStationState\';\\nimport { useRepairShopState } from \'./useRepairShopState\';\\nimport { useRescueGeo } from \'./useRescueGeo\';\", \"StartLine\":1, \"TargetContent\":\"import { useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport type { CampaignBannerItem, PartnerPerkItem } from \'../data/homePromotions\';\\nimport { FALLBACK_USER_LOCATION, INITIAL_ACTIVITY_HISTORY, ISSUE_OPTIONS, MOCK_MECHANIC, MOCK_SAFE_STATIONS, VOUCHER_OPTIONS } from \'../data/mockRescueData\';\\nimport type { AppTab, GasStation, IssueType, LocationSuggestion, MapLayerFilter, PickupMode, RescueActivityItem, RescueStep, SafeStation, SafeStationCategory, TrackingStatus, VoucherId } from \'../types/rescue\';\\nimport { gasStationToSafeStation } from \'../utils/gasStationApi\';\\nimport { calculateRescuePricing, formatVnd } from \'../utils/pricingAndSimLogic\';\\nimport { buildMechanicApproachCoord, findStationByCategory, getIssueLabel, getNearestSafeStation, getNextDemoTrackingStatus, resolvePickupTarget } from \'../utils/rescueLogic\';\\nimport { useActivePlaceInspect } from \'./useActivePlaceInspect\';\\nimport { useGasStationState } from \'./useGasStationState\';\\nimport { useMapPinPicker } from \'./useMapPinPicker\';\\nimport { useMechanicSimulation } from \'./useMechanicSimulation\';\\nimport { usePoliceStationState } from \'./usePoliceStationState\';\\nimport { useRepairShopState } from \'./useRepairShopState\';\\nimport { useRescueGeo } from \'./useRescueGeo\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":35, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [activeStationForRoute, setActiveStationForRoute] = useState<SafeStation | null>(null);\\n  const [chosenGasSafeStation, setChosenGasSafeStation] = useState<SafeStation | null>(null);\\n  const submitTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n  const hasRequestedPushRef = useRef(false);\\n  const prevStatusRef = useRef<TrackingStatus>(\'searching\');\\n  const { triggerNotification, requestPushPermission } = useNotifications();\\n\\n  useEffect(() => () => { if (submitTimerRef.current !== null) window.clearTimeout(submitTimerRef.current); }, []);\", \"StartLine\":30, \"TargetContent\":\"  const [activeStationForRoute, setActiveStationForRoute] = useState<SafeStation | null>(null);\\n  const [chosenGasSafeStation, setChosenGasSafeStation] = useState<SafeStation | null>(null);\\n  const submitTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => () => { if (submitTimerRef.current !== null) window.clearTimeout(submitTimerRef.current); }, []);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":72, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const handleMechanicReply = useCallback(\\n    (replyText: string) => triggerNotification({ title: \'Tin nh\341\272\257n m\341\273\233i t\341\273\253 Th\341\273\243 Tu\341\272\245n\', message: replyText, type: \'chat\', targetTab: \'map\' }),\\n    [triggerNotification],\\n  );\\n  const mechanicSim = useMechanicSimulation({\\n    step, trackingStatus, mechanicStartCoord,\\n    pickupCoord: pickupTarget.coord, pickupTitle: pickupTarget.title, mechanicName: MOCK_MECHANIC.name, onMechanicReply: handleMechanicReply,\\n  });\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (step === \'tracking\' && trackingStatus === \'arrived\' && prevStatusRef.current !== \'arrived\') {\\n      triggerNotification({ title: \'Th\341\273\243 s\341\273\255a xe \304\221\303\243 t\341\273\233i \304\221i\341\273\203m h\341\272\271n!\', message: `${MOCK_MECHANIC.name} \304\221ang ch\341\273\235 b\341\272\241n t\341\272\241i ${pickupTarget.title}.`, type: \'rescue\', targetTab: \'map\' });\\n    }\\n    prevStatusRef.current = trackingStatus;\\n  }, [step, trackingStatus, pickupTarget.title, triggerNotification]);\", \"StartLine\":68, \"TargetContent\":\"  const mechanicSim = useMechanicSimulation({\\n    step, trackingStatus, mechanicStartCoord,\\n    pickupCoord: pickupTarget.coord, pickupTitle: pickupTarget.title, mechanicName: MOCK_MECHANIC.name,\\n  });\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":118, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const notifyVoucher = useCallback((vId: VoucherId | null) => {\\n    if (vId) triggerNotification({ title: \'\303\201p d\341\273\245ng \306\260u \304\221\303\243i th\303\240nh c\303\264ng\', message: buildVoucherNotificationMessage(vId, VOUCHER_OPTIONS), type: \'promo\', targetTab: \'map\' });\\n  }, [triggerNotification]);\\n\\n  const handleSelectVoucher = useCallback((vId: VoucherId | null) => {\\n    setSelectedVoucherId(vId); notifyVoucher(vId);\\n  }, [notifyVoucher]);\\n\\n  const handleConfirmRescue = () => {\\n    if (!hasRequestedPushRef.current) { hasRequestedPushRef.current = true; void requestPushPermission(); }\\n    setIsSubmitting(true);\\n    submitTimerRef.current = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      activeInspect.clearInspection();\\n      setIsSubmitting(false); setTrackingStatus(\'searching\'); setStep(\'tracking\');\\n      triggerNotification({ title: \'\304\220\303\243 g\341\273\255i y\303\252u c\341\272\247u c\341\273\251u h\341\273\231\', message: `\304\220\306\241n #MS-${String(Date.now()).slice(-4)} \302\267 ${issueSummary}`, type: \'rescue\', targetTab: \'map\' });\\n    }, 400);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDemoAdvance = () => {\\n    activeInspect.clearInspection();\\n    setActiveTab(\'map\');\\n    if (step !== \'tracking\') {\\n      if (!selectedIssue) setSelectedIssue(\'flat_tire\');\\n      setTrackingStatus(\'accepted\'); setStep(\'tracking\');\\n      triggerNotification({ title: \'Th\341\273\243 Tu\341\272\245n (4.9\342\230\205) \304\221\303\243 nh\341\272\255n \304\221\306\241n\', message: `Bi\341\273\203n s\341\273\221 ${MOCK_MECHANIC.licensePlate} \302\267 D\341\273\261 ki\341\272\277n ${MOCK_MECHANIC.etaMinutes} ph\303\272t t\341\273\233i`, type: \'rescue\', targetTab: \'map\' });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (trackingStatus === \'completed\') return handleCompleteAndLog();\\n    setTrackingStatus((prev) => getNextDemoTrackingStatus(prev));\\n  };\", \"StartLine\":99, \"TargetContent\":\"  const handleConfirmRescue = () => {\\n    setIsSubmitting(true);\\n    submitTimerRef.current = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      activeInspect.clearInspection();\\n      setIsSubmitting(false); setTrackingStatus(\'searching\'); setStep(\'tracking\');\\n    }, 400);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDemoAdvance = () => {\\n    activeInspect.clearInspection();\\n    setActiveTab(\'map\');\\n    if (step !== \'tracking\') {\\n      if (!selectedIssue) setSelectedIssue(\'flat_tire\');\\n      setTrackingStatus(\'accepted\'); setStep(\'tracking\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (trackingStatus === \'completed\') return handleCompleteAndLog();\\n    setTrackingStatus((prev) => getNextDemoTrackingStatus(prev));\\n  };\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":191, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const handleSelectGasStationForRescue = (station: GasStation) => {\\n    const safe = gasStationToSafeStation(station);\\n    setChosenGasSafeStation(safe); setSelectedStationId(safe.id);\\n    setPickupMode(\'safe_station\'); handleSelectVoucher(\'ANTOAN20\');\\n    setEnteredFromQuickStations(true);\\n    if (step === \'idle\') setStep(\'pickup\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleQuickCategory = (category: SafeStationCategory) =>\\n    category === \'gas_station\'\\n      ? handleOpenMapWithGasStations()\\n      : category === \'police\'\\n        ? handleOpenMapWithPoliceStations()\\n        : handleOpenMapWithStation(findStationByCategory(geo.stations, category)?.id ?? \'\');\\n\\n  const handleQuickIssue = (issue: IssueType) => {\\n    clearOverlays(false); setSelectedIssue(issue);\\n    setEnteredFromQuickStations(false); setStep(\'issue\'); setActiveTab(\'map\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleQuickSos = () => {\\n    clearOverlays(false); setSelectedIssue(\'other\'); setCustomNote(\'SOS kh\341\272\251n c\341\272\245p ban \304\221\303\252m\');\\n    handleChangePickupMode(\'current_location\'); setEnteredFromQuickStations(false);\\n    setStep(\'pickup\'); setActiveTab(\'map\');\\n    triggerNotification({ title: \'\304\220\303\243 k\303\255ch ho\341\272\241t ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\231 SOS\', message: `\304\220\303\243 chia s\341\272\273 t\341\273\215a \304\221\341\273\231 GPS hi\341\273\207n t\341\272\241i (${geo.userLocation.address}) \304\221\341\273\203 h\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 kh\341\272\251n c\341\272\245p.`, type: \'safety\', targetTab: \'map\' });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleMechanicApproaching = useCallback(() => {\\n    triggerNotification({ title: \'Th\341\273\243 s\341\272\257p t\341\273\233i \304\221i\341\273\203m h\341\272\271n\', message: \'Th\341\273\243 ch\341\273\211 c\303\262n c\303\241ch b\341\272\241n kho\341\272\243ng 200m, vui l\303\262ng ch\303\272 \303\275 \304\221i\341\273\207n tho\341\272\241i\', type: \'rescue\', targetTab: \'map\' });\\n  }, [triggerNotification]);\\n\\n  const handleMechanicArrived = useCallback(() => {\\n    setTrackingStatus((prev) => (prev === \'accepted\' ? \'arrived\' : prev));\\n  }, []);\", \"StartLine\":162, \"TargetContent\":\"  const handleSelectGasStationForRescue = (station: GasStation) => {\\n    const safe = gasStationToSafeStation(station);\\n    setChosenGasSafeStation(safe); setSelectedStationId(safe.id);\\n    setPickupMode(\'safe_station\'); setSelectedVoucherId(\'ANTOAN20\');\\n    setEnteredFromQuickStations(true);\\n    if (step === \'idle\') setStep(\'pickup\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleQuickCategory = (category: SafeStationCategory) =>\\n    category === \'gas_station\'\\n      ? handleOpenMapWithGasStations()\\n      : category === \'police\'\\n        ? handleOpenMapWithPoliceStations()\\n        : handleOpenMapWithStation(findStationByCategory(geo.stations, category)?.id ?? \'\');\\n\\n  const handleQuickIssue = (issue: IssueType) => {\\n    clearOverlays(false); setSelectedIssue(issue);\\n    setEnteredFromQuickStations(false); setStep(\'issue\'); setActiveTab(\'map\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleQuickSos = () => {\\n    clearOverlays(false); setSelectedIssue(\'other\'); setCustomNote(\'SOS kh\341\272\251n c\341\272\245p ban \304\221\303\252m\');\\n    handleChangePickupMode(\'current_location\'); setEnteredFromQuickStations(false);\\n    setStep(\'pickup\'); setActiveTab(\'map\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleMechanicArrived = useCallback(() => {\\n    setTrackingStatus((prev) => (prev === \'accepted\' ? \'arrived\' : prev));\\n  }, []);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":234, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const applyPromotion = (voucherId: VoucherId | null, targetMode?: PickupMode, targetIssue?: IssueType, targetStep: RescueStep = \'issue\') => {\\n    clearOverlays(false); setSelectedIssue(targetIssue ?? null);\\n    setPickupMode(targetMode ?? \'current_location\'); setSelectedVoucherId(voucherId);\\n    setEnteredFromQuickStations(false); setStep(targetStep); setActiveTab(\'map\');\\n    notifyVoucher(voucherId);\\n  };\\n\\n  return {\\n    activeTab, setActiveTab, step, setStep, selectedIssue, setSelectedIssue,\\n    customNote, setCustomNote, pickupMode, handleChangePickupMode,\\n    selectedVoucherId, handleSelectVoucher, selectedStationId, setSelectedStationId,\\n    trackingStatus, isSubmitting, enteredFromQuickStations, setEnteredFromQuickStations,\\n    isLocationSearchOpen, setIsLocationSearchOpen, recenterSignal,\\n    triggerRecenter: () => setRecenterSignal((c) => c + 1),\\n    activityHistory, geo, repairShops, gasStations, policeStations, activeInspect, pinPicker,\\n    effectiveStations, pickupTarget, issueSummary, pricing, mechanicSim,\\n    handleResetFlow, handleCompleteAndLog, handleConfirmRescue, handleDemoAdvance,\\n    handleMechanicApproaching, handleMechanicArrived, handleOpenMapWithStation, handleOpenMapWithRepairShop,\\n    handleChangeMapFilter, handleSelectGasStationForRescue, handlePickSafeStationForRescue,\\n    handleQuickCategory, handleQuickIssue, handleQuickSos, handleStartMapPinPicker,\\n    handleConfirmMapPinPicker, handleSelectSearchLocation, handleResetToGpsLocation,\\n    handleSelectCampaignBanner: (b: CampaignBannerItem) => applyPromotion(b.voucherId, b.targetPickupMode, b.targetIssue, b.targetStep),\\n    handleSelectPartnerPerk: (p: PartnerPerkItem) => applyPromotion(p.voucherId, p.targetPickupMode, undefined, \'issue\'),\\n  };\\n}\", \"StartLine\":211, \"TargetContent\":\"  const applyPromotion = (voucherId: VoucherId | null, targetMode?: PickupMode, targetIssue?: IssueType, targetStep: RescueStep = \'issue\') => {\\n    clearOverlays(false); setSelectedIssue(targetIssue ?? null);\\n    setPickupMode(targetMode ?? \'current_location\'); setSelectedVoucherId(voucherId);\\n    setEnteredFromQuickStations(false); setStep(targetStep); setActiveTab(\'map\');\\n  };\\n\\n  return {\\n    activeTab, setActiveTab, step, setStep, selectedIssue, setSelectedIssue,\\n    customNote, setCustomNote, pickupMode, handleChangePickupMode,\\n    selectedVoucherId, setSelectedVoucherId, selectedStationId, setSelectedStationId,\\n    trackingStatus, isSubmitting, enteredFromQuickStations, setEnteredFromQuickStations,\\n    isLocationSearchOpen, setIsLocationSearchOpen, recenterSignal,\\n    triggerRecenter: () => setRecenterSignal((c) => c + 1),\\n    activityHistory, geo, repairShops, gasStations, policeStations, activeInspect, pinPicker,\\n    effectiveStations, pickupTarget, issueSummary, pricing, mechanicSim,\\n    handleResetFlow, handleCompleteAndLog, handleConfirmRescue, handleDemoAdvance,\\n    handleMechanicArrived, handleOpenMapWithStation, handleOpenMapWithRepairShop,\\n    handleChangeMapFilter, handleSelectGasStationForRescue, handlePickSafeStationForRescue,\\n    handleQuickCategory, handleQuickIssue, handleQuickSos, handleStartMapPinPicker,\\n    handleConfirmMapPinPicker, handleSelectSearchLocation, handleResetToGpsLocation,\\n    handleSelectCampaignBanner: (b: CampaignBannerItem) => applyPromotion(b.voucherId, b.targetPickupMode, b.targetIssue, b.targetStep),\\n    handleSelectPartnerPerk: (p: PartnerPerkItem) => applyPromotion(p.voucherId, p.targetPickupMode, undefined, \'issue\'),\\n  };\\n}\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/hooks/useRescueOrderState.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Integrating 7 notification triggers in useRescueOrderState\", \"toolSummary\":\"Wire notification triggers\"}"
